      "content": "<!-- url: https://adastat.net/_meta/drep/vote12-50.jsonld -->\r\n# AdaStat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for UTxO RPC Sustaining Cardano Blockchain Integration\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfe9en4hsgc3r6nhtmwjeljh06hgnvt9yzzkwqcftvdj34cdxdg7u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a DRep, I voted for all projects in the 2025 budget vote based on a very simple principle:\\n\\n- Yes if I believe the long-term value to the Cardano ecosystem exceeds the requested amount;\\n- No if it doesn't;\\n- Abstain if I'm unsure.\\n\\nAll of my votes are consistent with [my position in the May 2025 Ekklesia round](https://2025budget.intersectmbo.org/voters/drep1yfe9en4hsgc3r6nhtmwjeljh06hgnvt9yzzkwqcftvdj34cdxdg7u).",
