      "voter": "Kyle Solomon",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adosiawolf/drep-rationale/refs/heads/main/0017 -->\r\n# Kyle Solomon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for UTxO RPC Sustaining Cardano Blockchain Integration\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytzshxuma6cwrnlv2ucyclfqw3k4nu4nuudmh2z87j9hncsk9dhy4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have voted YES on the current proposal to fund UTxO RPC by TxPipe. UTxO RPC simplifies interactions with UTxO-based blockchains by providing a standardized interface for blockchain integrations. Given Cardarno is one of the most popular eUtX0 chains, simplification tools are an absolute must in regards to dev-centric tech proliferations",
