      "voter": "No stress",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQLLbTU9FCA7a2SjRV44VsBFfrnLV7Ujiu55Gpp9eTcAo -->\r\n# No stress\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for UTxO RPC Sustaining Cardano Blockchain Integration\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2t3t35yx7j8nnh3wkqn2zzhgwqksksn85zv62pjrwzjawczwgyv7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is a small cost for an open-source project and I have confirmed it will help Mesh with their UTxo RPC provider.",
