      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmX9KxDq9MsaGbULbaHSy35NTSpUnkT9DAtHpb4DjgGHpc -->\r\n# wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for UTxO RPC Sustaining Cardano Blockchain Integration\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfa8r8r36x7x05htftce7qhafrn5nzzr6vazy95pzy6y5dqac0ss7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNote: I am part of the working group and Blink Labs maintains the Go SDK so we get secondary benefits as we are including UTxO RPC in much of our tooling.",
