      "voter": "No stress",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmNamx75uwiR44v87sg45XJ62JU5kCJQuT8wBcgc4bSWBi -->\r\n# No stress\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳300,000 for Ledger App Rewrite administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2t3t35yx7j8nnh3wkqn2zzhgwqksksn85zv62pjrwzjawczwgyv7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nLedger is a provider that cuts across chains and this is a good investment.",
