    {
      "voter": "Patrick_Tobler",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPeQZqH7o8LuFB2ENCRKM1kGQPnSrxWm4yywxUyXCoQKw -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳300,000 for Ledger App Rewrite administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA reasonable ask for important tooling.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
