      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adosiawolf/drep-rationale/refs/heads/main/0015 -->\r\n# Kyle Solomon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for Pallas Sustaining Critical Rust Tooling for Cardano\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytzshxuma6cwrnlv2ucyclfqw3k4nu4nuudmh2z87j9hncsk9dhy4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have voted YES on the current proposal to fund TxPipe Pallas. Pallas is now a critical Rust-native foundation for Cardano development and both open source maintenence and TxPipe talent retention are important to the success of Cardano",
