      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdhVNYWG82pZcyqdrkbFRmbhb6QQA5NNrhbtYhULNBrnD -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for Pallas Sustaining Critical Rust Tooling for Cardano\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA reasonable ask for good tooling.",
