      "voter": "DeepStatecraft",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUJzRH1mgoPUDi5kSCE5ypnXP6zcxenUyXtYtbgDvM2xL -->\r\n# DeepStatecraft\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,300,000 for Blockfrost Platform community budget proposal\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfr0cur4guksjd6whxe5mltcaksqqhzd85dnq6lfk8ex7qs5mlcye`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n✅ Blockfrost Platform – ₳1,300,000\r\n\r\nWhy I voted YES:\r\nBlockfrost has become essential infrastructure for Cardano developers, abstracting node interaction and enabling rapid dApp development. This proposal takes a critical step forward: decentralizing the Blockfrost API through the Icebreakers network—a system that lets SPOs process requests and earn rewards.\r\n\r\nKey deliverables include:\r\n\t•\tDecentralized data access through Blockfrost Gateway\r\n\t•\tRevenue sharing for node operators\r\n\t•\tHydra integration for fast microtransactions\r\n\t•\tSolitary mode for enterprise-grade, customizable deployments\r\n\t•\tOpen-source infrastructure to avoid vendor lock-in\r\n\r\nThis is a strategic investment to decentralize tooling and support SPO income, while maintaining developer-friendly APIs.",
