      "voter": "Kevin G Mohr",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Kronoshus/KevinMohr/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context_blockfrost.jsonld -->\r\n# Kevin G Mohr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,300,000 for Blockfrost Platform community budget proposal\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytwn2u7qpy4ur7k3xqd7eehft3g2yjpxf46rugwzmndkyesd0m5nt`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBlockfrost is essential for the ecosystem and is owned and operated by IOG. I have faith that the money for this project will be spent wisely.",
