      "voter": "Patrick_Tobler",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmeMyYucNv4pqCb6Fj94WqtHV6Vu3qo4g7oHHAwQLs3tYf -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,300,000 for Blockfrost Platform community budget proposal\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nDecentralising Blockfrost is an important and good step for the whole Cardano ecosystem.",
