      "voter": "GovTool Test",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bosko-m/test/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context%20(11).jsonld -->\r\n# GovTool Test\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳15,750,000 for a MBO for the Cardano ecosystem Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yt4grm43j3f8cjrtwvendmr524mfzqrf70k9w0f6p7tz3aqd726xg`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nGovTool test",
