    {
      "voter": "Long Hồ",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWGasjJn38NiEH3LP97fzU4xv9kpj6d2ZPzoWT5tLB33R -->\r\n# Long Hồ\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Set 2025 Net Change Limit of 300M ADA, 2026 Net Change Limit of 250M ADA\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yttfrpngasw7yrdryydsg66gzv8znkj0stjngm5a8hs353stdeml6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a DRep, I vote 'NO' because there is no transparency for this proposal. Metadata should be immutable and stored instead of using web2, as it can be easily altered at any time. I am more than willing to vote 'YES' when everything is transparent, especially for proposals that are positive and contribute to the long-term sustainability of the ecosystem.",
