      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmSqNcQrZc9rvnLTxqt1wExLJ3ZxacwB1NLtjKptHdm29g -->\r\n# CardaFlow\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y279cte2lujj9lde4lmz07wsku5fvra69htrleyx9ahr60cn42uaa`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nsounds like a reasonable proposal",
