      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Cerkoryn/governance-reference/refs/heads/main/voting-history/info/Info_19.jsonld -->\r\n# Cerkoryn\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yglrf4el8gghum239fggvfrau25k2576y4dvcz65r2ukj8sqpsc2k`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe fact that the Cardano Foundation is willing to pay for these domains out of their own pocket instead of asking for treasury funds to do so is a big win for the community.  The only tradeoff I see here is that it would be nice for the community to somehow eventually have ownership of these domains.  Nonetheless, this proposal is an easy YES for me.",
