      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://Qmb6fyngMUwEc6Hx5yCDaG3ufNzWFahHDtrNnKapv2ubG6 -->\r\n# Dynamic Strategies\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygr93aecehnm95wr7ufpd2m6jyh2mc8vnr77f0w33g8upyc6m8ayz`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmSYg76e8yRvJCNyUNKDLnRYdrXd24j7Z5h54XvEn81rc8\r\n\r\n-",
