    {
      "voter": "EMURGO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EMGDRep/rationale/refs/heads/main/Vote_generictld.jsonld -->\r\n# EMURGO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytvlwvyjmzfyn56n0zz4f6lj94wxhmsl5zky6knnzrf4jygpyahug`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nEMURGO recognizes this as a critical, forward-looking investment in Cardano's brand integrity and digital sovereignty. Acquiring .ada and .cardano generic top-level domains proactively safeguards our ecosystem's identity from misuse and establishes a trusted foundation for future growth. \r\n\r\nThe fact that the Cardano Foundation is fully funding this initiative demonstrates strong alignment with its core mission and delivers immense strategic value to the entire community at absolutely no cost to the treasury. This is a prudent and necessary step.\r\n\r\nConclusion:\r\n\r\nEMURGO as a DRep votes YES, fully supporting this initiative to secure vital digital assets that are inherently linked to our identity and future.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Eternl DRep Committee",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tastenkunst/eternl-drep/refs/heads/main/gov_action_00058_vote_context.jsonld -->\r\n# Eternl DRep Committee\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y29h2q6cst2pvkl2sqqvf5ljcy36uv7pmy482xnczddzgqshus24w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nTL;DR: EDC voted YES on gov_action15dh2lt4qskmhl97vat8s0l552ruvddrlasa0jndg7lg43g0uju3qq78hvja;\r\n\r\nSure, go ahead. But consider that this could be a net loss on your balance sheet, if either demand for the domains isn't high or the price tag for individual domains is too steep.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "GAIA",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmda1kDttfgZguQg48ungJEUk3kbcC6ABJgAapsubtvvNg -->\r\n# GAIA\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytxr0lhg5j72wysva9ac2gsn4lck4gyen8ywxkqfchsqg3qs8uy44`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nUsing genesis ADA or Cardano Foundation resources to secure generic top-level domains for the Cardano Ecosystem seems like a very large waste of time and resources:\r\n\r\n- There is no demand for this service - all those currently established in the Cardano ecosystem are using existing domains and are unlikely to switch or purchase a domain simply for a redirect.\r\n\r\n- Anyone can buy the domains and use them for potentially harmful purposes (ie scam sites mimicking legitimate sites). Legitimizing the .ada and .cardano domains will actually help make this problem worse.\r\n\r\n- The funds could be used in much better ways to support the Cardano ecosystem, like matching the resources allocated for the Stablecoin investment fund.\r\n\r\n- This is a focus only on the Cardano internal ecosystem. Those outside of Cardano are unlikely to care about this \"investment\", and we will not bring new users by spending funds on vanity websites for those already in our ecosystem. Onboarding new users to Cardano and retaining them is our #1 issue to be solved, this doesn't even rank.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Hermes Stakepool Germany (HRMS)",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiha7xwp6wj3nqjqealr257agsr2vtniyss7iihxv3t4ybrh3sdyge -->\r\n# Hermes Stakepool Germany (HRMS)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygs5hngva3hymv7j4v0aewxpsjqskj9dnmy7j3jz5ven5zqvulq2t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nMakes sense to avoid additional costs later",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "hix_coffeepool",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPEavkE9FSAd1w13LErxmkBE2fesoxUbadPhmaGRadQ41 -->\r\n# hix_coffeepool\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygnh2uf4wkc8ldgfxwz7rzuga3m8jtqew9xh5g3n587mg6g3ge0sj`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting No on the “Top‑Level Domains for Cardano Ecosystem” Governance Action. I acknowledge the potential benefit of Cardano having its own domain namespace, and I agree that the Cardano Foundation could be a suitable organization to manage such a system. However, this initiative does not represent a strategically significant, emerging, or essential investment at this stage that justifies allocating a dynamic budget of this scale. Currently, Cardano’s ecosystem is falling behind Ethereum and Solana in terms of user growth and activity. The likely use of such TLDs would be limited to a small portion of the existing community, making the impact minimal. Moreover, community members may face unnecessary costs — for example, pressure to switch or register new domains despite already operating functional websites. Additionally, if TLDs are introduced without strong governance or identity verification, high-profile community names may be preemptively registered by third parties. This could lead to impersonation or scam risks, especially if original creators are unable to secure their own domain identities. At a time when core infrastructure and user-facing utility still require funding and development, it is more prudent to direct resources to fundamental needs rather than optional branding initiatives. That said, I recognize the need to protect critical namespace assets such as “.ada” or “.cardano” from misuse or squatting. However, such defensive measures could be considered separately and more efficiently, without requiring full deployment of a high-budget TLD management system at this time. --[Japanese translation follows]-- 「カルダノエコシステムにおけるトップレベルドメイン導入」ガバナンスアクションに対して、私は「反対票（No）」を投じます。カルダノが独自のドメイン空間を持つことには一定の利点があり、Cardano Foundationがその運用組織として適任である可能性も認めます。しかし、現時点ではこのような取り組みに多額のダイナミック予算を投入する意義は乏しく、戦略的・緊急的・本質的な投資とは言えません。現在、カルダノはEthereumやSolanaに比べてユーザー数や開発活性で大きな差をつけられており、こうしたTLDの利用者はごく一部の既存コミュニティに限られる可能性があります。また、既存のウェブサイトを持つメンバーにとっては、ドメインを切り替える必要が生じるなど不要なコストが発生しうる点も問題です。さらに、十分なガバナンスや本人確認の仕組みがないまま導入された場合、影響力のある名前を第三者が先取りする事態も想定されます。これは、元の創設者が取得できなかった際に詐欺的な悪用リスクを引き起こす可能性も含んでいます。エコシステムの成長に必要なコアインフラやユーザーユーティリティへの投資が依然として求められている中で、このようなブランディング的な施策に資金を割くのは、優先順位として適切ではないと考えます。なお、「.ada」や「.cardano」など重要な名称空間の保護は必要であるという認識はあります。ただし、こうした防衛的施策は、現段階で高額なTLD管理体制を全面的に展開することなく、より効率的に別途検討される余地があると考えます。",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
