    {
      "voter": "Peter Bui",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmTiWuX4Eegf71eb8sGVsU6u2RbjJbXGYDxUMCwR1eSmJM -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nHad a good chat with Chris Gianelloni from Blink Labs about the tech and its impact. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OKXSGNxO7SQ\r\n\r\nSince this isn't and won't be a treasury withdrawal, I say yes to this proposal.\r\n\r\nIt makes no sense to say no to this.",
