      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmRZC1E6X7gWk1NS2br8PCh7ViKAxXiQXaazitPhq16dkk -->\r\n# wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfa8r8r36x7x05htftce7qhafrn5nzzr6vazy95pzy6y5dqac0ss7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIt's always DNS.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
