    {
      "voter": "Yoroi W₳llet",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/YoroiDRep/rationale/refs/heads/main/Vote_gtld.jsonld -->\r\n# Yoroi W₳llet\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygr9tuapcanc3kpeyy4dc3vmrz9cfe5q7v9wj3x9j0ap3tswtre9j`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\nYoroi DRep votes YES to support this Info action by Cardano Foundation to secure the .ada and .cardano top-level domains (gTLDs).\r\n\r\nRationale\r\nYoroi appreciates the Cardano Foundation’s initiative in taking proactive steps to protect and strengthen Cardano’s digital identity. This proposal represents a practical and forward-looking move that benefits the entire ecosystem.\r\n\r\nProtecting Cardano’s Digital Identity:\r\nSecuring the .ada and .cardano domains ensures that Cardano’s name and brand are protected from misuse or external control, reinforcing trust and long-term credibility across the ecosystem.\r\n\r\nEcosystem Benefit:\r\nCardano Foundation’s decision to fund this initiative using its own resources demonstrates accountability and stewardship. This approach safeguards community resources while still delivering an ecosystem-wide benefit.\r\n\r\nConclusion\r\nYoroi DRep votes YES with confidence and appreciation for this responsible, community-minded initiative. The action protects Cardano’s brand, strengthens its digital footprint, and sets a positive precedent for proactive, transparent governance decisions that serve the ecosystem’s long-term interests.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Yosh",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmboGyNfRfmspu3CpoxB9H5YTUQqaP84E849rAcCFAqAgJ -->\r\n# Yosh\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytd7s3he5rgxhkx0t2vnun25wy3t263877czxw8nelcld8ce66v4c`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoted yes, as it will be funded by the CF and is in the best interest of Cardano. Hopefully the CF doesn't hold these domains as hostage in the future, as they will be the owners of them and we the community have no representation in the CF. I trust it will be fine.",
