      "voter": "Zacros",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreifticgpqcfmun55lantgc77ye43b6iyciulsmdn3hmdyzk2gonaiq -->\r\n# Zacros\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Securing Generic Top-Level Domains for the Cardano Ecosystem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2tp9q9vckglgkgkgcdc33jtahrstfzfj3c8ez926ysszjqp5r4ts`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nPanda Paw",
