      "voter": "Daehan_kor",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmfYkfXdtAZqjDJpiPBJioDb5eokUnkQGKDGyeH6VtRFV1 -->\r\n# Daehan_kor\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳12,000,000 for Cardano Builder DAO administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y28uwdrz2acyp4jka5fqp2fa3hp0klpme8wug3f5p2y45zsc0e8qw`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSupporting killer apps in the ecosystem is crucial.",
