    {
      "voter": "Dan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdTGqScznaXihHs69YxHVYLVH7DStZSyguqwmqN7dVBYz -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳12,000,000 for Cardano Builder DAO administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting Yes. This proposal establishes a DAO-based funding mechanism for live Cardano projects driving on-chain activity. It supports sustainable ecosystem growth by helping projects scale.",
