      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreidfilr2vbtp3gxakcz7nljvohzo67fpmastavsenidun3uunnoz4q -->\r\n# MyCNFT DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Net Change Limit (Epoch 613 to Epoch 713)\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2wwa9cqns95zzztmz9vw3jm7n8lpd3x8wfvg6wnvvt29ngdm0mlh`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAbstain. The limit is reasonable, but the 16-month period is too long and the projections remain uncertain. I may support future proposals that include stronger fiscal safeguards.",
