      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreifdblvunsi7sujgqe7dsts46glccpsfdsvdwn3d7ywod6gqbhiziu -->\r\n# Nimuë Lady of the Lake Pool\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Net Change Limit (Epoch 613 to Epoch 713)\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygj02llvuusnhphvhlxf7d2cxhs53twjnwwl5at3zwht4xc6xdgl4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support this proposal. For now I think it's a good idea to stick to a 350M yearly NCL. I also like the fact that it's set for 18 months for now, relieving the pressure to get a new one voted in and eliminating the need for extending the current one after a year.\r\nI do think we could get rid of the NCL altogether btw or, if not, making it a protocol parameter indifferent to a set period (where each treasury withdrawal also changes the parameter).",
