      "voter": "ADAR_Chris",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmVspcTZFwHbJfSRBugJNsePMtjJPxka5KUkkxamHJZeS6 -->\r\n# ADAR_Chris\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Increase Transaction and Block Memory Units (Part 1 of 2)\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y26nj0u86z00s2c6yteecduedrzxxrxrn39th5mau0h0r5gszp025`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI trust the recommendations of the Parameter and Technical Steering committees with respect to benefits of proposed parameter changes and assessment of any potential drawbacks.",
