      "content": "<!-- url: https://adastat.net/_meta/drep/vote83.jsonld -->\r\n# AdaStat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Increase Transaction and Block Memory Units (Part 1 of 2)\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfe9en4hsgc3r6nhtmwjeljh06hgnvt9yzzkwqcftvdj34cdxdg7u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a DRep and an SPO, I believe these protocol parameter changes will be beneficial for the network. They are an important step toward improving stability and long-term sustainability, so I'm voting Yes.",
      "vote": "YES"
