    {
      "voter": "Jakub Szyca",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQWQ3GgKGZKn65yPk4dcXCzgZYj52CdEMqkS2hi3wstXz -->\r\n# Jakub Szyca\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Increase Transaction and Block Memory Units (Part 1 of 2)\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytee8ue66qdqkfquq5c9hld7trhxvqdra5plfhyuragcfsgrqen4n`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote YES on this action as it will enable simpler Dapp development without harming the network speed, efficiency and security as confirmed by the Intersect committee.",
