      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihqgxbzse3u4ljji7f4jdfciruoa2glrqchxglffrybvxwb2aq3ry -->\r\n# Rudianos\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Increase Transaction and Block Memory Units (Part 1 of 2)\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfv77z2fsz7nucy59lx2pkafamathf8q783lalkr3quju0gv93lq2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am in favor of this proposed parameter change. The stated reasons for the change are well explained in the proposal and would benefit the ecosystem in providing technological improvements. The drawbacks appear minor and should not significantly impact the chain. The experts at the Parameters Committee and Technical Steering Committee are qualified to assess the claims here and know as well as anyone could if the claims are sound. They have approved, and this is documented in their internal minutes.",
