      "voter": "William Doyle",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreibdo35e52imxlusluarzlrhrq3zo6xd3iwdb6k6euf22ntcxxvc2a -->\r\n# William Doyle\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Increase Transaction and Block Memory Units (Part 1 of 2)\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfpgzfymq6tt9c684e7vzata8r5pl4w84fmrjqeztdqw0sgpzw3nt`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a developer, I've run into these limits before. I'm confident the network can handle the increased load. Increasing these parameters means Cardano has more resources to sell. I'm voting yes.",
