      "voter": "$brock",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://brock.iagon.net/votes/2025IntersectBudgetWithdrawals.jsonld -->\r\n# $brock\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for Dolos Sustaining a Lightweight Cardano Data Node\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytjyvm958ywjkp57f8wm3havj72lc653tp7ajttxxt6ftgcmcmdk2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis vote aligns with my Ekklesia votes, where I voted yes to the highest priority budget line items that fit within my preferred 200m ADA budget, abstained from voting on any line items that I may have had personal interests in, and voted no to everything else.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "$Khale",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CFMatrix/Metadata-storage/refs/heads/main/Dolos.jsonld -->\r\n# $Khale\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for Dolos Sustaining a Lightweight Cardano Data Node\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2ltat8kjqrmnff3lkkpxy0j5tn66d3m0gy64dc92asft5g6dl9ws`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote YES on the Dolos Treasury Withdrawal proposal. \r\n\r\nDolos fulfills a critical need by providing efficient, lightweight ledger data access essential for Cardano dApps’ scalability and ecosystem usability. TxPipe has a robust track record with open governance, transparent milestone reporting, and community contributions. The proposal complies with all constitutional guardrails regarding budget size, administration, and transparency, with multi-sig oversight and public audits. The requested funding aligns with deliverables and supports Cardano’s long-term developer infrastructure. This investment is both prudent and strategically aligned with Cardano’s growth objectives.",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
