      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYbKUMDTMBZWZbwJKMSYqDkb4dPyPkqUEKKKAwjnrLdh8 -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for Dolos Sustaining a Lightweight Cardano Data Node\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe vote yes. The solution this proposal provides is needed. The TxPipe team has the experience and skills to support this proposal.",
      "vote": "YES"
