      "voter": "Dan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQFrSvhAyXwNfRcwnPstKCMCDthHXoxAgAqETVjrHviyk -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for Dolos Sustaining a Lightweight Cardano Data Node\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting Yes to fund Dolos maintenance. TxPipe is a proven, active Cardano dev team delivering key tools. Dolos provides quick and efficient access to blockchain data, enabling dApps to operate without the resource demands of a full node. This funding keeps it reliable and optimised.",
      "vote": "YES"
