    {
      "voter": "Martin Lang",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gitmachtl/cardano-related-stuff/refs/heads/master/vote_18072025.json -->\r\n# Martin Lang\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for Dolos Sustaining a Lightweight Cardano Data Node\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytwmwvtd0a8lr45ssner2tjxzv5y8q03w3606yeald9mdmgmwecja`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a DRep, i have voted YES on this proposal. This decision is in line with my earlier voting this year via Ekklesia.",
