      "voter": "Patrick_Tobler",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPuMPi3mT5gq2pJbgGjmXAejHEXGhzRoudipcZJ52axbH -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳220,914 for Dolos Sustaining a Lightweight Cardano Data Node\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is a net positive for Cardano with a reasonable ask.",
