      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmYmG6tMc2bxngenvvoUKkh4gNnG6xYYBYd1aeRpw4ku3r -->\r\n# Dynamic Strategies\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** IO Cardano High Assurance Technical Collaboration\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygr93aecehnm95wr7ufpd2m6jyh2mc8vnr77f0w33g8upyc6m8ayz`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmXVH3p1cjkwLiu5qmhzKdeBRrhiKuibRzzVikioCWjoYM\r\n\r\n-",
