    {
      "voter": "Hermes Stakepool Germany (HRMS)",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreicd7ov3kkdjcnr5mndjyy2yvvm2gbgpbdp7wjoo2a4n5ytvuxjzru -->\n# Hermes Stakepool Germany (HRMS)\n\n**Proposal:** IO Cardano High Assurance Technical Collaboration\n**Vote:** No\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygs5hngva3hymv7j4v0aewxpsjqskj9dnmy7j3jz5ven5zqvulq2t`\n\n---\n\nbeneficial but not first priority to spend money on imho",
