    {
      "voter": "@gersongomes",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/celgerson/GPG-DRep/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# @gersongomes\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Defining the Cardano Vision and Roadmap for 2025 and beyond\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfqg3v85wl8hpz082yh55hppys5z6803mquqgvdfw78qg9qwr3a4h`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs someone who is not very technical it seemed acceptable to me, especially at the stage we are in.\r\nI trust the team that developed the proposal and I believe we are on the right and virtuous path.\r\nGerson Gomes",
