    {
      "voter": "$brock",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://brock.iagon.net/votes/gov_action12meeq4r43udremwpm6fzt4nt7fctvt0ah7798x036m2r4nhlccmqqhmr9wx.jsonld -->\r\n# $brock\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Defining the Cardano Vision and Roadmap for 2025 and beyond\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytjyvm958ywjkp57f8wm3havj72lc653tp7ajttxxt6ftgcmcmdk2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am aligned with this roadmap and look forward to advancements in the L1's throughput, especially via Leios; and also look forward to the exploration of alternate incentive models for stake pools, putting more emphasis on pledge-benefit.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
