    {
      "voter": "AKYO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPE4mHAi7KXhnV2pVHYAat74gf1Hr5MVWKXdvT6X7q2Y9 -->\r\n# AKYO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yts3qdjsqcnhld4r3uek2uu0n2tnh824tgnf75a83q3yhequuy54u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n本提案に賛成します。Cardano憲法 v2.4 は、拘束力のない規定を整理し、ガバナンスのルールをより明確かつ実務的にすることで、意思決定の透明性と一貫性をさらに高める重要な更新だと考えます。\\n\\nI vote Yes on this proposal. Cardano Constitution v2.4 is an important update that streamlines non-binding provisions and clarifies governance rules, further strengthening transparency and consistency in decision-making.",
      "vote": "YES"
