      "voter": "Cardano Feed",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreieupdeyj2zci737n5hgebgchwiil3pax3optfn4rgmpw4b3ganvgq -->\r\n# Cardano Feed\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftjewhpvtdd8t7swtmtp44px94ns3laytmjc3u7f93qvhswmwv5f`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis update simplifies governance, improves clarity, and strengthens accountability without changing core principles. The immutability of proposals and unified treasury safeguards are clear improvements, and incorporating feedback adds legitimacy.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Cardano Foundation",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://bafybeibmpt4z3nldoczpn3qndjiwlfugbuifzonn4s6qmgklvu3wo26wku.ipfs.dweb.link/ -->\r\n# Cardano Foundation\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ydpfkyjxzeqvalf6fgvj7lznrk8kcmfnvy9hyl6gr6ez6wgsjaelx`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmZAgxcPodRCEHaVdFMuxeBPJe3UDUkmL2T7ZzW2hoqVVf\r\n\r\nOur support for this governance action is based on three key factors:\r\n\r\n1. **The Compromise: \"Ada Owner\" vs. \"Ada Holder\"** We view the reversion of the term \"ada Holder\" to \"ada owner\" as less precise, as it blurs the distinction between protocol-level access (holding keys) and legal ownership rights. However, we accept this regression to accommodate the concerns of other major stakeholders and unblock the constitutional amendment process.  \r\n\r\n2. **The Improvement: Streamlined Treasury & Governance Efficiency** We endorse the removal of the **Budget Info Action** requirement. This change aligns with our previous assessments (for v2.0 and v2.3), where we advocated for reducing bureaucratic friction. By consolidating the information requirements directly into the **Treasury Withdrawal** action, we eliminate a redundant administrative step without sacrificing accountability. This streamlining is essential to ensure the treasury can be deployed efficiently to support ecosystem growth and maintenance. Additionally, the new requirement for **immutable proposal documents** is an important security upgrade that protects the integrity of the governance process.  \r\n\r\n3. **The Continuity: A Maturing Framework** This version continues the work of maturing the Constitution from an aspirational document to an enforceable rulebook. The removal of non-binding \"expectations\" (such as Codes of Conduct) clarifies the document’s purpose: it is a set of hard rules for the ledger, not a social manifesto. This focus on enforceability is a necessary evolution for long-term stability.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "CardanoYoda (MANDA Pool)",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmaiwW8xTRZPZPK3AueCwqq2RTnZBd2DdvL8upcMom8WYV -->\r\n# CardanoYoda (MANDA Pool)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2m0g4r66pyaw3p7u454wc0p4f0ygm8ueaev0mgd3tvwm7sskqwqp`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a DRep, I have decided to vote YES for the proposal: CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n\r\nI support the proposed changes to the Cardano Constitution because they improve clarity, coherence, and practical enforceability without undermining decentralization.\r\n\r\nThe revisions reduce ambiguity, better align the Constitution with Cardano’s on-chain governance mechanisms, and clarify roles and responsibilities in a way that strengthens accountability and decision-making. I also agree with the clarification around governance action sequencing, in particular that Info actions should not be used to pre-empt or condition treasury withdrawals. This simplification makes the process clearer and helps preserve voter sovereignty.\r\n\r\nOverall, these changes represent a sensible evolution toward a more robust, transparent, and effective governance framework for the Cardano ecosystem.",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
