      "voter": "Chris Cata",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYRtHScocE6W6tbjNArvzJnopA8hLLSvAWjqqEmCyZDN4 -->\r\n# Chris Cata\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfdfs28uwafjgmrkatdektlzrvha2cmvqjhuz700e04mawq23rmrg`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have been increasingly more supportive of these constitutional changes as the revisions have gone on.  I am in support of v2.4 of the constitution proposed to bring additional clarity and to help streamline some of the processes when it comes to treasury withdrawals.",
