      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUQRvKqRWFntvM4rbn1v6YPsTAcjzENkUigApH4XakNwD -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting Yes. Constitution v2.4 simplifies governance by removing redundant and non-binding mechanisms, ensures proposal documents are stored immutably, and applies safeguards to treasury withdrawals. It also addresses concerns from v2.3 and adds definitions for key terminology.",
