    {
      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmNwK6U4EEcmvG9zZndVxJ6Jwj32GX9DxHB7WqEkY5XRfA -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmVCR5aknpC8VE2ar2LbW3kLzEW8884fWn3UXDMQRWGzzq\r\n\r\nI am voting **YES**. This update matures our governance framework by removing redundant \"Budget Info Actions\" while preserving fiscal discipline via **universal audit safeguards**.\r\n\r\nI explicitly **commend the proposal creator** for their commitment to improving Cardano governance whilst listening to community feedback. Their work to streamline rules and enforce **immutable proposal documents** significantly strengthens our system integrity and accountability.",
