    {
      "voter": "Donny_Jerri",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreicjlteq6yyfqm625676rqxlbivcbaseptzx3ynrhqqlgdcws6qcbm -->\r\n# Donny_Jerri\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf3m9swrzce3yq2hx64xfd2xz6paj6z3qdfh9s92t5u4j8cpsxpkn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe proposed changes are reasonable and help with clarity.  This is pretty straightforward",
