      "voter": "Kevin G Mohr",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreib5ex2qxlqfyaa7amukhgeh5avt7cs4h3uosi5dolwzkhwlgttkw4 -->\r\n# Kevin G Mohr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytwn2u7qpy4ur7k3xqd7eehft3g2yjpxf46rugwzmndkyesd0m5nt`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is horrible. This doesn't make any fucking sense. Anyone with the slightest knowledge of law would realize how bizarre and warped this is. This does nothing to build out the constitution. It makes things less clear, removes more power from the constitution as a document itself and thus the community. Yuta and the stupid fucks at Emurgo should go ask someone who understands legal concepts to build out and create guidance via the constitution. Not gut it and add in retarded shit that does not matter. What the God Damn fuck is this. Just stop wasting everyone's time and admit y'all are out of your league and need to step down. This is embarrassing.",
