      "voter": "Peter Bui",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmdn4RHywxyeRcbKhLPU4t5auKLfgvSrY7KTf1wqsyjCZh -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis version fixes the issues I had with earlier drafts.\r\n\r\nNon-binding expectations and the Budget Info Action are removed. That keeps the Constitution focused on rules that can actually be enforced.\r\n\r\nProposal immutability is a solid step. Once submitted, documents cannot be changed. That protects trust.\r\n\r\nTreasury audit and accountability rules now apply to all withdrawals. No gaps.\r\n\r\nThe EMURGO reversions are sensible. Broad DRep alignment matters for constitutional change.\r\n\r\nClearer. Tighter. Ready to move forward.",
