    {
      "voter": "SudoScientist",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arpradio/drep/refs/heads/main/Constitution-2_4/const-2_4.jsonld -->\r\n# SudoScientist\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2wtls7xh3a8gyepk540dgtzjzalk086gp4www6y0k0xjmqyk6gma`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs with all previous versions of Constitution updates, the following does not satisfy the process to decide which changes the community believes need change, but a single and influential actor pushing for their beliefs.  I greatly believe following a formal process that results in amendments is needed- not a single party defining this and then pushing for discussion of their ideas.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
