      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreidkxvlzk76jmwjfj6zqtg6mifxngtbrssufd4hqwbqhuxglrgoznq -->\r\n# Zacros\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.4\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2tp9q9vckglgkgkgcdc33jtahrstfzfj3c8ez926ysszjqp5r4ts`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOnce again Panda votes YES. However Panda prefers \"Ada owners\" to \"ada owners\" with a capital \"A\"",
