      "voter": "Angel Castillo",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qma71hTmVWeGeiLWrXZsyUekE7UekFP7Cw9mXNcnA5Dbs2 -->\r\n# Angel Castillo\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳69,459,000 for Catalyst 2025 Proposal by Input Output Advancing De\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg4mxhwlct5crvnkqpqy06l6lrszn0f4cyc5k2hv0pk8xhsvluu37`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCatalyst has already proven its worth by delivering and driving Cardano’s innovation layer. It bundles Hermes infrastructure upgrades, a redesigned user experience, and the rollout of three further funding rounds (Funds 14–16), all aligned with Cardano’s 2025 objectives. Given Catalyst’s track record and the comprehensive scope of this plan, I fully support the requested withdrawal and look forward to its positive, long‑term impact on the ecosystem.",
