      "voter": "Suzhou Capital",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQkbKPkWZUQog7iFoACFjoCVRK7ETQJJfN5Nwgd5yiETW -->\r\n# Suzhou Capital\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳69,459,000 for Catalyst 2025 Proposal by Input Output Advancing De\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytm8770aqd0xqn8f30y3cc3wtsah59vqg5u4ju7xmphl4ecyn8cap`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCatalyst is absolutley critical to the Ecosystem, enough said.",
