      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmSJ6iXHMnbNTALmHAN8BCHieXw294SFzo45XYLPvSh6uW -->\r\n# wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳69,459,000 for Catalyst 2025 Proposal by Input Output Advancing De\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfa8r8r36x7x05htftce7qhafrn5nzzr6vazy95pzy6y5dqac0ss7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCatalyst has been a primary source of seed funds for our ecosystem for years. Let's get Fund 14 going so the next round of innovative projects can get their start.",
