      "voter": "AltcoinOracle",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmTqJVPbdd3NWzrRTa17wjy7hr9Zp8sMgg355cPQPPbHR3 -->\r\n# AltcoinOracle\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygvgk3899qm38zth07z5clhfjvzfhe2mf2kvkqrfxp93r5srjre5s`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI'm voting NO because I don't believe the treasury should be used for marketing or listings.\r\n\r\nMy top priorities as a DRep are: prioritizing core engineering, protecting the treasury, decentralizing influence, and investing in real-world assets (RWAs).\r\n\r\nStrength and honor.",
