      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmS8CJNfUbKTQaqgLH2HpBnaYZcNCX2z9LdFs4ih5HoHGn -->\r\n# ArcadianComputers\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg7xcypymvedd0nn2gcn3zhwhv2d25nfteuxs9re5a7j97c3v4dxw`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nHuge ask for something that should happen organically when volume is high enough.",
