    {
      "voter": "Cardano Cypherpunks",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreig26fhcsjipl4wljcnfnkexe7qt5bx4p32pbjyccrr556nglf4h3a -->\r\n# Cardano Cypherpunks\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23wk4w6f2aumc92vl9m3x74xzm6jh4ha9wdq09yfq2sl6q8zlv4l`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSee the duplicate action",
