      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmX4zSdSEELdT5jf2bZN8BdCQuCWX54xdL1SKoNZWSgeCi -->\r\n# Crypto Eats Legacy\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytd2mf58tfqv78z7e99fy0gnmfep0kscclnwpvx7qvwpc5srxwg5g`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhile I applaud the initiative, I dont see the value to use the treasury to support this meme.",
