    {
      "voter": "EMURGO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EMGDRep/rationale/refs/heads/main/Vote_Snek.jsonld -->\r\n# EMURGO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytvlwvyjmzfyn56n0zz4f6lj94wxhmsl5zky6knnzrf4jygpyahug`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n\r\nEMURGO as DRep votes NO on the governance action to fund the Cardano Global Listing Expansion initiative by the Snek Foundation.\r\n\r\nRationale\r\n\r\nThe Snek team has demonstrated exceptional execution capability, securing Tier 1 listings through self-funding and driving unmatched adoption for a Cardano native token. These achievements are commendable and recognized. However, EMURGO maintains a principle that treasury allocations for exchange listings should be tied to clear, measurable benefits for the broader ecosystem, either through collective infrastructure, demonstrable long-term ROI, or repayment to the Treasury. In its current form, this proposal focuses on a single-token listing without such mechanisms in place, creating a precedent that may be difficult to sustain.\r\n\r\nConclusion\r\n\r\nWe invite the Snek team to submit a revised version that: Provides a corrected, transparent budget\r\n\r\nEstablishes either a repayment model or a shared infrastructure plan\r\n\r\nAligns deliverables with measurable ecosystem-wide outcomes\r\n\r\nWith such adjustments, EMURGO would be open to reassessing support.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Eternl DRep Committee",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tastenkunst/eternl-drep/refs/heads/main/gov_action_00049_vote_context.jsonld -->\r\n# Eternl DRep Committee\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y29h2q6cst2pvkl2sqqvf5ljcy36uv7pmy482xnczddzgqshus24w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nTL;DR: EDC voted NO on gov_action1fl6r784t2ffw7q96du2znhprw90r3xvrfugvqelgqewgxex42kdqq9tgrd5;\r\n\r\nSee second withdrawal action.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
