    {
      "voter": "Homer J",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qme4jkNvQ9upHYTan9MHZFpYJNRVBkwd4FicL5or3MBwZC -->\r\n# Homer J\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2rvnp40ea4zsl4hqm0ev4qju205jx7mz57u2vwjzzrf50c24jca9`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIf you want to support memes, I suggest looking into Dogecoin",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
