      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreig3v2dkcrddtev3lvglghxu5yitmzw36ygp2nbvyivsoineychkbi -->\r\n# Lucas.Macchiavelli\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2jd3c4hgg0tdua58z6c64k9rf58lz3jlcjlxcjfeaspl6q2e9zm6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVote NO – Proposal contains an input error and should be resubmitted correctly.\r\n\r\nVOTE0019",
