      "voter": "Minh Le",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmf9MVkiEcRHcT9xXAEGVMaBHfU8VbJXs3TUaoB89bcTVJ -->\r\n# Minh Le\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg6lvx8hrsjgex7f2p5waz5hqmwxzn7u8xljsuastt7s3qckz3maz`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI didn't vote for this proposal.",
