      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPNWqSFLUDHVJVwViTRVoqfmBLyBBixqmNPtokPhwSwe8 -->\r\n# GAIA\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Amaru Treasury Withdrawal 2025\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytxr0lhg5j72wysva9ac2gsn4lck4gyen8ywxkqfchsqg3qs8uy44`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI previously voted yes for the Amaru Info Action, and am now following through with a yes for the Amaru treasury withdrawl.",
