    {
      "voter": "heo.keo",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmRpFsVUiXRvLgf52LwycCyHeyPKSiDcRQETFyZeVStLE2 -->\r\n# heo.keo\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Pebble + Gerolamo - HLabs 2026 Budget\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytwltt6ywdu4gtuxagz0s0wudwtm35kknp25z8cpmwwnlpc0xage6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nFTE does NOT cost >$200k a year. Industry reasonable cost for FTE is ~$100k.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
