      "voter": "Rich King",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiathf27a5b3hprms4eq45f7jzccvqeahfmpdwfm5j5u4ehltdzgo4 -->\r\n# Rich King\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Pebble + Gerolamo - HLabs 2026 Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2j8r9slasj3pyyyp7rf273ekvc258pmrqalhvdadla75rq9npeku`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nYes. Securitizes Cardano making it censorship resistant and secure and private . Very important for Cardano growth.",
