      "voter": "AustinAnthony",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWZ3wQ1Ujc7QniawGNioHbJjiTzoBVFNEwfAa5RkqktUQ -->\r\n# AustinAnthony\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Budget Process Framework (facilitated by Intersect)\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg5v33dh3pvf9xelauyd5l9qsa3yd6lezf4u7kccp3xqwjspcz3py`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nYes, to have a framework for the Cardano Budget",
