      "voter": "Aichi Tokai_DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmSKe5i1ouReAUhAs41AAWL1uegRCEXLPWAQ1LCBtt13i4 -->\n# Aichi Tokai_DRep\n\n**Proposal:** IO & VacuumLabs Enhancing Plutus - Performance, Correctness, and Usability\n**Vote:** Yes\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2xacakh0g8q4exfgmvywy62an74cj7ejcpcrgq6vh4dckqhtsyh5`\n\n---\n\nI support this proposal because improving Plutus performance is critical for dApp growth, developer adoption, and Cardano’s competitiveness as a smart‑contract platform.",
