      "voter": "This Corrosion",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmahky28eipQYDASuhBuekfuVZHkQTNnvZRp7pwLHLKtoJ -->\r\n# This Corrosion\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** IO & VacuumLabs Enhancing Plutus - Performance, Correctness, and Usability\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytkzpmmukjy6qn6xd5skqm0ypcj5juw9rxddr5mmlzgjvtcghwqjr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAnother much needed upgrade",
