      "voter": "Cerkoryn",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmfCRLutgKy7D2LucAcLTfmKMjMKqgX67fxUHKdSXWuv6u -->\r\n# Cerkoryn\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳700,000 for ZK Bridge administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yglrf4el8gghum239fggvfrau25k2576y4dvcz65r2ukj8sqpsc2k`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nKey enabler of cross-chain DeFi such as BTC.",
