    {
      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmbdU3e4CJ5AVrbdAVCFtCCSiEfsJCV67ePbSC7cHLNKFw -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳700,000 for ZK Bridge administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmdAz1n1ktPGJWqqAmF64KcYv2XobaRWArtz5FVfS6y68K\r\n\r\nSecure, trustless **interoperability** is critical for Cardano's future, and this ZK bridge directly tackles that need.\r\n\r\nUsing ZK proofs is a major advancement for on-chain **decentralization**, moving us away from insecure, centralized bridges. This is a focused, unbundled, and highly valuable project from a strong team that I believe merits support.\r\n\r\nSide note, as an output, I would love to see them show examples of this in action on Cardano mainnet and with another blockchain.",
