      "content": "<!-- url: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmaneA3acGgqT3gE2MheA5ameCG3nJYs48QTRHB7mfT4A5 -->\r\n# Medusa DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳700,000 for ZK Bridge administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg5pzxhp0lu0m7757ww2hke8qhcuqgqt3c2ezphngwytz4gjr6yge`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis seems like a meaningful contribution to the ecosystem — if it’s made open. I’m not sure it should cost this much, but in the long term, it does appear to be valuable.",
