      "voter": "For The People",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiarprd4jfeq2fpqnlph3xjqez62mb5tkdhdqnaxypr2eb7btuzytu -->\r\n# For The People\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano in Oceania A community-led strategic plan for investing in growth\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2crkcnrqs0q7wwzjllgtk95kv7hry7zwzydtrv5glm5n7g78lard`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI like the idea.  Cardano needs all the marketing it can get.   The project idea needs some more clarity to justify the large ask.  I would like to hear about some successful outcomes as examples.   If the ask was smaller to start I believe it would get more support.   re-submit with a ask of 450K ADA and I will approve.",
