      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreibconpa5nizynlvd2sqy2mcstxocpzoscednejeo2rxqupztr7uci -->\r\n# God BLESS You\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano in Oceania A community-led strategic plan for investing in growth\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2u2848fer43ghnyhyadhaqd2ek4q9x09h2y0sxev5gklcgnx3qyp`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI believe the potential impact of this proposal isn't sufficiently explained or clear to justify the amount of money they're requesting, which is why I'm voting negative.\r\n\r\nNote: I won't change my mind, so please don't send me a private message. If you see this message, if I haven't left this note, a change of mind is possible, but not this time. Better luck next time.",
