    {
      "voter": "MyCNFT DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreibn3kghjia6t4qc43fo4posaifjsr74kum3rweneh6xkip6mddg5i -->\r\n# MyCNFT DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano in Oceania A community-led strategic plan for investing in growth\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2wwa9cqns95zzztmz9vw3jm7n8lpd3x8wfvg6wnvvt29ngdm0mlh`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a DRep, I voted FOR the Cardano in Oceania proposal.\r\nThis is not just spending — it’s a strategic investment in sustainable ecosystem growth.\r\n\r\nKey strengths:\r\n\r\nExpands Cardano’s decentralization and global reach.\r\n\r\nCreates a scalable model other regions can adopt.\r\n\r\nStrong transparency: milestones, reports, audit.\r\n\r\nRisks exist, but phased funding and DRep appeal mechanisms reduce them.\r\nI believe this initiative will deliver real impact and strengthen the network.",
