    {
      "voter": "Peter Bui",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmZZdVRT7JPfMJLxBFdgXihRPmR6RorD5k7wLgMvWj2zur -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano in Oceania A community-led strategic plan for investing in growth\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is the info action side of things, and I'll vote it through to get it to the next stage of treasury withdrawal.\r\n\r\nI have full confidence in the team. I am a part of it too, but in the next phase I'd be abstaining from the vote as its a clear conflict of interest voting for a proposal that I am a part of for funding the business development and growth here in Oceania.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
