      "voter": "BWtake(長崎)Japan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYyS9js1WmgaxHwimXb3MR9xHyBtBN4fEXULgUyyM3Exj -->\r\n# BWtake(長崎)Japan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳2,162,096 for Midgard - Optimistic Rollups administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytcw6qzpqqclx2yd0zy64ztvlkkhnf6yrzza8whgnq4vz5gh89626`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nMidgardは、UTxOモデルを活かしたCardano独自のロールアップ設計を追求する先進的提案であり、HydraやPartnerchainとは補完的に機能するレイヤー2ソリューションです。トークンレス設計、ADA決済維持、L1帰属収益構造の工夫も評価でき、低予算で高い技術的意義があるため賛成します。\r\n********\r\nMidgard proposes a UTxO-native optimistic rollup framework that complements Hydra and partnerchains, aiming to enhance scalability while preserving ADA-based fee payments and on-chain economic alignment. Its tokenless, L1-rooted design and efficient budget make this a high-leverage investment. I vote in favor.",
