      "voter": "Maureen",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmZ94vH362tLKj4QkY8mjp2aWJe5oqNB1zUJgjk7KdqmhZ -->\r\n# Maureen\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳2,162,096 for Midgard - Optimistic Rollups administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y22hlaj8wuyygpnjy5cf96tg9tgvjrz39kxvqgv898uj9scfc55t7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSometimes you have to fund the ambitious projects to get breakthrough results. Nuff said.",
