      "voter": "No stress",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmY6WQmaZWEEowSRSsB7Xugp5a9Xo5LRuorgK57Nn3Z62r -->\r\n# No stress\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳2,162,096 for Midgard - Optimistic Rollups administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2t3t35yx7j8nnh3wkqn2zzhgwqksksn85zv62pjrwzjawczwgyv7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOptimistic rollups and ZK rollups are both important for our technology to be as robust as our competitors and at this point it makes sense to invest in both.",
