      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmbTLoausj5KL73JZmfzX2W9dd1tfm3qoLrpQi8wj9q9ip -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳2,162,096 for Midgard - Optimistic Rollups administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOne of the most important scaling solutions in development, clear yes.",
