    {
      "voter": "punkr",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cpunkr/drep/refs/heads/main/250720_Midgard.jsonld -->\r\n# punkr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳2,162,096 for Midgard - Optimistic Rollups administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfyl9j6amk940g76r7ujnn5gywnjenv3kmun3a5tr5a83psl4vv64`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support this proposal because Midgard’s innovative optimistic rollups will significantly enhance Cardano’s scalability, to enable secure, permissionless Layer 2 solutions. The Anastasia Labs team has a proven track record within Cardano’s ecosystem.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
