    {
      "voter": "CardaFlow",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmaV8ucX3wMyqr5SNHWNoP1ePj5PSdRKuHhZvZRzQ9mxy2 -->\n# CardaFlow\n\n**Proposal:** IO Cardano Upgrades\n**Vote:** Yes\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y279cte2lujj9lde4lmz07wsku5fvra69htrleyx9ahr60cn42uaa`\n\n---\n\nImportant upgrade",
