    {
      "voter": "Cardano Feed",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreifmpklcsazu4san46rmxxqvv7cagjru4nfnt36syezvov4dnzurpm -->\n# Cardano Feed\n\n**Proposal:** IO Cardano Upgrades\n**Vote:** Yes\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftjewhpvtdd8t7swtmtp44px94ns3laytmjc3u7f93qvhswmwv5f`\n\n---\n\nI support this proposal as it improves usability, expands economic flexibility, and strengthens long-term resilience within the Cardano ecosystem.",
