    {
      "voter": "TNT",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreianr2ktt374ayglxi7qjbciwr5b7rbf22ukzh5hl72p5lh6r32znm -->\n# TNT\n\n**Proposal:** IO Cardano Upgrades\n**Vote:** Yes\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygc0skj7ceaszyvpte75h4xrw0m6wcenj0kd2uj7lkq5vmcjryeec`\n\n---\n\nI want to be able to pay my fees with anything that has value.",
