    {
      "voter": "Marketing DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmcbj8qjiFwy46aD9iccdweVawRDQ2fkBMQQ3pXUmaM8eZ -->\r\n# Marketing DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Reduce minimum Constitutional Committee size (committeeMinSize) from 7 to 5\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23kumvpqgal3t6v4tamwrprjya453p3djam0eqg63usm9su77hjl`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe need more decentralization, not less. Perhaps focus on addressing the reason why there is a shortage of candidates instead of shrinking the number of seats. Atrophy is a warning signal.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
