    {
      "voter": "Maureen",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmPV4iiXf38TjuPqzhrUuVeh8bTUGTGZYVYqUYaVJmSzJc -->\r\n# Maureen\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Reduce minimum Constitutional Committee size (committeeMinSize) from 7 to 5\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y22hlaj8wuyygpnjy5cf96tg9tgvjrz39kxvqgv898uj9scfc55t7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmZAPjf8HdgQaywrU9gZ54NAkxSAGsb4dbsvE1v6YgnD7r\r\n\r\nIf seven members were the right number for good governance, then seven is still the right number. Reducing it to five doesn’t magically keep the same quality. It just means fewer perspectives, less debate, weaker collective judgment and a thinner security margin. Going from needing three compromised members to two is not “basically the same.” That’s a real drop in safety.\r\nPlus, and maybe this is just me being cynical, but lowering the minimum feels like it reduces the urgency to fill vacancies. If the committee can keep chugging along at five, where's the institutional pressure to get back up to seven? We're basically building in acceptance of understaffing, which seems like exactly the wrong message to send about the importance of constitutional oversight. And once you start shrinking standards for convenience, it’s very hard to stop.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "MREDGARCROSS",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiedv7yfubi3dhzlfzzbn7pv7h3bqhjzokhbwqzgjr2cb4btu2g3r4 -->\r\n# MREDGARCROSS\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Reduce minimum Constitutional Committee size (committeeMinSize) from 7 to 5\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y269ehxj30k4vfzfc2z84v0xykd3amuy2xn0kv9zf8rhcec2fg2jr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n🚨 Cardano Governance 2026: My Decision as DRep\r\n\r\n📅 Dates\r\n• Proposal submitted: **10 February 2026 (Epoch 612)**\r\n• Voting deadline: **16 March 2026 (Epoch 619)**\r\n\r\n📌 Proposal Summary\r\nProposal suggests reducing the minimum Constitutional Committee size in Cardano:\r\n➡️ Current: **7 members**\r\n➡️ Proposed: **5 members**\r\n\r\n📌 My Decision\r\n❌ I vote **NO**\r\n\r\n📌 Why\r\n• Network governance is responsibility, not optional participation.\r\n• If a committee member cannot perform duties — replacement is required, not lowering standards.\r\n• Reducing to 5 increases decision weight of each individual member.\r\n• Any security system degrades over time if requirements are constantly lowered.\r\n\r\n📌 Risks of Reduction\r\n• Easier coordination of influence on decisions\r\n• Lower barrier to impact constitutional changes\r\n• Higher long-term centralization risk\r\n\r\n📌 My Position as DRep\r\nGovernance must be built on:\r\n• discipline\r\n• accountability\r\n• stable quorum\r\n• strong network protection\r\n\r\nCardano is a foundation for the future financial system and crypto. Weakening core governance mechanics is strategically dangerous.\r\n\r\n🚀 КУРС «LEDGER ХОЛОДНЫЙ КРИПТОКОШЕЛЕК» | METAMASK\r\n[https://edgarbagdasarian.justclick.ru/order/LEDGERMETAMASK](https://edgarbagdasarian.justclick.ru/order/LEDGERMETAMASK)\r\n\r\n🔥 ЗАКРЫТЫЙ VIP ЧАТ ПЛАТНАЯ ПОДПИСКА\r\n[https://t.me/MREDGARCROSS_BOT](https://t.me/MREDGARCROSS_BOT)\r\n\r\n🌐 ВСЕ КУРСЫ И ССЫЛКИ\r\n[https://mredgarcross.com/](https://mredgarcross.com/)\r\n\r\nЯ зарегистрировался как DRep и готов помочь в формировании будущего экосистемы. - Оптимистично настроен на построение крупнейшего цифрового сообщества в мире. 🖤 Мой DRep ID: ➡️ **drep1y269ehxj30k4vfzfc2z84v0xykd3amuy2xn0kv9zf8rhcec2fg2jr** Подробнее тут [https://t.me/PROCENT666/338](https://t.me/PROCENT666/338)",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
