      "voter": "Phil UPLC",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmX18ZcDfZQpuVkQ3Kq644Ckxd32H6Sqs7zTQAYhHUEWhy -->\r\n# Phil UPLC\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Reduce minimum Constitutional Committee size (committeeMinSize) from 7 to 5\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg343cyuckglj48a6gpcey7fkfcy5x5f9g65wme3ne9q2mgaedmkm`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmcYQGMEc2w3y3owxDRY27XjjnKWKQHxYUDjYCvnUJz57h\r\n\r\nThere is no reason to have such a high requirement of minimum CC members. This also doesn't mean we cannot add more CC members, and indeed soon after this proposal we should add more CC members.",
