      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYB8n6HvKeZT1XrnUQFsjBf8kPS8HYMiJYu8DHuh7srfA -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** 2025 Cardano Blockchain Ecosystem Budget - 7.5M ₳ for community builders\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThese are proposals that have high support on Ekklesia. This shows that they have high consensus from the Drep community. We are also very supportive of the development of Midgard and Starstream.",
