    {
      "voter": "wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUjS253eeDe3X1jwjkWRJSoDdZZfQet2n4BcoF1L38t1N -->\r\n# wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** 2025 Cardano Blockchain Ecosystem Budget - 7.5M ₳ for community builders\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfa8r8r36x7x05htftce7qhafrn5nzzr6vazy95pzy6y5dqac0ss7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI spoke with one of the builders directly and they had no idea what this is.",
