      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmRp27WUvdPkvNzgXjPyNRPGTWd4CHg236yhXomaVD3Eyi -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Stablecoin DeFi Liquidity Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCardano DeFi has not yet developed as strongly as the community expected. This proposal brings many benefits to the ecosystem, but it also creates certain risks. After weighing the risks and benefits, we support this proposal. We hope that supporting liquidity provision can bring great benefits to the ecosystem.",
