      "voter": "Cardanolotus",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmcpCem6jPBAfAGCLDsYSBZdW9emjojBDcQ5f1zJMgNiAp -->\r\n# Cardanolotus\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Stablecoin DeFi Liquidity Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yt7hfdllz0l707unkh9g2fs9e35dl6d94tvjynnh4t5gw6gcmn4jn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n100% support this.",
