      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPxraU72TswDLKPZFhUxyjxyejbziAhqAzjYrUdnHk4Bu -->\r\n# Crypto Eats Legacy\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Stablecoin DeFi Liquidity Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytd2mf58tfqv78z7e99fy0gnmfep0kscclnwpvx7qvwpc5srxwg5g`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nStablecoin liquidity is critical for DeFi growth, adoption, and building resilience. This proposal provides a way to bootstrap liquidity, attract market makers, and showcase the fact that Cardano Defi is up there with (and beyond) the best.\r\n\r\nCarpe diem",
