    {
      "voter": "drep1yfx2476p8smc8dyuvgz0lkgwgzdyuuaw9293ncnswy8cfac4xu0z3",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiatynpql7i7gaquaywcz4hoce4ocxw555jsfxfirej4tsjk5x343a -->\r\n# drep1yfx2476p8smc8dyuvgz0lkgwgzdyuuaw9293ncnswy8cfac4xu0z3\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Stablecoin DeFi Liquidity Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfx2476p8smc8dyuvgz0lkgwgzdyuuaw9293ncnswy8cfac4xu0z3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI agree with the principals of this but more would be needed and I think this should be just a secondary measure to improve defi. The first and most important step should be to BRING USDC to Cardano!!!!!",
