      "voter": "drep1ytec7gdrfp0nt578cl4hx9a7umqxejmf6f40gvsydq8pm0qlzsarn",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihyej2akr5kjkinhej33myeyumbiqpm6e2touyf5byffy5bab5yl4 -->\r\n# drep1ytec7gdrfp0nt578cl4hx9a7umqxejmf6f40gvsydq8pm0qlzsarn\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Stablecoin DeFi Liquidity Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytec7gdrfp0nt578cl4hx9a7umqxejmf6f40gvsydq8pm0qlzsarn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nStrengthening DEXs is important as it allows the most economic freedom, and Stable coins will build the liquidity to do so.",
