    {
      "voter": "drep1ytsdx6n4r2566ajkkm0s5hjft495elw59hue6e4yc6d6qesqeqftk",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreic23rd7gx4sxj2kceccopmpxbbreffjqwxzssufl5dryx2zn6g3uu -->\r\n# drep1ytsdx6n4r2566ajkkm0s5hjft495elw59hue6e4yc6d6qesqeqftk\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Stablecoin DeFi Liquidity Budget\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytsdx6n4r2566ajkkm0s5hjft495elw59hue6e4yc6d6qesqeqftk`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n50M is too much funding for this proposal.",
