      "voter": "For The People",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihsgxqndcpkjzup3rldltfhn6m6dr4f6unue6bkzfx2zllaavwzeq -->\r\n# For The People\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Stablecoin DeFi Liquidity Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2crkcnrqs0q7wwzjllgtk95kv7hry7zwzydtrv5glm5n7g78lard`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCardano needs this",
