      "voter": "MyCNFT DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiafzs5wecbns2uvtuxkujgs4gyru2ah536r6vzpsz4uhs2wlj3yiq -->\r\n# MyCNFT DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Stablecoin DeFi Liquidity Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2wwa9cqns95zzztmz9vw3jm7n8lpd3x8wfvg6wnvvt29ngdm0mlh`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nClear governance, transparency, and public good focus — boosting stablecoin liquidity benefits the entire ecosystem while returning revenue to the treasury.",
