      "voter": "$brock",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://brock.iagon.net/votes/gov_action1x2zm0lgd59kjrc9clzgscdlh0ct62l8llr638h6t4a5jj4yqzzyqq2dgc7q.jsonld -->\r\n# $brock\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Reimburse Ikigai Info Governance Action Deposit\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytjyvm958ywjkp57f8wm3havj72lc653tp7ajttxxt6ftgcmcmdk2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis reimbursement is long overdue.",
