      "voter": "Big Lazy Cat",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreig6gwoi3ppdfqrtle4logumtzadoouzkpa2xiwmjscqpm6d7wsc7u -->\r\n# Big Lazy Cat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Reimburse Ikigai Info Governance Action Deposit\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yffcjs0njfea09xhs6up429rhya5pxd7qz7hvmwq6vqy2nczwpj3g`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support this proposal. It’s fair to reimburse the lost deposit caused by a bug.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
