    {
      "voter": "punkr",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreib4nyypj4edgwweslxqx4xxnhq6l6nfdrdf55q7bkkkoxoqfg5plm -->\r\n# punkr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Reimburse Ikigai Info Governance Action Deposit\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfyl9j6amk940g76r7ujnn5gywnjenv3kmun3a5tr5a83psl4vv64`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe community should reimburse this early governance pioneer who lost ₳100k due to a fixable protocol bug, as it's fair and sets a positive example.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
