      "voter": "MiyatakeJapan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmNyFs1rfd1XyQJyiVqrPE7L4N5a9WNa3VLpaw67gGAYjd -->\r\n# MiyatakeJapan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** 2025 Net Change Limit\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytaunswwpytxjk2ja7c5suxrjz57vtq4ryzu7prkxmm4wdqs7c9wn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI think it is reasonable to set a budget for the inflow.\r\nHowever, after next year, I think it would be better to wait for the 2025 evaluation before deciding on the budget.\r\n流入額に応じた予算の決定は妥当に思います。しかし、来年以降は2025年の評価を待ってから予算を決める方がいいと思います。",
