    {
      "voter": "The Victor",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/bafybeidfixptcfweaw4jza3wsme5xjavsv4n7gyypyq36jpvhv6ew5qfx4 -->\r\n# The Victor\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** 2025 Net Change Limit\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfv824m4rjeglnwessh59v4hz8u3glz5pgexxff5md7wytsccjj68`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI'm voting Yes to avoid projects being stalled, however I do believe 350M ADA is just too much. I will support any subsequent changes.",
