    {
      "voter": "Porto Cripto DRep 🇧🇷 🇵🇹 (Atico & Bosco, from Cardanistas",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/portocripto/drep-entry/refs/heads/main/votes/GA068-info-ncl-rationale.jsonld -->\r\n# Porto Cripto DRep 🇧🇷 🇵🇹 (Atico & Bosco, from Cardanistas Stake Pool - CARDs)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Defining the Cardano 2030 Vision & Strategy\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ywuk39acvmkzda9e8kfmy7fwf946jd5uaa4l696atlas66s68f0fl`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n[Portuguese]\r\nOptamos pela \"ABSTENÇÃO\" nesta ação de governança (gov_action1n9hdlcmshrj3hee4g8n4fxdgrprpxp0r03l6psd3j0evtpck0nrsqm57age), pois o documento “Visão e Estratégia Cardano 2030” ainda é um rascunho elaborado pelo grupo de trabalho do Comitê de Produto do Intersect, sem ter sido votado internamente pelos seus membros. Acreditamos também que o material precisa ser mais amplamente debatido com a comunidade, a fim de amadurecer e consolidar um conceito mais robusto e definitivo.\r\n[English]\r\nWe chose \"ABSTENTION\" on this governance action (gov_action1n9hdlcmshrj3hee4g8n4fxdgrprpxp0r03l6psd3j0evtpck0nrsqm57age), because the “Cardano Vision and Strategy 2030” document is still a draft prepared by the Intersect Product Committee working group and has not yet been internally voted on by its members. We also believe that this material needs to be further discussed with the community in order to achieve a more mature and definitive concept.",
