      "voter": "AdaStat",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://adastat.net/_meta/drep/vote51.jsonld -->\r\n# AdaStat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfe9en4hsgc3r6nhtmwjeljh06hgnvt9yzzkwqcftvdj34cdxdg7u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAll candidates for the Constitutional Сommittee are well-known in the Cardano community. Since I have no reason to distrust them, I'm voting Yes.",
