    {
      "voter": "AKYO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPXjEDCSNfTvTxzyBcu9njmr6ZkavmWkkAm6DWCdzcyV4 -->\r\n# AKYO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yts3qdjsqcnhld4r3uek2uu0n2tnh824tgnf75a83q3yhequuy54u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n私は憲法委員会のメンバーに選出された立場にあるため、中立性を維持する観点から本提案を棄権します。\\n\\nI will abstain from this proposal in order to maintain neutrality, as I have been elected as a member of the Constitutional Committee.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
