      "voter": "FAIR Pool #01",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdRedjm3mhtgroLbMcXQn4ePdhD4ayXdoupDz4nio3rJR -->\r\n# FAIR Pool #01\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytamqncvuz2r0atkwxwgcn5zmgxm09j0g2lgcrp7ddqfsfcsgnr8s`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI’m voting YES to replace the Interim Constitutional Committee with the elected Constitutional Committee because I accept the election’s legitimacy. Confirming the new CC on-chain prevents a governance gap when the ICC expires and keeps governance moving. Thanks to the incoming members for stepping up to serve Cardano and the Cardano Constitution.",
