      "voter": "Hermes Stakepool Germany (HRMS)",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmP1JwJNcAXLoX8EhEadUe8kfRJ4FmoSts4XyBVD7vtpPT -->\r\n# Hermes Stakepool Germany (HRMS)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygs5hngva3hymv7j4v0aewxpsjqskj9dnmy7j3jz5ven5zqvulq2t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis only puts the actual candidate votes to action - therefore voted yes",
