      "voter": "LallyMcClay",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LallyMack/Drep-it/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context%20(7).jsonld -->\r\n# LallyMcClay\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2dptycrks2ggae95leeh66m0l0svet98c44hl4rmaec7as6hgpp3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis proposal finalizes Cardano’s transition from a temporary, interim Constitutional Committee (ICC) to the fully elected, community-backed Constitutional Committee (CC).\r\n\r\nThe ICC was always intended as a stopgap measure. An election process has taken place to  select the seven members to carry this responsibility with staggered terms for long-term stability.\r\n\r\nApproving this update ensures: Continuity, Legitimacy & Functionality and maintains the checks and balances needed for treasury withdrawals, gov actions and other key decisions to proceed without disruption.",
