      "voter": "Latam Cardano",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreibm2hvpmiqhurbhncm2lqhynq467puu7cogw7i3kje2vxcidszxf4 -->\r\n# Latam Cardano\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytgsdkfznvjnwdxrzvf8x6tn4ctfukqqphsammzkfwatgsqgnpf2w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting for this proposal was held in a transparent and democratic way. We support the results and celebrate the our first fully elected. Constitutional Committee.",
