    {
      "voter": "LloydDuhon",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmX4hCMKH8QMgHJtj75BrgkLKVDnz9YnJTGgcgRT6HTHht -->\r\n# LloydDuhon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfvw769lf7g5p4hx0cl2f8jxdcufdcqqj36u0n9escjcwdswcj4h6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe slate of candidates provided are all excellent examples of community involved groups who will uphold Cardano's interests. I have confidence in their ability to review governance actions for constitutionality.",
