      "voter": "Mike Rogero (羅邁凱）",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUnafPPbydHH4edsGbPhotRKYsbkex28gsY8Jby8UhT8d -->\r\n# Mike Rogero (羅邁凱）\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2lhe7wn2sr6vme8gnca4jrkhv47uh3tklsykmrqvwzdq4g5s8wju`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis was a valid election process and thus should be ratified , although the low turnout and low barrier for vote buying is a continuing problem which needs improvement.",
