      "voter": "Minh Le",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmTgGrkwXndUFgTXtZnoTqug1J7p1kbDAXqLmkaCx1f7Ms -->\r\n# Minh Le\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg6lvx8hrsjgex7f2p5waz5hqmwxzn7u8xljsuastt7s3qckz3maz`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote for this proposal.",
