      "voter": "Nicolas Cerny",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmbyMbm2nKWf7LXnc9S7FUvQhAExG8gE7pTEr881uwQgm6 -->\r\n# Nicolas Cerny\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yttcav7gh3xlkqd876gmgma32c7qj555ajnn3fnp9kl6l4g97vcyz`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmRimvxdErd3bB4SxdsSBYCtv6rb2y2VxqSFX1H794hW8Z\r\n\r\nThese candidates represent a diverse and well-balanced group of Cardano Community members ready for the task. I'm a member of the Ace Alliance, one of the seven candidates presented via this governance action.",
