    {
      "voter": "Peter Bui",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pbwebdev/drep/refs/heads/main/r/25/250812_replace-icc_2b225f65102d.jsonld -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis proposal replaces the Interim Constitutional Committee with members elected through the recent, verified DRep election, as required by Article VII, Section 2 of the Cardano Constitution. The process followed a transparent, audited, and constitutional procedure, with term lengths allocated to ensure staggered continuity. Approving this action ensures governance continuity beyond the interim term’s expiry in epoch 580, without any breach of constitutional requirements or risk to treasury oversight. There are no missing disclosures or procedural concerns.",
