      "voter": "Rudianos",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihlyaw5rcubpabiahacpa2hsrvgm5dxiv4yjzemgk4uymlfbmojka -->\r\n# Rudianos\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfv77z2fsz7nucy59lx2pkafamathf8q783lalkr3quju0gv93lq2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am in favor of this action as this is a required administrative step in order to ensure we have an active CC.",
