      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreid3gjdiaoswuxminb53y55dbctobkrhfwjy6wa567efmuvxcoh2yi -->\r\n# SureWealthNG\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2t8w2rtcyfh3f863gqcwmru7lafuszmvy0xhg7xjwdpwgcf2kz87`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis proposal confirms the results of the recent community election to replace the temporary Constitutional Committee with seven elected members serving staggered one- and two-year terms. Approving it ensures there’s no break in governance when the current committee’s term ends on September 6, 2025, keeping decision-making in Cardano running smoothly.",
