      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmURzqygZ9UhSGH9evff2xhFozvTbDL4x9bmtcc4r8FdcB -->\r\n# The Dutch Drep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yvve4554njxyun2s5p9q70v88d5jl7r0h34pjhw5f5tmw3sjtrutp`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe, The Dutch Drep, vote Yes on this update CC GA, submitted by Intersect. Our affirmative vote is based on our confidence in the process by which the vote took place, the community engagement witnessed in the lead-up to the selection of the CC members, and our confidence in the keys submitted in the GA.  We wish the new CC well in their endeavor to steer Cardano's governance; may you navigate by the stars and not the light of every passing ship.",
      "vote": "YES"
