    {
      "voter": "Victor.Villagomez",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdQQTQpJAdy47qdntAmKQemcVfYptzh6AukVMVmoybrdR -->\r\n# Victor.Villagomez\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2utmer3m25qvcfrmglld88yueq9se3d8hqjnj20wk4q0cgz92za6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe proposal to replace the Interim Constitutional Committee (ICC) with the newly elected Constitutional Committee (CC) appears to be a routine and essential step in Cardano's governance evolution, aligning with the Constitution's requirements for staggered terms and continuity.",
