      "voter": "Yoroi W₳llet",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/YoroiDRep/rationale/refs/heads/main/Vote_Replace_ICC_.jsonld -->\r\n# Yoroi W₳llet\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Replace Interim Constitutional Committee\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygr9tuapcanc3kpeyy4dc3vmrz9cfe5q7v9wj3x9j0ap3tswtre9j`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n\r\nYoroi DRep votes YES on the governance action to ratify the newly elected Constitutional Committee (CC), which will replace the Interim Constitutional Committee (ICC) at the end of epoch 580.\r\n\r\nRationale\r\nThe election process was transparent, accessible, and independently verified, ensuring its credibility.\r\nThe varied term lengths for members help balance stability with regular opportunities for new participation.\r\nThis action ensures a smooth transition with no governance gap after the ICC’s term ends.\r\n\r\nConclusion\r\nYoroi looks forward to the contributions of the new CC and trusts they will strengthen Cardano’s governance for the benefit of the entire ecosystem.",
