      "voter": "Brent_Norris",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DragonsBloodKush/ada/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context-hardfork-renaming-to-matthew_plomin.jsonld -->\r\n# Brent_Norris\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Rename the Chang 2 Hard Fork to the Plomin Hard Fork\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytqpw3yqgfw57vlx8sf7vevzgl8ksgdfjzqs9ducesyx99cwszkxj`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAlthough I never met Matthew, I have read a lot of posts about his acumen and integrity. It seems the community has faith and I'm going with gut on this one. I believe value is derived from community participation and I hope part of his legacy will be the growth of our humble community into a larger combined group of active participants. Honoring Matthew seems like the right thing to do, to me. I hope my delegators agree.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "BWtake(長崎)Japan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BWtake/ProminHardForkFin/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context%20(2).jsonld -->\r\n# BWtake(長崎)Japan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Rename the Chang 2 Hard Fork to the Plomin Hard Fork\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytcw6qzpqqclx2yd0zy64ztvlkkhnf6yrzza8whgnq4vz5gh89626`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nマシュー・プロミン氏は、Cardanoエコシステムにおける革新者であり、熱心なコミュニティメンバーでした。金融業界で培った専門知識を活かし、米ドルに裏付けられたステーブルコイン「$USDM」の開発に中心的役割を果たしました。また、市場が困難な状況でも「Monetaプロジェクト」を成功させるなど、挑戦を恐れない姿勢が彼の特徴でした。技術者であるだけでなく、「黄金律」を実践する人間性を持ち、困っている人を助け、家族や仲間を大切にしました。突然の逝去は大きな損失ですが、彼の功績と精神は、Cardanoコミュニティの成長と未来に大きな影響を与え続けます。そのため、次回のハードフォークを彼の名を冠して「Plomin Hard Fork」とする提案は、彼の偉業を称えるにふさわしいと考えます。",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "C2VN",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cardano2vn/drep/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# C2VN\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Rename the Chang 2 Hard Fork to the Plomin Hard Fork\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygqlu72zwxszcx0kqdzst4k3g6fxx4klwcmpk0fcuujskvg3pmhgs`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI fully support the renaming of the \"Second Chang Hard Fork\" to the \"Plomin Hard Fork\" in memory of Matthew Plomin. This change marks a natural progression in Cardano's governance, honoring Matthew's invaluable contributions to the community. Not only was he an outstanding figure in finance, but he also inspired many, always eager to help and share knowledge within the Cardano ecosystem. Matthew's legacy continues through the Moneta project and the unwavering support for the community he helped",
