      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tulibra1510/doitenharkforkchang2/refs/heads/main/Doitenchang2.jsonld -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Rename the Chang 2 Hard Fork to the Plomin Hard Fork\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is a gesture to recognize Matthew Plomin's contributions to the Cardano ecosystem. I completely agree.",
