    {
      "voter": "Caleb Montiel",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CalebMontiel-ada/Caleb-DRep/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# Caleb Montiel\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Rename the Chang 2 Hard Fork to the Plomin Hard Fork\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygc76qwd9jp4yae9jqeg8e89xhg2pfsqh2ep3zcxck09uzc5sl9s9`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote YES! Matthew Plomin was an exemplary Cardano Community member, a devoted husband and father, and a true innovator in our ecosystem. \r\n\r\nRenaming Chang 2 in his honor is a meaningful way to recognize his contributions, from his work with $USDM to his humility, kindness, and intelligence. This action ensures his legacy will be remembered and celebrated forever.",
