    {
      "voter": "Cerkoryn",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Cerkoryn/governance-reference/refs/heads/main/voting-history/info/Info_4.jsonld -->\r\n# Cerkoryn\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Rename the Chang 2 Hard Fork to the Plomin Hard Fork\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yglrf4el8gghum239fggvfrau25k2576y4dvcz65r2ukj8sqpsc2k`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nMatthew Plomin was one of the greatest visionaries I’ve ever had the privilege of knowing. His passion, dedication, and ability to inspire others left an indelible mark on the Cardano community. Renaming the hard fork in his honor is a fitting tribute to his legacy and the countless lives he touched. I am proud to vote yes on this proposal.",
