    {
      "voter": "Eternl DRep Committee",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tastenkunst/eternl-drep/refs/heads/main/gov_action_00004_vote_context.jsonld -->\r\n# Eternl DRep Committee\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Rename the Chang 2 Hard Fork to the Plomin Hard Fork\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y29h2q6cst2pvkl2sqqvf5ljcy36uv7pmy482xnczddzgqshus24w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe Eternl DRep Committee votes 'YES' on renaming the “Second Chang Hard Fork” (Chang 2) to the Plomin Hard Fork. Not much more to add. Help us shape future voting decisions by joining the Eternl Discord!",
