      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQmNjx7tgCM5YFfD2xnftrbXroY9cmXawjizpkWmf7J3w -->\n# erikdrep\n\n**Proposal:** Blockfrost Maintenance and Next Generation Indexing\n**Vote:** Yes\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytrf7kdyhk6ft3fqzqqqaszam6gt2fljpsvwkvngamyrvks6faung`\n\n---\n\nImportant if Cardano does really take off.",
