      "voter": "phillerino",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmbdERbzqkVNeh4UUFggukejtvjnK1naJCg38qtUNqoRoi -->\n# phillerino\n\n**Proposal:** Pogun Capital Without Compromise\n**Vote:** No\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytu64qt7send5dw7wcd0z5geh4ka6qstgvtgval097hed7qqnqh2n`\n\n---\n\nIdea is good. Catalyst or similar funds would be more suitable.",
