    {
      "voter": "Shawn McMurdo - SQUID",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://Qmcz9H5VsAGMB24gzktd4jLAz9nu5h9z73nnCHcejzd6Br -->\r\n# Shawn McMurdo - SQUID\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Pogun Capital Without Compromise\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yt99uyp9c8qura9spfgqe8uf7g2avmqc683x28zcugh0sycjd6wp0`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmXALQtUnE22hWc4qjGgQEGyQ6vBkhyXdc6mdkX5pv44Z6\r\n\r\nyes",
