    {
      "voter": "erikdrep",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmeJ9eAsL1VRNCPUmSN9tua9Si5XsXMwZL373SxxKHrghm -->\n# erikdrep\n\n**Proposal:** The first node in the browser; a Cardano USP\n**Vote:** No\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytrf7kdyhk6ft3fqzqqqaszam6gt2fljpsvwkvngamyrvks6faung`\n\n---\n\nThis would have my vote if the ADA market price was higher, but at the moment I don't think the Treasury can afford it.",
