      "voter": "wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmdti1ZP8zJ5xkbuVNTsYsmecFoQCnDWjYjEGM3uqCCGts -->\n# wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)\n\n**Proposal:** The first node in the browser; a Cardano USP\n**Vote:** Yes\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfa8r8r36x7x05htftce7qhafrn5nzzr6vazy95pzy6y5dqac0ss7`\n\n---\n\nExcited for Gerolamo",
