      "voter": "BTBF_XSP",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmRmRrH3hLjZ8gcPtwQ9tdaoWSjgd4fM1n81gheUyipASZ -->\r\n# BTBF_XSP\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Decrease Treasury Tax from 20% to 10%\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2vyrqh0fa4qh4tmy7322va6ryk78uh6szppezaft0watyqp5hdwx`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have cast a **NO** vote on the following proposal:\r\nAfter analyzing the reference data, it became clear that the economic parameters are intricately interconnected and are not functioning as initially designed. Given the current situation, I believe it is best to re-simulate the parameters before making any adjustments.\r\nIf you would like to know the detailed voting reasons, please refer to this URL.\r\nhttps://x.com/btbfpark/status/1900995976997072899",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
