      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tulibra1510/giamthuekhobac/refs/heads/main/giamthuekhobac.jsonld -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Decrease Treasury Tax from 20% to 10%\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nReason:\r\n+ Cardano has just entered the era of decentralized governance, so changing the parameters at this time is not reasonable.\r\n+ This adjustment is not certain to increase participation in decentralized governance",
