    {
      "voter": "lido",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmQkEY366i8CGutxo8wDb8fG9u2tKqKiLPqdvFig8iCB59 -->\r\n# lido\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Decrease Treasury Tax from 20% to 10%\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg7s3wsvh4jmmv5fys6hrsnrkch8x6zfamgd8nhfvhz5r2ctdy57k`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is a an amazing conversation starter. But at this moment in time, the conditions that was a catalyst to set the tau to the current .2 are still true... we still need to bootstrap the treasury. \r\n\r\nI would love to revisit tau after a couple budgets have been passed and the Cardano community have found it's stride in living up to the original promise of sustainability.",
