    {
      "voter": "LloydDuhon",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmXeNkaEe7TP6r7R8aHnWjzDmLwAoT1hJLk8VzriQ3JqF5 -->\r\n# LloydDuhon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Decrease Treasury Tax from 20% to 10%\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfvw769lf7g5p4hx0cl2f8jxdcufdcqqj36u0n9escjcwdswcj4h6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs Andrew stated in his video, this allows us to ratify a tax amount, either way, for the first time. Thanks Andrew for bringing this vote up. \r\n\r\nAfter reviewing the parameters committee determination that this proposal does not have economic impact reviews, I have decided to vote against this proposal. I would consider an additional vote on this topic with stronger review period.",
