      "voter": "Long Hồ",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmc4aaY6UBonXHQX7qnvkqhAnqEGvTF4syKSUnWc5AFmYm -->\r\n# Long Hồ\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Decrease Treasury Tax from 20% to 10%\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yttfrpngasw7yrdryydsg66gzv8znkj0stjngm5a8hs353stdeml6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a DRep, I support and vote Yes for this proposal because:\r\n\t1.\tReducing the treasury tax from 20% to 10% will enhance staking incentives and participation, ensuring the stability and security of the network.\r\n\t2.\tThis adjustment does not immediately impact the treasury or the ecosystem negatively; on the contrary, it has immediate positive effects.\r\n\t3.\tWe can always reverse this decision if we determine that the treasury needs more funds by introducing a new governance proposal. This approach is highly flexible and can be executed whenever necessary, with the decision resting in the hands of the community.",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Lourde",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LourdeP/DRep-Public-Votes/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context%20-TaxationVote.jsonld -->\r\n# Lourde\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Decrease Treasury Tax from 20% to 10%\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygtvnwgsucstvesms2hv9vc8hw3tye5zhzldmszrxqd2rxsje5c6m`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSince the Shelley Era a taxation on the Cardano community of 20% has existed through a decision made by the Founding entities, as the Technology has evolved so has the needs, requirements, and expectations of the community and with the new unlocking of the voices of the DReps and the greater Cardano Community I feel as though an easement on the burden of the community is justifiable. I agree and concur with this proposal for a parameter change. I applaud the authors of the proposal you have my vote of confidence.\r\n\r\n-LOURDE-\r\nOuroborus\r\nImperator\r\nAeternalis",
