      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmSRGnq9VpVwCn2dePrqPBwUuGCmLKqDPXCJ74o2bYXP8w -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳26,840,000 for Input Output Research (IOR) Cardano Vision - Wor\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmSS7en8DF6MftUGh68mbE97Ji6EA4U6todixj77XGDnZa\r\n\r\nI am voting a confident **YES**. Cardano's research-driven development is its key differentiator and the very foundation of its impressive reliability.\r\n\r\nIOR has a proven, world-class track record of delivering the foundational science that secures and advances our blockchain. For the long-term **sustainability** and competitive **growth** of the ecosystem, funding this proven research engine is a pragmatic and essential investment in our core strength.",
