      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWwWXmoKHqMtwN7ShP3C2QQfmzfmCHC5FU8v5jb2SWoJ1 -->\r\n# Homer J\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳26,840,000 for Input Output Research (IOR) Cardano Vision - Wor\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2rvnp40ea4zsl4hqm0ev4qju205jx7mz57u2vwjzzrf50c24jca9`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNot a fan of giant bulk withdrawals from treasury (especially covering multi-year periods), prefer larger number of smaller withdrawals that would get approved based on their merit by the community governance.",
