      "voter": "This Corrosion",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmTp59h3L3UYteXfH6fLL4QKe7jV84cb3V76Z2foHf8eGf -->\r\n# This Corrosion\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano 2030 Vision, Mission, Strategy Framework and KPIs\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytkzpmmukjy6qn6xd5skqm0ypcj5juw9rxddr5mmlzgjvtcghwqjr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is a good solid strategic level framework. Strategic level plans should not include too many specifics as that ultimately ends up interfering at the operational planning level and I believe this strikes the appropriate balance on the strategic description/prescription spectrum.",
