      "voter": "wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmbcppWwCZpRT8HJ6jhfqkSFqDXqcA5SPB3ZyH9ZWtRFk3 -->\r\n# wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano 2030 Vision, Mission, Strategy Framework and KPIs\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfa8r8r36x7x05htftce7qhafrn5nzzr6vazy95pzy6y5dqac0ss7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAspirational, not actionable.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
