    {
      "voter": "Yoroi W₳llet",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/YoroiDRep/rationale/refs/heads/main/Strategy_2030.jsonld -->\r\n# Yoroi W₳llet\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano 2030 Vision, Mission, Strategy Framework and KPIs\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygr9tuapcanc3kpeyy4dc3vmrz9cfe5q7v9wj3x9j0ap3tswtre9j`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n\r\nYoroi votes YES on the Info Action titled “Cardano 2030: Vision, Mission, Strategy Framework and KPIs” as an initial step toward better alignment and more strategic decision-making across the ecosystem.\r\n\r\nRationale\r\n\r\nA starting point for shared direction\r\n\r\nThis proposal serves as a meaningful foundation for aligning community efforts around a common long-term outlook. As governance responsibilities increasingly sit with DReps, having a shared strategic reference helps make voting decisions more intentional.\r\n\r\nSignals a shift toward real-world impact\r\n\r\nThe focus on usage-based core KPIs such as transactions, active wallets, and total value-locked reflects a positive move toward measuring real adoption and ecosystem relevance, rather than progress defined purely by technical delivery.\r\n\r\nGuidance, not enforcement\r\n\r\nAs a non-binding Info Action, the framework informs decisions without constraining them. While the details can be refined over time, treating this as an initial step allows the community to move forward with a shared direction while remaining open to iteration.\r\n\r\nConclusion\r\n\r\nOverall, Yoroi supports this proposal as a constructive first step toward a shared long-term strategy that helps DReps make more strategic and explainable decisions, while leaving room for improvement as the ecosystem evolves. As this framework is iterated on, clearer articulation of nearer-term KPI expectations would further enhance its usefulness for evaluating proposals within individual budget cycles.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "YUTA",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmSE1WtaQTSTZpQA46hsqpM4xtxamuqHQeHyGA9CnEXPgD -->\r\n# YUTA\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano 2030 Vision, Mission, Strategy Framework and KPIs\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2200we9c904un36tzaearntzzl63snffuul9qsk0te4utqfkke0w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting YES for \"Cardano 2030: Vision, Mission, Strategy Framework and KPIs\".\r\n\r\nI have read these and did not identify any major issues.\r\n\r\nThere are some concerns, such as the fact that TVL KPIs are listed first and that their definitions seem somewhat vague. However, even taking these into account, the risks of moving forward with Catalyst, CBDAO, and Treasury Withdrawal without a Vision or KPIs are extremely high. Even if we read this many times and identify 100 small improvements, I believe that the first version should be approved as soon as possible.\r\nIf there are no major issues, I personally think it would be best to approve this first and make small improvements after approval.\r\n\r\nThe formulation of KPIs will not only have medium- to long-term effects, but is also expected to have the following short-term effects, which will greatly help the ecosystem from January 2026:\r\n\r\n- It would be great if this were approved before the start of Catalyst F15 on January 12th, and an efficient F15 proposal that is deeply compatible with this roadmap would be listed.\r\n- The weekly DM inquiries about Treasury Withdrawal could be discussed mainly based on compatibility with this Vision and KPIs. \r\n\r\nーーー\r\n\r\n「Cardano 2030: Vision, Mission, Strategy Framework and KPIs」にYESを投票します。\r\n\r\nこれらを読み、大きな問題を特定しませんでした。\r\nTVLのKPIが最初に挙げられていることやその定義がやや曖昧なように見えることなど少し気になる点はありますが、それらを加味しても、VisionやKPIがない状態のままCatalyst、CBDAO、トレジャリーウィズドローを先へ進めることのリスクは非常に大きく、仮に今後何回もこれを読み込んで細かな100の改良点を仮に特定したとしても、最初のバージョンを早急に承認すべきだと考えています。\r\n大きな問題がなければ、まずはこれを承認して、細かな改良はこれの承認後に行うのが良いと個人的に考えています。\r\n\r\nKPI策定は中長期的な効果だけではなく、短期的に次のような効果も期待され、2026年1月からエコシステムを大いに助けます。\r\n\r\n・1月12日のCatalyst F15開始前前にこれが承認され、このロードマップへ深い適合性があり効率的な F15の提案書がリストアップされると、Catalyst投票がより\r\n・毎週ベースでDMでくるトレジャリーウィズドローの相談について、このVisionへの適合性を中心として議論できる。",
      "vote": "YES"
    }
  ],
