      "voter": "A$Y",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPLNi278vrsJeTdKyqc9wBDDrWhdLsrZiJPEeLWmBrLrd -->\r\n# A$Y\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf94hp0xetd87e5stlxwrtlqwjq6qhqx6zfdu94wdr5dfagp38nd4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is a respectful, symbolic action that honors a real contributor to Cardano. I’m happy to support it.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "AdaLovelace777",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AdaLovelace777/We-Love-Max-Van-Rossem-/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context%20(75).jsonld -->\r\n# AdaLovelace777\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygehgu65kchqm929zp69xhl06hqkpcjv0rzy44sx40qhufqgh3xv2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting yes for this proposal because it honors Max van Rossem, a community hero whose contributions fundamentally shaped Cardano's governance framework and Constitution! Max wasn't just a participant—he was integral to electing the first Constitutional Committee and was a primary driving force behind Article VIII in our founding documents. As both a dedicated DRep with the Dutch DRep Collective and founder of AdaMoments, he enabled real on-chain use cases that let ada holders preserve their personal moments forever. This tribute continues the cherished tradition of hard forks named after impactful contributors like Vasil, Chang, and Plomin, weaving lasting memories for their families and our entire ecosystem. We Love You Max <3",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
