      "voter": "ADAR_Chris",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmZS9qxTwds4picxnuHoHtrZxEHXBgaDBatS4MDtN4JrKF -->\r\n# ADAR_Chris\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y26nj0u86z00s2c6yteecduedrzxxrxrn39th5mau0h0r5gszp025`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nDidn't know Max, but the community supports it so I do as well.",
