    {
      "voter": "BWtake(長崎)Japan",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreibk7syku3homvtusmskppoo2oq7xi762mmbq6dylilnory24fulrm -->\r\n# BWtake(長崎)Japan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytcw6qzpqqclx2yd0zy64ztvlkkhnf6yrzza8whgnq4vz5gh89626`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVasil がプロトコルの成熟を、Chang／Plomin がガバナンス思想の整理を象徴したとすれば、\r\nMax van Rossem は 制度面の具体化と実装に大きく貢献した人物です。\r\n特に、Cardano 憲法の策定や、初の完全選出型・憲法委員会（CC）選挙において重要な役割を果たしました。\r\n推測ですが、彼の継続的な関与がなければ、これらの制度整備はより時間を要していた可能性があります。\r\nその意味で、Protocol Version 11 に彼の名を冠することは、Cardano のガバナンス史を振り返る上で妥当な判断だと考えます。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhile Vasil symbolized the maturation of the protocol and Chang / Plomin the consolidation of governance ideas,\r\nMax van Rossem made significant contributions to the practical design and implementation of governance institutions.\r\nHe played an important role in the development of the Cardano Constitution and in the process leading to the first fully elected Constitutional Committee (CC).\r\nIt is reasonable to assume that without his sustained involvement,\r\nthese governance milestones may have taken longer to achieve.\r\nFrom this perspective, naming Protocol Version 11 after him is a reasonable and historically consistent choice.",
