      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreidii3pomua4r3vhwrmpktsulvchputye3ktblxvay22z2c7ysbjay -->\r\n# Cardanians\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yt4lyf0fwlrz8k6j5evd3rxw0sqp67qkh36su98a97q3qsc0h03y4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCardano has a tradition of naming hard forks after people who truly shaped the ecosystem. Naming PV11 the “van Rossem Hard Fork” is a heartfelt way to honor Max van Rossem’s governance work. Especially his contributions to the constitution and the early Constitutional Committee election process. \r\n\r\nRest in peace Max.",
