    {
      "voter": "Cardano Feed",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreib5llwet62vza5qr6hl3snjnogxkzj3zjv74z72igtquy5t2xmz5y -->\r\n# Cardano Feed\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftjewhpvtdd8t7swtmtp44px94ns3laytmjc3u7f93qvhswmwv5f`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support this proposal.\r\nMax van Rossem made meaningful and lasting contributions to Cardano’s governance and community. Naming this hard fork in his memory honors his work and follows Cardano’s tradition of recognizing impactful contributors.\r\nYES vote.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
