    {
      "voter": "SASA_nagamaru_ながまる",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmZz52KbbDdGC2ZTSt1mveKaT2fycN9KihEnuaMtDWi7rb -->\r\n# SASA_nagamaru_ながまる\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytuddrgqca0xd4aams6pl9zndpcmxg0rs7z3mggjelm6kscp4arg5`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote YES on naming Protocol Version 11 the “van Rossem Hard Fork.”\r\n\r\nMax van Rossem made meaningful and lasting contributions to Cardano’s governance, including the Constitution and the first fully elected Constitutional Committee. Naming this hard fork in his memory is a respectful way to recognize his impact and to continue Cardano’s tradition of honoring community contributors.\r\n\r\nProtocol Version 11 を「van Rossem Hard Fork」と命名することにYESを投票します。\r\n\r\nMax van Rossem氏は、Cardano憲法や初の完全選挙制による憲法委員会の成立を含め、ガバナンス分野において長期的に価値のある貢献を残しました。本ハードフォークを彼の名で呼ぶことは、その功績を称え、コミュニティの歴史として記憶に残す適切な形だと考えます。",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SIDAN Lab Testing DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sidan-lab/DRep/refs/heads/main/voting-history/test/rationale.jsonld -->\r\n# SIDAN Lab Testing DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytjrttn43cyz6sde85shqvl33k22ynjxx85j2h6h5ns42tqafqudl`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIt is a testing governance voting transaction only.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SIPO",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreifshfqh26cp3n4lg5a75sxj3nc24nc2uavurf2z7eazypbeendzly -->\r\n# SIPO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yffld2866p00cyg3ejjdewtvazgah7jjgk0s9m7m5ytmmdq33v3zh`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSIPO DRep – Voting Rationale (Yes)\r\nGovernance Action: Protocol Version 11 hard fork – van Rossem\r\nVote: Yes\r\n\r\nAs SIPO DRep, we vote Yes on this proposal.\r\n\r\nThis Governance Action is an Info Action that does not introduce technical changes, economic parameter updates, or protocol risk. Instead, it proposes naming Protocol Version 11 the “van Rossem Hard Fork”, in memory of Max van Rossem, a respected contributor to the Cardano community.\r\n\r\nFrom my perspective as a DRep, this proposal should be evaluated not on emotional grounds, but on its institutional and governance significance.\r\n\r\nCardano has a long-standing tradition of naming hard forks in ways that reflect its history, values, and contributors. This practice is not cosmetic. It plays an important role in shaping Cardano as a long-lived public infrastructure with memory, accountability, and continuity. We see this proposal as a continuation of that tradition.\r\n\r\nMax van Rossem made substantial and lasting contributions to Cardano’s governance foundations. His work on the Cardano Constitution, his role in the Constitutional Committee election process, and his participation as a DRep represent the kind of long-term, community-oriented engagement that Cardano’s governance model depends on. Recognizing such contributions at the protocol-history level sends a clear and healthy signal to current and future participants.\r\n\r\nAs DReps, one of our responsibilities is to help cultivate a governance culture where participation matters, contributions are remembered, and responsibility is shared across time. Supporting this proposal reinforces that principle without introducing technical or economic trade-offs.\r\n\r\nWe also believe that abstaining or opposing an Info Action of this nature would not meaningfully protect the network, while potentially weakening the message that Cardano values sustained, constructive governance work. In contrast, supporting this proposal strengthens the social and institutional layer of Cardano without imposing costs or risks.\r\n\r\nFor these reasons, SIPO DRep supports this proposal and votes Yes.\r\n\r\nWe do so not as an act of sentiment, but as an expression of support for Cardano’s maturing governance framework and its ability to preserve the legacy of those who helped build it.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSIPO DRep 投票理由（Yes）\r\nガバナンス・アクション: Protocol Version 11 hard fork – van Rossem\r\n投票: Yes（賛成）\r\n\r\nSIPO DRepとして、本提案には Yes（賛成） を投じます。\r\n\r\n本提案は Info Action であり、技術仕様や経済パラメータ、プロトコルの安全性に影響を与えるものではありません。Protocol Version 11 のハードフォーク名称を 「van Rossem Hard Fork」 とすることを提案する、象徴的かつ制度的な内容です。\r\n\r\n私はDRepとして、この提案を「感情的な追悼」ではなく、Cardanoガバナンスの成熟と文化形成という観点から評価しました。\r\n\r\nCardanoではこれまで、ハードフォークの命名を通じて、その時代の価値観や貢献、歴史をプロトコルに刻んできました。これは単なる名称の問題ではなく、Cardanoを「長期的に運用される公共インフラ」として位置づける重要な文化的要素だと考えています。\r\n\r\nMax van Rossem氏は、Cardano憲法の策定、憲法委員会（CC）選挙プロセス、DRepとしての活動など、ガバナンスの基盤形成に深く関わってきた方です。こうした貢献を、プロトコルの歴史に残る形で記憶することは、現在そして将来の参加者にとっても健全なメッセージになると考えます。\r\n\r\nDRepの役割の一つは、「参加すれば意味がある」「貢献は制度として記憶される」というガバナンス文化を育てることです。本提案は、その方向性を強化するものであり、しかも技術的・経済的なリスクを伴いません。\r\n\r\nこのような性質のInfo Actionに対して、反対や棄権を行うことは、ネットワークを守るという点では実質的な効果が薄く、むしろCardanoが築いてきたガバナンス文化のメッセージを弱めてしまう可能性があります。一方で、本提案を支持することは、Cardanoの制度的成熟を静かに後押しする選択だと考えています。\r\n\r\n以上の理由から、SIPO DRepは本提案に Yes（賛成） を投じます。\r\n\r\nこれは個人的な感情による判断ではなく、Cardanoのガバナンスがより強く、持続的なものになることを支持する立場からの判断です。",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Socious",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQjyw6Hjhb6HCu4t8JEBDrvLh4zBRNgK7D7vXpmBjRktP -->\r\n# Socious\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytcv4ax77s0enqef56qjflf4d8zjgxulukme9uf5p8cfaagysjppn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSocious votes “Yes” to [**Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem](https://tempo.vote/governance-action?governanceActionId=8845bfc37bb2f69e8f200fe28148b3dea3c4399b0c49ee0ed2bb4e349cab9eb7%230), because** Max was a great contributor to the ecosystem and it’s a great idea to honor his life by naming a hard fork after him. \r\n\r\nソーシャスは[**Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem](https://tempo.vote/governance-action?governanceActionId=8845bfc37bb2f69e8f200fe28148b3dea3c4399b0c49ee0ed2bb4e349cab9eb7%230)に賛成します。**Maxはエコシステムに大きく貢献した人物であり、彼の人生を称えてハードフォークに彼の名前を冠することは素晴らしいアイデアです。",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "STORM Partners",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmRLZuqftyDAPxEyCyeaAxajkDJ4KmP1P2V7rFKWjrZwjZ -->\r\n# STORM Partners\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf0s5guxklwlqn7ttdpfwmmkaucwaqkkm6hzncy8nful5fgemurcj`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSTORM Partners votes YES on the Protocol Version 11 hard fork. Beyond the technical advancements this upgrade brings to the network, we strongly support the decision to name this milestone in honor of Pieter van Rossem. Although we did not have the privilege of meeting Pieter in person, we recognize his reputation as a valuable and enthusiastic builder whose passion helped shape the ecosystem. We are proud to cast this vote as a tribute to his legacy, ensuring his dedication is memorialized within the protocol’s history.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
