    {
      "voter": "The Dutch Drep",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmamwFX6dQtsHaZfo3jbCGcNRchnbbi7nVhPwTck1QVFHf -->\r\n# The Dutch Drep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yvve4554njxyun2s5p9q70v88d5jl7r0h34pjhw5f5tmw3sjtrutp`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe, the Dutch DRep, vote Yes.\r\n\r\nMax brought joy, kindness, and a positive spirit to the Cardano community. He had a rare ability to bring people together, and his warmth and thoughtful presence left a lasting impression on everyone who met him.\r\n\r\nMany of us are still mourning his loss. He is deeply missed—not only as a community member, but as a friend.\r\n\r\nNaming this hard fork after Max is a meaningful way to honor the love, memories, and impact he left behind.",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
