    {
      "voter": "Varavas",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmbp73PciXtJS1w9t7GWEzy4LMcmdA5r28Q24S5pu8tB7v -->\r\n# Varavas\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yte3chru8m7d3gzgpwvmgan0gjfxru9r9cyvrkkcerc0wcg6qfvtc`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI never met Max, but I do appreciate all his work and love for the Cardano ecosystem",
