      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmXxdNgYm8P7hi7Tthc9an5qXBFXQk7f8R6zHa3MB3fgVx -->\r\n# YUTA\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2200we9c904un36tzaearntzzl63snffuul9qsk0te4utqfkke0w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote YES for \"Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem\".\r\n\r\nHe was a committed member, so there is no reason to object to this.\r\n\r\n私は「Name Protocol Version 11 hard fork - van Rossem」にYESを投票します。\r\n\r\n彼は献身的なメンバーでしたので、これに反対する理由はありません。",
