      "voter": "AdaStat",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://adastat.net/_meta/drep/vote56-57.jsonld -->\r\n# AdaStat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳5M for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfe9en4hsgc3r6nhtmwjeljh06hgnvt9yzzkwqcftvdj34cdxdg7u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have already supported a broader budget proposal that addresses the listing of multiple tokens. While I do think that exchange listings can benefit the Cardano ecosystem as a whole, I am voting No here since this proposal targets only one specific token.",
