    {
      "voter": "AKYO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmehUKA7o35y5SMSQMw7PGA2KbtDHT3yZjmbKCCpG9sEnL -->\r\n# AKYO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳5M for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yts3qdjsqcnhld4r3uek2uu0n2tnh824tgnf75a83q3yhequuy54u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n本提案に反対します。現行の憲法上、この提案は違憲となるため可決は難しいと考えます。さらに、SNEKの上場支援は特定トークンに偏っており、Cardano全体への還元効果は限定的であると判断します。\\n\\nI vote No on this proposal. Under the current Constitution, this proposal is unconstitutional and therefore unlikely to be approved. Furthermore, supporting the listing of SNEK is overly focused on a single token, and I believe its benefits to the broader Cardano ecosystem are limited.",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
    {
      "voter": "AltcoinOracle",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmTqJVPbdd3NWzrRTa17wjy7hr9Zp8sMgg355cPQPPbHR3 -->\r\n# AltcoinOracle\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳5M for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygvgk3899qm38zth07z5clhfjvzfhe2mf2kvkqrfxp93r5srjre5s`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI'm voting NO because I don't believe the treasury should be used for marketing or listings.\r\n\r\nMy top priorities as a DRep are: prioritizing core engineering, protecting the treasury, decentralizing influence, and investing in real-world assets (RWAs).\r\n\r\nStrength and honor.",
