      "voter": "Blockjock (James Meidinger)",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreighfits6dyra5sn6xyxnoonjx2sw3d7dcdfravhqo67pwdrtqgovy -->\r\n# Blockjock (James Meidinger)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳5M for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygnypzfv2v8fmfelthahvn0rqyh54sf6z2aa5m7f3fkjgqqt8l2qq`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nN/A",
