      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreieiyamhixxgqqf5rcilv3ipvwsoepjybhntvazd3h5w4cpgie7dki -->\r\n# Kevin G Mohr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳5M for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytwn2u7qpy4ur7k3xqd7eehft3g2yjpxf46rugwzmndkyesd0m5nt`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSame as my other SNEK rational.",
