      "voter": "Peter Bui",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pbwebdev/drep/refs/heads/main/r/25/250812_snek_1d6aea56e6a5.jsonld -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳5M for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support the Snek project and see its value in the Cardano community. I do not want to block its growth.\r\nThe request for ₳5M is a large spend with limited proven benefit to the wider ecosystem. There is no clear return on investment or detailed plan. The proposal also skips the required information governance action step.\r\nAbstaining reflects my personal support for the project while signalling that the funding request is too high and lacks the process standards I expect.",
