      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmbrw78jPjWAQhw8dj7SYgucpgCQUpuUMSw3fdhhjNiQSV -->\r\n# punkr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳5M for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfyl9j6amk940g76r7ujnn5gywnjenv3kmun3a5tr5a83psl4vv64`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis proposal’s focus on just one memecoin, SNEK, for exchange listings feels too narrow and risky for Cardano’s treasury, so I vote no. Also a broader approach would better boost Cardano’s growth and fairness across the ecosystem.",
