    {
      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmYaNifFUXLY4NG8LgzCayKx3akkbKTFyrLDCWYt8zxWB8 -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳3,126,000 for Ecosystem Exchange Listing and Market Making service\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmNpunedoRqGYtRWnCchgiZ83eZb2TL4Dp6NUMV65Fkt5o\r\n\r\nI appreciate the goal here, but I will be voting **NO** due to concerns about the proposed approach.\r\n\r\nA key issue is the potential dependency on a single project like DexHunter for infrastructure. Furthermore, any treasury-funded service should be open to all native assets, not a curated few. For true **decentralization** and fairness, we should prioritize open standards like Rosetta, which provide a more cost-effective and permissionless path for the entire ecosystem.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "DeepStatecraft",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmVxSgGn5EdwDYG7erirk6WrC98adJ7CSBdneG54NwUtnX -->\r\n# DeepStatecraft\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳3,126,000 for Ecosystem Exchange Listing and Market Making service\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfr0cur4guksjd6whxe5mltcaksqqhzd85dnq6lfk8ex7qs5mlcye`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n✅ Voted YES on Ecosystem Exchange Listing & MMAAS (Flowdesk)\r\n\r\n💡 Why I support it:\r\n• Solves 2 major gaps in Cardano:\r\n 1️⃣ No top-tier market makers (except SNEK, IAGON)\r\n 2️⃣ No CNTs on major exchanges like Binance, Kraken, Coinbase\r\n• Creates a funding pool to help Cardano tokens get listed & supported\r\n• Transparent structure — Flowdesk gets no funds from Treasury directly\r\n• Boosts liquidity, visibility, and credibility of Cardano projects\r\n• MMAAS retainer support for top CNTs like SNEK, MIN, USDM, DJED, etc.\r\n• Guardrails via 3rd-party assessment + direct exchange payments\r\n\r\nExchange access and liquidity are critical for CNT adoption — this initiative gives serious projects a path to break through.\r\n\r\nDRep: DeepStatecraft\r\nFull vote log at 👉 https://tempo.vote/drep-profile",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
