    {
      "voter": "CASIA- Cardano Asia Team",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmRbQaYoaXkS3quM5yhXDn3XXMwgpGuJjCKC4gSWP4Vyvx -->\r\n# CASIA- Cardano Asia Team\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳45,217 for MLabs Core Tool Maintenance & Enhancement Cardano.nix\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytcy6lfas0zu4axuzw2ncal2k2mh6u8srt5c63fpgq3zg8cd2437d`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI voted YES on all 39 Governance Actions — 39 times, 39 votes.\r\n\r\nSince I supported these during Ekklesia and saw no major changes or conflicts of interest, I still stand by those decisions. \r\n\r\nFor proposals with large budgets (>500k ADA), I paid extra attention to the justification and scope. Voting isn’t just a click — it’s a responsibility. I own mine, for myself and for our CASIA community.",
