      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWsynM4aEdFvwAKwKReadVUXqeoXeXpm7CUe9BPqGVbVA -->\r\n# Long Hồ\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳45,217 for MLabs Core Tool Maintenance & Enhancement Cardano.nix\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yttfrpngasw7yrdryydsg66gzv8znkj0stjngm5a8hs353stdeml6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a DRep, I vote Yes. Cardano.nix simplifies node deployment with Nix, ensuring reproducible setups and fewer errors for SPOs and developers. Already used by IOG and Daedalus, it’s a proven tool. Led by the experienced MLabs team, this focused proposal promises high impact.",
