      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWdYjR6CiMqBf6m8sUHr2Gr69EkFYFR4WQ571m96jungB -->\r\n# Nasia\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳45,217 for MLabs Core Tool Maintenance & Enhancement Cardano.nix\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfn4n94zl2ahpcn3yu6q7v0vla7nw7qj4x23nzc5qvsudygcrn3zn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nMLabs has a mature track record, while the budget is a small maintenance request and the community impact is modest but necessary for developer infrastructure. \r\n\r\nAlso --> previous continuation of funding shows consistency.",
