    {
      "voter": "SureWealthNG",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Henro1975/SureWealthNG/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context%20(3).jsonld -->\r\n# SureWealthNG\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳45,217 for MLabs Core Tool Maintenance & Enhancement Cardano.nix\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2t8w2rtcyfh3f863gqcwmru7lafuszmvy0xhg7xjwdpwgcf2kz87`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support this ₳45,217 treasury withdrawal to maintain and enhance Cardano.nix, a critical infrastructure tool used by developers and node operators. Maintained by MLabs, it ensures reliable, reproducible deployments across the Cardano ecosystem. The proposal aligns with the approved ₳275M ecosystem budget, follows constitutional funding rules, and uses audited smart contracts for transparency. This is a low-cost, high-impact investment in Cardano’s technical backbone.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Terminada",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminadaDrep/vote-contexts/refs/heads/main/20250726/001.jsonld -->\r\n# Terminada\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳45,217 for MLabs Core Tool Maintenance & Enhancement Cardano.nix\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytf9f78k7rkwk4cu6l2nvna22keu9yus4kqzc0hqspd36uszu0xc2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVote changed.  It is not clear how many users prefer to use NixOS.  I think the money could be better spent on packaging Cardano software for mainstream Linux distributions using their built in package managers.  Eg: Building deb packages for Debian and Debian derived distributions such as Ubuntu, Mint, etc.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
