      "voter": "wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUDpFdbeXsZMXyHh8f73nfn52sWNGsNWu3LYcLucJh6T4 -->\r\n# wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** 2025 Cardano NCL\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfa8r8r36x7x05htftce7qhafrn5nzzr6vazy95pzy6y5dqac0ss7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSwitching to abstain due to Intersect budget being lower than expected, if not to what I would have desired.",
