      "voter": "BWtake(長崎)Japan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWX5BPJctJmLkXK3EfJVfSuW7zAu9bZd5oYZLyQrPPHbC -->\r\n# BWtake(長崎)Japan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.0\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytcw6qzpqqclx2yd0zy64ztvlkkhnf6yrzza8whgnq4vz5gh89626`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nこの憲法改訂は、分散型ガバナンス文書としての明瞭性・実用性を高め、不要な制約を取り除く合理的な改善です。提案の構成、比較資料、IPFSでの提示内容も透明性が高く、Cardano憲法の成熟に貢献すると判断し、賛成票を投じます。\r\n***\r\nThis update to the Cardano Constitution enhances clarity, removes redundant constraints, and improves practical usability for decentralized governance. Given the transparency of the proposal, including a detailed list of changes via IPFS, I support this revision and vote YES.",
