      "voter": "CardaFlow",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmfDx8wmKPog1SsFdRCngHRhV2PJhjuZ2Kbm8CjGzq8nZq -->\r\n# CardaFlow\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.0\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y279cte2lujj9lde4lmz07wsku5fvra69htrleyx9ahr60cn42uaa`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nv2.0 brings some tangible improvements e.g.\r\n-Removal of the Budget Info Action and establishing the auditing/administrator/oversight requirements in the Treasury Withdrawal instead\r\n-Removing requirement for dRep Codes of Conduct (as these were generally unenforceable anyways)\r\nIMO, still some cleaning to do on unenforceable aspects and off-chain liabilities, but overall going in the right direction...",
