      "voter": "Chris-O",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmRfjdUiYS5HXQwqGmh5oKqgB4UxyfCf41cFoXgxkQA6Uy -->\r\n# Chris-O\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.0\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y25xtvu3d0gaf6cxktr9pkfgnywmqsh4fum93s8m3hlp4aqj3uqdp`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nGood effort but needs iteration. NCL and the need for change or removal is not addressed, info actions are a  necessary function in governance, mingovaction cost of 100k ADA is not addressed are 3 examples. Additionally any changes to current constitution should require a larger feedback and debate mechanism amongst the broader community",
