      "voter": "Crypto Eats Legacy",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmfHk9XeKcoiVoP5JhuAqAVUPPjGXaZZ12zKLdpDybepqY -->\r\n# Crypto Eats Legacy\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.0\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytd2mf58tfqv78z7e99fy0gnmfep0kscclnwpvx7qvwpc5srxwg5g`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI understand this to be a net positive to the constitution, fixing some minor issues and streamlining.",
