      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmV1skG8Edzg5s14e9ZEc8HR1AsUgKBo37MHGc7EQgABjv -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.0\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting Abstain. The proposal introduces changes to the Constitution without sufficient community debate or detailed explanation of their implications. My concern is with the process and lack of participation, not with the idea of improving the Constitution, which I recognise does need refinement.",
