      "voter": "DeepStatecraft",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmeATNXXDD8jG1pMgg7gofcRzUecx8wuemQRvxQv9TR9Uy -->\r\n# DeepStatecraft\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.0\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfr0cur4guksjd6whxe5mltcaksqqhzd85dnq6lfk8ex7qs5mlcye`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n✅ Voting YES – Cardano Constitution v2.0\r\n\r\nThis update isn’t about rewriting our principles — it’s about making them clearer, cleaner, and easier to use.\r\n\r\nKey reasons for my YES:\r\n\t•\tFixes typos, inconsistencies, and vague language.\r\n\t•\tSimplifies structure so the Constitution is easier to reference and understand.\r\n\t•\tAdds and refines key definitions for clarity.\r\n\t•\tRemoves outdated or unused provisions like the DRep/SPO Codes of Conduct.\r\n\t•\tAligns appendices with the main articles for consistency.\r\n\r\nA well-written Constitution is a stronger Constitution. This version keeps the spirit of v1.0 while making it more practical for everyone who uses it.\r\n\r\n#CardanoGovernance #DRep #VoteYES",
