      "voter": "No stress",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmZrMfxBjcQJapajfvTb7dpFEb5o9Rmvxj5S5aBcVVxgY8 -->\r\n# No stress\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.0\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2t3t35yx7j8nnh3wkqn2zzhgwqksksn85zv62pjrwzjawczwgyv7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThere are some good elements here like streamlining the process but there are many changes in scope that makes me uncomfortable. I think a smaller change set would pass.",
