      "voter": "punkr",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmd9JGNTRwV8dbyZ6X9tSNXr5cdTP2DYrmdCcE53RrxphE -->\r\n# punkr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.0\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfyl9j6amk940g76r7ujnn5gywnjenv3kmun3a5tr5a83psl4vv64`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nv2 represents an evolution of the Cardano Constitution, making it more robust, user-friendly, and adaptable for a growing decentralised ecosystem.",
