      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmTGHKKJKKhDBRA8bSjGk8viDnjRWcwbVPTQjcaHxXVxMP -->\r\n# Rbaker2024\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.0\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg7k2kqw0ghh5r3auvazthsrh20x74mcecfyt997za679pqxchhlr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmaDeKD8aqKcRsjXjxidN2F9ryuCLz5ZMJt8vvQkLuFQkd\r\n\r\nI agree with the change. Good change!",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
