      "content": "<!-- url: https://adastat.net/_meta/drep/vote8.jsonld -->\r\n# AdaStat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Blockchain Ecosystem Budget - 275M ada Administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfe9en4hsgc3r6nhtmwjeljh06hgnvt9yzzkwqcftvdj34cdxdg7u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI think this step mostly adds delays and confusion, since 67% is already needed in the final vote. But since it's part of the process now, I'm voting Yes to let projects move forward.",
