    {
      "voter": "Angel Castillo",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmP2YCFL9G6NgMQmUY7n3EJEPMLUNLC1XFqfmt9EKicj1b -->\r\n# Angel Castillo\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Blockchain Ecosystem Budget - 275M ada Administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg4mxhwlct5crvnkqpqy06l6lrszn0f4cyc5k2hv0pk8xhsvluu37`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI voted YES on the Budget Info Action because it is a procedural step to advance the budgeting process under the Constitution, it does not itself allocate funds. Actual funding will require Treasury Withdrawal proposals, passing a high 67% threshold. That provides enough protection against unvetted spending.",
