      "voter": "Latam Cardano",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdevcXWjfBGH53GW3yDmxwogQCqo68ECcZxeVAdLrqzjs -->\r\n# Latam Cardano\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano x Draper Dragon Orion Fund\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytgsdkfznvjnwdxrzvf8x6tn4ctfukqqphsammzkfwatgsqgnpf2w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nDraper has been profoundly supporting Carano's ecosystem at a layer where there was a void. The proposed format of expanding such support aligns all the involved actors interests. We support this initiative.",
