      "voter": "Liudmila Korovina",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiazk2pmq72ltonud6xdj7y2pbwp3ryr4oen76ohko6enpgm3qsfu4 -->\r\n# Liudmila Korovina\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano x Draper Dragon Orion Fund\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfpwp2v9kmgqn3trvjvs2s7yp9y60xcgxqnut6h2tw68y8svcqqxf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\ngreat",
