      "voter": "No stress",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmaMwVquwpG7Bbadbo3TPM7epWSNsi5DZVL73SZgzNyGvL -->\r\n# No stress\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano x Draper Dragon Orion Fund\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2t3t35yx7j8nnh3wkqn2zzhgwqksksn85zv62pjrwzjawczwgyv7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nGo forth and conquer team Dragon",
