    {
      "voter": "Dan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmVRdQ4JCvKRKEsu7xxuuXc6Z6mUYtQGttR63WqboviQbg -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano GovTool Budget - 12 months full active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am changing my vote on the GovTool proposal from Yes to Abstain. I support GovTool’s mission but believe a smaller budget could cover core maintenance and improvements. I also attempted to use GovTools to vote on treasury withdraws, but encountered errors several times while doing so. Others also reported issues voting. This makes me hesitant to vote yes on additional funding until the product is working as intended. Once these issues have been resolved, I would support a leaner GovTools proposal.",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmQGLz2vLyreY6vRx2Chv8Uy6rcHMmcnLDLybP4MDZsphs -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano GovTool Budget - 12 months full active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmZnnQsvubb3SBgPCX949bsyiXWhPpP65qxXWqf8cSPAqD\r\n\r\n---\r\n## Govtool Funding Proposal: Vote No\r\n---\r\nGovtool's current **unreliability** directly impedes effective **governance participation**, thereby undermining trust and hindering Cardano's overall **growth and sustainability**. Prioritizing **stability** and **proven reliability** before further funding is crucial for the long-term health of the ecosystem.",
      "vote": "NO"
