    {
      "voter": "DeepStatecraft",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPjetqgZidzLjefomm7raYRWrcbZT1f9mwiDVjytW2Ara -->\r\n# DeepStatecraft\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano GovTool Budget - 12 months full active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfr0cur4guksjd6whxe5mltcaksqqhzd85dnq6lfk8ex7qs5mlcye`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nGovTool is mission-critical open‑source infrastructure for Cardano governance. This proposal is well‑structured, community-led, and cost‑optimized. I strongly support funding it at Level 3 to ensure robust maintenance, feature development, and contributor incentives.",
