      "voter": "Donin",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPdMsCsC8bzhYAeSJuNaoBJ74piie9kYDDQPUC1EkYALs -->\r\n# Donin\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano GovTool Budget - 12 months full active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftnl7amr6zfjylymmfdzjndrrk4klxp8yd7kc8zv7vdyjsxmhugn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIsn't the tempo.vote platform, which I primarily use and prefer for its slightly better user experience, essentially offering similar functionality to the promising open-source, decentralized alternative developed by the Cardano Foundation?",
