    {
      "voter": "drep1yf6xkrz2w4fdkwjw9u98u3pmzk7c7a0amq95hakcj649dns2r4upl",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmW2bg4YHMmanbdUYbibrvJoFV36kCxN6TLUh8Vk4anrXu -->\r\n# drep1yf6xkrz2w4fdkwjw9u98u3pmzk7c7a0amq95hakcj649dns2r4upl\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano GovTool Budget - 12 months full active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf6xkrz2w4fdkwjw9u98u3pmzk7c7a0amq95hakcj649dns2r4upl`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSolid team and good progression/ show of commitment and skill of team to deliver, but waaaaaay waaaaaayy too expensive. However, given lack of alternatives (tempo.vote exists, but its proposal is too bad to consider serious), and lack of history, this is ok as a start in the first year. Would not vote on the same amounts again next year though.",
