      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreigufztuktbfodnw6neqmbwghwoiofmtmqwd5rk7gno73yqasoqsai -->\r\n# Big Lazy Cat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳70,000,000 for Cardano Critical Integrations Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yffcjs0njfea09xhs6up429rhya5pxd7qz7hvmwq6vqy2nczwpj3g`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSupport. This withdrawal executes the budget I already approved and delivers essential integrations for Cardano.",
