      "voter": "Blockjock (James Meidinger)",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmY66rj4Ky7EvTTNsP9bvRUAmNV9Jf1R4TFN8pN53N3BG9 -->\r\n# Blockjock (James Meidinger)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳70,000,000 for Cardano Critical Integrations Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygnypzfv2v8fmfelthahvn0rqyh54sf6z2aa5m7f3fkjgqqt8l2qq`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCarrying on from the info action, please refer to my rationale in the info action",
