      "voter": "Hermes Stakepool Germany (HRMS)",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreibftg7bnhbfxs4grl6l2pulbyhd67prepr4q2kegnhb7p66gwvkrq -->\r\n# Hermes Stakepool Germany (HRMS)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳70,000,000 for Cardano Critical Integrations Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygs5hngva3hymv7j4v0aewxpsjqskj9dnmy7j3jz5ven5zqvulq2t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhile the amount is huge those initiatives are highly needed - therefore voted yes to get the ball rolling.",
