      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmbCxu35G4bfuUG4WjpYrpAHaGJJye9u2xp9Bb3mVYHmX6 -->\r\n# HOSKY\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳70,000,000 for Cardano Critical Integrations Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf2jzhuc4f7eu2yay9d9ta3dykxxcwn34wz8kak7nhd7vcgrxn7ns`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmdFKTJFf8dGACdxmM8pyUVHUNmrwM4itBaTeUnXNA7Nwb\r\n\r\nYES. Funds critical infrastructure (stablecoins, custody, oracles) needed for real adoption. Milestone-based drawdowns and oversight reduce risk. Large spend, but justified if integrations deliver measurable Layer 1 impact and long-term sustainability.",
