    {
      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmb3ywHKsyE5Sy7mL4mY4sr6EnoyzA8Amn5gB1uKU2xKjq -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳6,000,000 for Cardano Summit 2025 and regional tech events\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe vote yes. Cardano Summit is an important event each year for the Cardano ecosystem. There is a lot of useful information and plans announced at this event.",
      "vote": "YES"
