      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUSw2tza45UcmSJz2p7E84mPjAN2CUY5TDkk53NnTWFvg -->\r\n# AustinAnthony\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Net Change Limit of 300 Million ADA for Epochs 613–713\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg5v33dh3pvf9xelauyd5l9qsa3yd6lezf4u7kccp3xqwjspcz3py`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA Healthy Maximum budget reduced from 350 million ADA. More long term stability will be needed later to.",
