      "voter": "CardaFlow",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmcr6CSUGndJuxnEJV8rFb9th9cWT3zLu96YKs52LyLSzP -->\r\n# CardaFlow\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Net Change Limit of 300 Million ADA for Epochs 613–713\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y279cte2lujj9lde4lmz07wsku5fvra69htrleyx9ahr60cn42uaa`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have already mentioned that 350M or even 300M NCL over 18Mo was unreasonable in my opinion.\r\n- No comprehensive lesson learned has been done from our first budget execution\r\n- Current market conditions are more than stressing\r\n- Future market conditions over next 18Mo are uncertain\r\nI would rather consider a moderate NCL e.g. 50M up to End of Q2 2026, and then a new NCL e.g. 100-250M covering our fiscal year, at the light of a consolidated budget proposal, lessons from 2025 execution and market conditions at that time",
