      "voter": "CASIA- Cardano Asia Team",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYfKZJeKezz35pTgJfVJ5vHUJ4J8j3chpKbR944NzMqcC -->\r\n# CASIA- Cardano Asia Team\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Net Change Limit of 300 Million ADA for Epochs 613–713\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytcy6lfas0zu4axuzw2ncal2k2mh6u8srt5c63fpgq3zg8cd2437d`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nreasonable as per decrease from 350 to 300m ADA. \r\n\r\nShould be a penalty for returning back to the treasury if the team fails to deliver within the promised timeframe",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
