      "voter": "Zacros",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihzgb3e5b72nngvkyjsyqjtis4pvusjxplk3sjjymfkerudrr5lwy -->\r\n# Zacros\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Net Change Limit of 300 Million ADA for Epochs 613–713\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2tp9q9vckglgkgkgcdc33jtahrstfzfj3c8ez926ysszjqp5r4ts`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nMight consider even lower around 250/275",
