    {
      "voter": "π Lanningham",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://www.314pool.com/votes/73a4eb2148781c37ef37c90a33a1d3d00511a8eefe9cdfaa1ea593b090f23f9600.jsonld -->\r\n# π Lanningham\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Net Change Limit of 300 Million ADA for Epochs 613–713\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2sld9e4nmasqfpusd5e67rwczj4l20d3653jgs38r4mams52y4jx`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting YES on governance action 73a4eb2148781c37ef37c90a33a1d3d00511a8eefe9cdfaa1ea593b090f23f96, which sets the net change limit to 300 million ADA. This represents a trending decrease in expenditures, is less than the total inflow of funds, while still representing aggressive investment in our ecosystem.\r\n\r\n You can find a larger writeup of my beliefs and values [here](https://314pool.com/posts/constitution-vote-1).",
      "vote": "YES"
