      "voter": "Kyle Solomon",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adosiawolf/drep-rationale/refs/heads/main/0019 -->\r\n# Kyle Solomon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳266,667 for Cexplorer.io -- Developer-Focused Blockchain Explorer\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytzshxuma6cwrnlv2ucyclfqw3k4nu4nuudmh2z87j9hncsk9dhy4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have voted NO on the current proposal to fund Cexplorer.io. The Cexplorer.io UX (imo) is subpar and as result this is not a site I personally rely upon. If relatively unuseful compared to competitive alternatives, how could I support when we haven't achieved anywhere close to the revenue pillars we need for ecosystem sustainability? Nah.",
