    {
      "voter": "Peter Bui",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pbwebdev/drep/refs/heads/main/r/25/250812_cexplorerio_fcfeb158aa1a.jsonld -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳266,667 for Cexplorer.io -- Developer-Focused Blockchain Explorer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis proposal is part of the approved 2025 Cardano budget and funds critical infrastructure that directly supports developers, SPOs, and users. Cexplorer.io is a proven, high-traffic platform with established reliability and a clear plan for maintenance and feature expansion. The funding aligns with the constitutional requirements for transparency, delivery assurance, and community benefit, ensuring continued availability of an essential Cardano tool.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Rudianos",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmb9PFz8JoRogdyaCMaQghhtJAHvH8DMhhhaffhg65djve -->\r\n# Rudianos\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳266,667 for Cexplorer.io -- Developer-Focused Blockchain Explorer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfv77z2fsz7nucy59lx2pkafamathf8q783lalkr3quju0gv93lq2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting in favor of approving the treasury withdrawal for all 39 withdrawal actions that are part of the approved ecosystem budget administered by Intersect. I am voting this way for several reasons, as I will outline here. This rationale will be included in all 39 withdrawal votes.\r\nFirst and foremost, I believe that we would be making a mistake in underfunding our community with our available treasury funds. The budget system as it currently stands has some flaws, as should be expected from a first version of any system. Of the current proposals, I voted to include several in the budget when it was being formed; however, I also did not vote in favor of several others. This is, of course, the case for most DReps. If I were to vote only for the proposals I initially favoured, and all other DReps did the same, we would likely approve only 2 or 3 proposals out of 39 due to the vote split. In my view, this is not an acceptable outcome for the community, and this is why I was also opposed to the idea of having 39 separate treasury withdrawal actions. I have reviewed all 39 requests, and they all have merit. Are they exactly in line with the priorities I wanted as part of the initial budget? No. Is that reason enough to vote no on several of these and end up approving only 2 or 3 proposals in the end? I certainly don't believe so.\r\nIn addition to this, the total amount of the intersect budget is roughly 10% higher than what I voted for, and I find that to be within an acceptable margin to approve all the withdrawals.\r\nThe individual proposals also all received at least 50% community approval to be included and will be subject to reviews and milestones to receive funds.\r\nFor these reasons, I am casting my vote to approve and am wishing the best of luck to all the teams waiting for funding through this process.",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SASA_nagamaru_ながまる",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmRsd68teKbg8jEvRMYekrWKSAf6DPPepb3X72imDLEqGR -->\r\n# SASA_nagamaru_ながまる\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳266,667 for Cexplorer.io -- Developer-Focused Blockchain Explorer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytuddrgqca0xd4aams6pl9zndpcmxg0rs7z3mggjelm6kscp4arg5`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote YES on this Treasury Withdrawal.\r\n\r\nCexplorer.io is a widely-used, developer-focused Cardano explorer serving over 50,000 monthly users. It provides valuable real-time insights and deep data tools that support SPOs, developers, and the wider ecosystem. Originally known as Adapools, it has demonstrated consistent value since 2020.\r\n\r\nThis proposal secures funding for both essential infrastructure maintenance and the addition of new features, including UI improvements and performance upgrades. Given its established utility and impact, funding its long-term sustainability aligns with the priorities of ecosystem infrastructure and developer experience.\r\n\r\n本提案に YES 票を投じます。\r\n\r\nCexplorer.io は、月間5万人以上のユーザーに利用されている開発者向けのCardanoエクスプローラーであり、リアルタイムかつ深いデータインサイトを提供することで、SPO、開発者、研究者など広くエコシステムに貢献しています。旧Adapoolsとして2020年から運用されており、その有用性は長く実証されています。\r\n\r\n本提案は、インフラ維持やバグ修正に加えて、UI改善や新機能追加など、今後のユーザー体験向上にも資する内容となっており、Cardanoにおける基盤的なツールの持続的な発展として支援に値します。",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SIPO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://sipo.tokyo/drep/ga/GA_TreasuryWithdrawal2025_01/20_Cexplorer_io_20250721/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# SIPO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳266,667 for Cexplorer.io -- Developer-Focused Blockchain Explorer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yffld2866p00cyg3ejjdewtvazgah7jjgk0s9m7m5ytmmdq33v3zh`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSIPO supports this proposal to fund Cexplorer.io with ₳266,667 for the following reasons:\r\n\r\n1. Essential Developer Infrastructure\r\n\r\nCexplorer.io is a high-performance, developer-focused blockchain explorer that offers advanced insights and tooling for developers, SPOs, and users within the Cardano ecosystem. In a decentralized ecosystem like Cardano, such infrastructure is critical to building trust and enabling transparency. The platform’s uptime, speed, and real-time responsiveness are vital for on-chain dApp development, delegation monitoring, and token analytics.\r\n\r\n2. Proven Track Record and Community Utility\r\n\r\nWith over 50,000 monthly users and millions of processed requests, Cexplorer.io is not a speculative product but a proven and relied-upon platform. Its predecessor, Adapools, has already established credibility and technical maturity. This usage validates both its value and necessity within the ecosystem.\r\n\r\n3. Sustainability through Treasury Investment\r\n\r\nThis proposal emphasizes sustainability and continuity through two key deliverables:\r\n\t•\tMaintenance and stability of existing infrastructure (server costs, bug fixing, and backend/frontend work).\r\n\t•\tEnhancements with new features and a better UI/UX by expanding the development team.\r\n\r\nBy securing this funding, Cardano ensures that core user and developer infrastructure remains robust, accessible, and responsive to the ecosystem’s evolving needs.\r\n\r\n4. Alignment with Cardano’s Governance and Oversight Framework\r\n\r\nThis proposal is submitted through Intersect’s structured and transparent treasury process. It includes legal contracts, milestone-based disbursement via audited smart contracts, and oversight by third-party entities such as Cardano Foundation, Sundae Labs, and NMKR. This offers both legal and operational assurance to the community regarding the responsible use of treasury funds.\r\n\r\n5. Encouraging a Developer-Centric Ecosystem\r\n\r\nCardano’s success depends on accessible, powerful tooling for developers. Cexplorer.io directly supports this by offering deep data integration and flexible tools. Continued improvement of such tools is essential to attract and retain builders and foster innovation.\r\n\r\nConclusion:\r\nSIPO believes this proposal will strengthen Cardano’s developer tooling, uphold transparency, and contribute to the long-term resilience of the ecosystem. Therefore, we vote Yes on this treasury withdrawal.\r\n\r\n⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻\r\n\r\nSIPOは、以下の理由から、Cexplorer.ioに₳266,667の資金提供を行う本提案に賛成票を投じます。\r\n\r\n1. 開発者向けの不可欠な基盤インフラ\r\n\r\nCexplorer.ioは、開発者・ステークプールオペレーター（SPO）・一般ユーザーに対して高度なオンチェーン分析とツール群を提供する高性能なブロックチェーンエクスプローラーです。分散型のCardanoエコシステムにおいて、信頼性と透明性を支えるこのようなインフラは不可欠です。リアルタイム性、速度、稼働率は、dApp開発やステーキング管理、トークン分析において重要な役割を果たします。\r\n\r\n2. 実績とコミュニティからの信頼\r\n\r\nCexplorer.ioは月間50,000人以上のユーザーを抱え、何百万件ものリクエストを処理しており、その価値はすでに実証済みです。前身のAdapools時代から信頼と技術的成熟度を備えており、投機的な製品ではなく、エコシステムにとって不可欠な存在です。\r\n\r\n3. 財務的持続性のための資金投資\r\n\r\n本提案は、以下の2点を通じて、持続可能性と継続的成長を目指しています：\r\n\t•\t現在のインフラの安定性維持（サーバー費用、バグ修正、バック/フロントエンドの保守）\r\n\t•\tUI/UX改善や新機能追加のための開発チーム拡張\r\n\r\nこの資金により、Cardanoは重要なユーザーおよび開発者向けインフラを持続可能かつ柔軟に運営していくことができます。\r\n\r\n4. Cardanoのガバナンスと監督構造との整合性\r\n\r\n本提案はIntersectの予算プロセスを通じて提出されており、法的契約、マイルストーンに基づく支払い、Sundae LabsやCardano財団、NMKRなどによる第三者監査を含む堅牢な仕組みで構成されています。これにより、財務支出に関する透明性と信頼性が担保されます。\r\n\r\n5. 開発者中心のエコシステム推進\r\n\r\nCardanoの発展には、開発者が活用できる柔軟で強力なツール群が不可欠です。Cexplorer.ioはその中心を担う存在であり、データアクセスの向上や新機能の追加を通じて、開発者の参入障壁を下げ、イノベーションを促進します。\r\n\r\n結論：\r\nSIPOは、本提案がCardanoの技術基盤の強化、透明性の向上、そしてエコシステムの持続的な成長に寄与すると判断し、「Yes」と投票します。",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
