      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYz1Zv3xiGPf9js47AQ9ovbz3FADdcooTTF67Ajc1DuPw -->\r\n# AustinAnthony\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member - Christina\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg5v33dh3pvf9xelauyd5l9qsa3yd6lezf4u7kccp3xqwjspcz3py`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAdding this constitutional committee member will get the Cardano governance ball rolling into 2026 and Christina is someone I trust to be impartial and reason well. Lets make 2026 Cardano's year Christina.",
