    {
      "voter": "Big Lazy Cat",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihs5speb55a3rvaub2bezcthdcskjac44ffo253f26awe3q3c42pu -->\r\n# Big Lazy Cat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member - Christina\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yffcjs0njfea09xhs6up429rhya5pxd7qz7hvmwq6vqy2nczwpj3g`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIf the community believes that the Constitutional Committee requires a redundancy seat, this should first be formalized through a constitutional or parameter change defining the CC structure as 7+1.\r\nWithout such a prior structural change, proposals to expand the CC around a specific candidate lack a proper governance foundation.",
