      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreicdvv4k5ugp7pumwy5ykrrjyaty2z5sgytrzcbgpgpnzl5xfmi34q -->\r\n# BTBF_XSP\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member - Christina\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2vyrqh0fa4qh4tmy7322va6ryk78uh6szppezaft0watyqp5hdwx`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis proposal is expected to avoid governance stagnation. I will instruct this proposal.",
