      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmVkVFGX64eUFFoZXpLW72JWKfHVjMhcRt3i2S5fZFqHfi -->\r\n# CardaFlow\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member - Christina\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y279cte2lujj9lde4lmz07wsku5fvra69htrleyx9ahr60cn42uaa`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nChristina had my initial vote in Ekklesia CC snap\r\nI am delighting to support the extension of CC to 1 more CC member bring us +1 from CC Min size and thus strengthening our governance resilience",
