    {
      "voter": "Chris Cata",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQQGr6qco83zspvcZHAkMzA9LGCbgUmBq9oEgRZjYy1Cz -->\r\n# Chris Cata\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member - Christina\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfdfs28uwafjgmrkatdektlzrvha2cmvqjhuz700e04mawq23rmrg`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI initially voted for Christina in the Ekklesia snap election process.  I am also in support of having more than just the minimum required for CC quorum (7) - so voting in continued support of both initiatives to strength our overall governance.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmbtUHCijS6tSZMmzRVh852w8yvP7LNpHTgQ96zsZKLE46 -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member - Christina\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmZGgpK9LAy7c5C8FNaM8rD76BwDAbqQi2p56r53tLaL5i\r\n\r\nI am voting **YES**.\r\n\r\nBy adding an 8th member, we create a **resilience buffer**. If a member resigns in the future, governance can continue uninterrupted. Christina received substantial community support in the close election, and adding this seat improves **decentralization** and stability without overriding the official winner.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Dr. Navjit Dhaliwal",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmR5ZXxLJy7vTxg5Fs74ASKAiZ4n1ZMCEVJT9QMDAn4zf5 -->\r\n# Dr. Navjit Dhaliwal\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member - Christina\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfya5pwcm2zw0e60c3pkqscq6spge7m0k6jtxkfsymv68gs2z56e5`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI voted for Christina prior to this. She deserves to be included",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "drep.collective",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/bafkreietxce27n5rfcdd35nbojtaq4gxgg5jwmqdtsflzghx2dhwjkbsra -->\r\n# drep.collective\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member - Christina\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ydwtnlvdd8atlj5c5ylgw4kg5e640vyt8resattrjmwufyg4qclf7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe acknowledge the intent of this proposal to strengthen governance resilience by adding an additional Constitutional Committee member and increasing redundancy above the minimum committee size.\r\n\r\nHowever, we believe that how redundancy is achieved is just as important as achieving it. We strongly prefer consortium- or council-style Constitutional Committee seats over additional single-person seats. Consortium-based representation allows for a broader range of expertise, internal deliberation, and more robust collective decision-making before votes reach the chain.\r\n\r\nIn our assessment, the current Constitutional Committee already includes several individual members with predominantly technical backgrounds. Adding another single-person member with a similar profile does not materially improve diversity of perspective or the overall balance of competencies within the committee.\r\n\r\nFor these reasons, while we remain supportive of improving redundancy and continuity in the Constitutional Committee, we do not believe this proposal is the most effective way to achieve that goal. We therefore vote No.",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
