      "voter": "$brock",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://brock.iagon.net/votes/2025IntersectBudgetWithdrawals.jsonld -->\r\n# $brock\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytjyvm958ywjkp57f8wm3havj72lc653tp7ajttxxt6ftgcmcmdk2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis vote aligns with my Ekklesia votes, where I voted yes to the highest priority budget line items that fit within my preferred 200m ADA budget, abstained from voting on any line items that I may have had personal interests in, and voted no to everything else.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "$Khale",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CFMatrix/Metadata-storage/refs/heads/main/Pavilions.jsonld -->\r\n# $Khale\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2ltat8kjqrmnff3lkkpxy0j5tn66d3m0gy64dc92asft5g6dl9ws`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting YES on this proposal to fund Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions with ₳889,500.\r\n\r\nThis initiative addresses a critical need to make Cardano projects more visible and accessible at influential exhibitions globally. By subsidizing (not fully covering) project participation, the proposal enables diverse Cardano teams to showcase their work, attract investors and developers, and educate new audiences about the ecosystem’s depth and innovation. Importantly, the approach includes education and follow-up support to maximize each project's event return, and employs a milestone model to ensure accountability and efficiency with treasury funds.\r\n\r\nVendor experience, transparent milestone-based process, and scaled-back budget further enhance cost-effectiveness and trust. This is a practical, high-ROI initiative that strengthens Cardano's global presence and supports sustainable ecosystem growth.\r\n\r\nFor these reasons, I support this funding request.",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "AdaLovelace777",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AdaLovelace777/HelpingThoseWhoHelpUS/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context%20(32).jsonld -->\r\n# AdaLovelace777\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygehgu65kchqm929zp69xhl06hqkpcjv0rzy44sx40qhufqgh3xv2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis funding helps Cardano projects gain global exposure at exhibitions, provides structured support to maximize ROI, and increases ecosystem visibility beyond just Cardano events.  Supplyoneers FZ-LLC has 15 years of exhibition experience and a track record of helping projects gain visibility. Let’s do it!",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
