    {
      "voter": "ADAR_Chris",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qma15GnrtULU5zdeWJAUFccnE2Sp3Y9sViWRdiFZMcyp9d -->\r\n# ADAR_Chris\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y26nj0u86z00s2c6yteecduedrzxxrxrn39th5mau0h0r5gszp025`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI think @Invalid_eutxo will make excellent use of the funding to improve Cardano's brand.",
