    {
      "voter": "Dan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmcxPtZLxSDydh87D2apkJoZEJuMafUcgdPPZ64mhjQncg -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting Abstain. I am choosing to abstain rather than vote no, as while I see value in increasing Cardano’s global visibility and supporting exhibition booths that attract builders, broad participation offers uncertain long-term impact. Targeted event funding (potentially via Catalyst) would be a more strategic use of funds.",
