    {
      "voter": "Florian Volery",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmaS35uKUkCv7mcsRDErb4qTt1v8mtKMT5KiYYH4UsRwEd -->\r\n# Florian Volery\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yguh6dsgx0g58v8pqmxgfrkq0x8vfv6tcp92uzzjrykwy8cjmelsy`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOnboarding traditional finance requires a focused effort on education and building strong relationships with key stakeholders in that sector. This proposal does not clearly address or prioritize that target audience.\r\nFor this reason, I am voting NO.",
      "vote": "NO"
