      "voter": "HOSKY",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmXmUzSUBND17wJogwsfWUZ8W4cLXNsomwFbZH2SuQqvwL -->\r\n# HOSKY\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf2jzhuc4f7eu2yay9d9ta3dykxxcwn34wz8kak7nhd7vcgrxn7ns`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nDiscover Crypto is NOT Cardano Foundation, thus I am voting YES!",
