      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmVpnrqsKvMwCsZUs221KJJGY7DfSKJy9YuUUDU4rzpiMv -->\r\n# KryptoLabs\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfeqm8wfd2h9pf2c9y934qskuw3z04selrpr7esf4gdsl2c5zvpgf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a Cardano DRep, I support voting YES on the Ecosystem Pavilions proposal. Initially, I was skeptical about its impact on the Cardano ecosystem. However, after engaging in X spaces and discussing with Dave, I am convinced it will enhance exposure at a reduced cost for projects. The partial subsidy and support for projects at exhibitions align with Cardano’s need to attract investors, developers, and users. This affordable entry point, coupled with education  justifies the ₳889,500 withdrawal, making it a strategic investment for Cardano’s growth.",
