      "content": "<!-- url: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/Qma62pgwa8Dfn4mkSZTVeytUWc66cDCNLqSAj2ecYWxprh -->\r\n# Medusa DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg5pzxhp0lu0m7757ww2hke8qhcuqgqt3c2ezphngwytz4gjr6yge`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI'm not sure, but isn’t that what the Cardano Foundation is supposed to be for?",
