    {
      "voter": "Peter Bui",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pbwebdev/drep/refs/heads/main/r/25/250812_ecopavil_2b5c10989138.jsonld -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis proposal is already approved in the 2025 budget process and aligns with the marketing and ecosystem growth goals in my voting approach. It provides partial subsidies for projects to participate in exhibitions, lowering entry costs while requiring clear ROI-focused engagement before, during, and after events. The vendor has relevant experience and will operate under a milestone-based contract with independent oversight. The reduced funding request further minimises overlap with other community-funded marketing efforts.",
