      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQwN1jhJkh7oViidSgJMeRDaBFoXeSkBT59fzqQTpvigD -->\r\n# punkr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfyl9j6amk940g76r7ujnn5gywnjenv3kmun3a5tr5a83psl4vv64`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIt partially drives growth and empowers projects but benefits are vague and significant financial risk. If more details emerge (e.g., event lists or ROI projections) it can be reconsidered.",
