    {
      "voter": "SudoScientist",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arpradio/drep/refs/heads/main/Ecosystem%20Budget/ecosystem_pavillion.jsonld -->\r\n# SudoScientist\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2wtls7xh3a8gyepk540dgtzjzalk086gp4www6y0k0xjmqyk6gma`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a music professional, it is clear that real world, in person events are among the strongest social interactions that can take place.  However, it is crucial that these events are organized as efficiently as possible to be sustainable.  \r\n\r\nOnboarding the next wave of Cardano users is, IMO, dependent upon new projects having a direct interface with their target audiences; my delegates, as well as myself, feel this is a good step in realizing such a bridge!",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
