      "voter": "wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmb3edHhuUWrCyffF8dzq4B93DJCy6pULTqdAyK6w6BuBs -->\r\n# wolf31o2 (Chris Gianelloni)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳889,500 for Cardano Ecosystem Pavilions at Exhibitions\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfa8r8r36x7x05htftce7qhafrn5nzzr6vazy95pzy6y5dqac0ss7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOutreach outside the ecosystem is important and DiscoverCardano puts in the work.",
