      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmVkma7G8HCpB8nHQ8kHJ2PdSGntqjE7k46jRuZP9sLiV5 -->\r\n# AKYO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Budget ₳5M Loan for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yts3qdjsqcnhld4r3uek2uu0n2tnh824tgnf75a83q3yhequuy54u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n本提案は、新しい資金提供モデルを試す意義があると考えます。一方で、その効果の広がりや資金配分の優先度には懸念が残ります。Cardanoの財務資金は、エコシステム全体に波及する取り組みに重点を置くべきだと思います。このため、今回は棄権とします。\\n\\nI believe this proposal has value in testing a new model of treasury funding. However, I still have concerns about its broader impact and the prioritization of resources. Cardano’s treasury funds should focus on initiatives that benefit the ecosystem as a whole. For these reasons, I choose to abstain.",
