    {
      "voter": "drep1ygwxycfhkjd8skrgjzns3dq2360xj80khyqwwyyzqf8a4mcqrz7jj",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreigtlehu57vonlfqnseyfenvkgn54kbmwibjxh3vjenp6jfaqrxsyu -->\r\n# drep1ygwxycfhkjd8skrgjzns3dq2360xj80khyqwwyyzqf8a4mcqrz7jj\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Budget ₳5M Loan for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygwxycfhkjd8skrgjzns3dq2360xj80khyqwwyyzqf8a4mcqrz7jj`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNo \"loan\" should be approved without a mechanism to force payback. Risk should be equal to the creditor & the debtor, with all DReps acting as underwriters. I do not approve this loan - or any other loan - without these provisions clearly articulated under contract to the treasury.",
