      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdjbgnCrzKqHSDgBTb49rSgz9nbMgv9VqHn7XwY34nqZg -->\r\n# Minh Le\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Budget ₳5M Loan for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg6lvx8hrsjgex7f2p5waz5hqmwxzn7u8xljsuastt7s3qckz3maz`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI like this proposal, so I'm voting yes.",
