    {
      "voter": "Patrick_Tobler",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmaj6mrax66YtMjqSVLPBsdYUPPxbUReQbe8TW86diovty -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Budget ₳5M Loan for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI believe overall this is a net positive for Cardano. The SNEK team has learned from past proposals and improved the proposal positively. The structure as a loan makes a lot of sense.\r\n\r\nI would like to see an exact amount of TX fees associated with SNEK transactions. All DEX transactions where SNEK is sold or bought added together basically.",
