      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmZhcE3nz75rt8WdC2PtSheLQ6P1pH16tvP96ceVv7a3wy -->\r\n# phillerino\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Budget ₳5M Loan for Cardano's Global Listing Expansion - Powered by Snek\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytu64qt7send5dw7wcd0z5geh4ka6qstgvtgval097hed7qqnqh2n`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSNEK’s success is a win for Cardano. Opposing their efforts on the other hand, stifles progress. Let's support the SNEK. Let's fund the SNEK 🐍",
