  "Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution": [
    {
      "voter": "$brock",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://brock.iagon.net/votes/gov_action133jnaewfsq8x6v08ndd87l2yqryp63r30t2dkceacxx5cply5n7sqzlcyqf.jsonld -->\r\n# $brock\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytjyvm958ywjkp57f8wm3havj72lc653tp7ajttxxt6ftgcmcmdk2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA technology-based constitution should not be left up to subjective interpretation of what is \"reasonable\". It should be black and white. These concerns were expressed several weeks ago, and there was lots of time to address them before submitting this proposal. I would like to see a clear constitution with no grey area to avoid future constitutional conflicts.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "₳ Bïrd Called Px",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmeY2S9EREMRhgBZMwCDftdCfejyvhhZ918VoMVeQZ6sWj -->\r\n# ₳ Bïrd Called Px\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytasx739a2q9hg22vk0rza6dwtzpry6cyp4kkxmmgqa929gmf3a8e`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAfter taking part in one of the Constitutional Workshops in Buenos Aires, joining debates, and observing the Constitutional Convention, I see the need to vote yes on implementing the proposed Cardano Constitution, as it’s the best synthesis of the journey so far. Perfection won’t come, so we must focus on refining it as we go. Wishing Cardano governance prosperity for the benefit of future generations and hoping the voices of those history has sidelined are truly heard.",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "AdaStat",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://adastat.net/_meta/drep/vote3.jsonld -->\r\n# AdaStat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfe9en4hsgc3r6nhtmwjeljh06hgnvt9yzzkwqcftvdj34cdxdg7u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nDespite the fact that this Cardano Constitution is still far from perfect, it is definitely sufficient to move forward. So, I have decided to vote Yes",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Addisetech",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/addisetech/drep/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# Addisetech\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfc4z43nmfdarjk0zyt9d95a4xhhrdxgjhhzdzqemxs8c7gmka698`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhy I voted No as an African!! See at cardano forum \r\n\r\nhttps://forum.cardano.org/t/why-i-vote-no-to-the-constitution-as-an-african/142789",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "AKYO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qme7uVtSk1LuztFKR5hyLxudJJ6SaREfrQeNb2EK2Ut24q -->\r\n# AKYO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yts3qdjsqcnhld4r3uek2uu0n2tnh824tgnf75a83q3yhequuy54u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n私はこのCardano憲法に賛成票を投じます。完璧とは言えませんが、暫定憲法に比べて曖昧な部分が削減され、以前より明確になったと感じます。特に賛成する理由として、基本原則が追加され、より分かりやすくなった点が挙げられます。また、暫定憲法では明記されていなかったADAの総供給量について、明確な規定が設けられた点も評価できます。最後に、新しいガバナンス時代において、DRepとして最初のガバナンスアクションの投票に参加できることを嬉しく思います。\\n\\n第一条第一項 基本原則 第十条\\n「金融の安定性は維持されなければならず、ADAの総供給量は450億（45,000,000,000,000,000 lovelace）を超えてはならない。」\\n\\n---\\n\\nI cast my vote in favor of this Cardano Constitution. While it may not be perfect, it is clearer than the provisional constitution, as much of the ambiguity has been removed. One of the main reasons for my support is the addition of fundamental principles, which make the document easier to understand. Additionally, I appreciate that the total supply of ADA is explicitly stated, something that was not clearly specified in the provisional constitution. Lastly, I am pleased to participate in the first governance action vote as a DRep in this new era of governance.\\n\\nArticle 1, Section 1, TENET 10\\n\\\"Financial stability shall be maintained and the total supply of ada shall not exceed 45,000,000,000 (45,000,000,000,000,000 lovelace).\\\"",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
