      "voter": "Oomfie",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Birdlord69/Cardano-Constitution-Vote/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context%20(1).jsonld -->\r\n# Oomfie\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yt7vr9r0ay4h7fagkgwkvwdll3etupc40vn5tmeqf46x0sq63mk3a`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhen I signed yes to the constitution, it was out of respect to the people at the constitution who worked tirelessly on it. \r\n\r\nWe were promised better inclusions for the global community at the convention. I was hopeful. Not anymore.\r\n\r\nI have seen no sign of it. \r\n\r\nIn-fact, I've only seen the opposite since I signed \"yes\". I have no power to change this course. It will pass regardless of how I vote.\r\n\r\nThis \"no\" vote is my last \"fuck you\" to the elites that will soon take power (irrelevant as it is).",
