      "voter": "Peter Bui",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pbwebdev/drep/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNow that we have moved into the era of on-chain governance and the Cardano blockchain is in the hands of the community, it's time to move forward with the constitution. I vote yes to removing the interim constitution and replacing it with the latest Cardano Constitution detailed in the Governance Action.\r\n\r\nSome are unhappy with how it works and its details, but there is room for improvements, amendments and growth for the ecosystem and ADA holders.\r\n\r\nLet's take the next step forward.\r\n\r\nRegards\r\nPB",
