      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RudianosDrep/RudianosDrep/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# Rudianos\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfv77z2fsz7nucy59lx2pkafamathf8q783lalkr3quju0gv93lq2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is a good and necessary first step to governance and provides what it sets out to provide; a foundational pillar for minimum viable governance. The journey to improve the governance will of course be an ongoing process but I am very much in favor of taking this step and thank all who collaborated to present this document to the community.",
