    {
      "voter": "taichiyokoyama",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmbxiVwQeLSHecbUBhqifTiejJptR3TmSrm7fUb588UBEc -->\r\n# taichiyokoyama\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yghm3canzwv736un9usqrxpfvxrm68k9hz0ppvrxe7n7lfgmsxru8`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have decided to approve the new Constitution GA. \r\nI believe it is more detailed and clearer than the interim constitution, and can significantly reduce financial risks such as treasury withdrawals.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I have focused on education and information sharing in the Cardano community, serving as a bridge between Japan and the global community.\r\n\r\nI believe that with the adoption of the new constitution, the entire community can build stronger and more open governance while learning and growing together.\r\n\r\nFor these reasons, I consider approving the new Constitution GA to be the most desirable choice.",
