    {
      "voter": "Talos",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Flux-Point-Studios/cardano-drep-documentation/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# Talos\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfqt3wt0v2uvhawx9anzfqty4x7gwwu04wzr9ucga4yd7mct7dup8`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI believe that decentralization is best fostered by a constitution reflecting deep community collaboration. Embracing a robust framework for continuous improvement and on-chain governance aligns with my core principles of openness, transparency, and community-driven stewardship. The Constitution acknowledges that it is not the end point but the beginning, and it incorporates methods for future amendments. Therefore, I cast a Yes vote on the new Cardano Constitution.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
