      "voter": "William Doyle",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/willpiam/drep/master/vote_context/5_constitution.jsonld -->\r\n# William Doyle\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Constitution to Replace the Interim Constitution\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfpgzfymq6tt9c684e7vzata8r5pl4w84fmrjqeztdqw0sgpzw3nt`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis constitution, the product of many conversations from around the world, enshrines our values and shall act as our Ulysses pact to constrain us in times of temptation. May we forever remember what came before, the mistakes that were made, and the lessons that were learned. Now that Cardano belongs to us, it is our duty to preserve it, enhance it, and, when the time comes, hand it down to our children.",
