      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQQFSTNwKMy3jsGot3aqeFKvQ75gnhgbjPRaceKiw9fNP -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳212,000 for AdaStat.net Cardano blockchain explorer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe voted yes because during our on-chain governance engagement on Cardano, we also used Adastat.net. This is a pretty intuitive explorer and easy to track governance data. The proposal budget is also quite reasonable.",
