      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmb8699PnPfBS65dJGkgzGtuowfR2uwaQ686UNUX8rQTrL -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳212,000 for AdaStat.net Cardano blockchain explorer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting Yes to fund AdaStat, a long-standing and widely used Cardano explorer. Continued funding helps ensure reliable data access and supports infrastructure decentralisation.",
