      "voter": "Kyle Solomon",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adosiawolf/drep-rationale/refs/heads/main/0020 -->\r\n# Kyle Solomon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳212,000 for AdaStat.net Cardano blockchain explorer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytzshxuma6cwrnlv2ucyclfqw3k4nu4nuudmh2z87j9hncsk9dhy4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have voted YES on the current proposal to fund AdaStat.net. AdaStat is badass, and I use it in both my day-to-day operational role as CEO of DripDropz and (for supplementing 100% of GovTool) my role as Cardano dRep. AdaStat is doing governance right",
