      "content": "<!-- url: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmatK9B7eCQQVeuK2xZ37ajofmh5BCyGJd6BbR8fVcFmLa -->\r\n# Medusa DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳212,000 for AdaStat.net Cardano blockchain explorer\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg5pzxhp0lu0m7757ww2hke8qhcuqgqt3c2ezphngwytz4gjr6yge`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAdastat is an excellent explorer, but since I personally know the developer, there’s a potential conflict of interest here. That’s why I’ll abstain.",
