      "voter": "Patrick_Tobler",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmZTTZQCxWZtnD48eM23XbS7yQTr336AptQWxt8HCJ2uf8 -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳212,000 for AdaStat.net Cardano blockchain explorer\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis should be a Catalyst Proposal instead or at least be grouped under another proposal such as e.g. the Builders DAO.",
