    {
      "voter": "Terminada",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminadaDrep/vote-contexts/refs/heads/main/20250726/003.jsonld -->\r\n# Terminada\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳212,000 for AdaStat.net Cardano blockchain explorer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytf9f78k7rkwk4cu6l2nvna22keu9yus4kqzc0hqspd36uszu0xc2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nUntil now AdaStat have been supported via staking rewards, helped by delegation from Cardano Foundation.  The community should fund the work to develop and maintain this blockchain explorer directly.  Importantly, AdaStat have publicly committed to open source all back end and front end code, \"so everyone can run their own copy of the AdaStat Cardano explorer\".",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
