      "voter": "Varavas",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmTtFeviDE9JVhX8zhRUYk2sBvjnHzuLekFGUJpE8RMW8r -->\r\n# Varavas\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳212,000 for AdaStat.net Cardano blockchain explorer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yte3chru8m7d3gzgpwvmgan0gjfxru9r9cyvrkkcerc0wcg6qfvtc`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support Ada Stat, a valuable tool with an excellent interface. The proposed budget is reasonable, especially considering it covers a two-year period.",
