      "voter": "Yoroi W₳llet",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUTcKbg29y2qXLU63nG7UGzU8YuBBKh2xddAkAkqzA1XL -->\r\n# Yoroi W₳llet\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳212,000 for AdaStat.net Cardano blockchain explorer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygr9tuapcanc3kpeyy4dc3vmrz9cfe5q7v9wj3x9j0ap3tswtre9j`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\nYoroi votes Yes for AdaStat.net Cardano blockchain explorer with supporting rationale below.\r\n\r\nRationale\r\n\r\n- Reliable infrastructure. AdaStat is a long-running and trusted tool in the Cardano space, used regularly by SPOs, DReps, and community members.\r\n\r\n- Governance visibility. The explorer offers practical tools that support Cardano’s evolving governance process.\r\n\r\n- Privacy-first design. No ads, tracking, or monetization—aligning well with Yoroi’s commitment to user security and autonomy.\r\n\r\nYoroi supports this proposal to maintain ecosystem resilience, improve governance transparency, and empower users through better access to data.",
