    {
      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmSj8xNfhpGjn6oCGW69fzDHX5DpLyDYRNiAgUzmJUXqbT -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,161,000 for zkFold ZK Rollup administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmZVWrhrXVjVbKmocY7aLjrLb6CH4c1TbvhNu4ybKJoouk\r\n\r\nI am voting a strong **YES**. Addressing **scalability** is a top priority, and this proposal tackles it with powerful, proven technology.\r\n\r\nA general-purpose ZK rollup will dramatically increase throughput and lower fees, directly fueling ecosystem **growth** and **sustainability**. For the sake of **decentralization**, our future cannot hinge on a single scaling solution. Supporting this initiative ensures a diverse and resilient roadmap for Cardano, making this a vital investment in our core infrastructure.",
