    {
      "voter": "DeepStatecraft",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qma1DtJvc3rmq77z7R576ibdsmWxFPKQmnX4y4KjVZoNP8 -->\r\n# DeepStatecraft\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,161,000 for zkFold ZK Rollup administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfr0cur4guksjd6whxe5mltcaksqqhzd85dnq6lfk8ex7qs5mlcye`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n✅ zkFold ZK Rollup – ₳1,161,000\r\n\r\nWhy I voted YES:\r\nzkFold is building a general-purpose ZK rollup solution to scale Cardano without compromising decentralization or security. Their prototype already proves it fits within on-chain execution limits. This tech compresses hundreds of smart contract transactions into a single L1 transaction, paving the way for massive dApp scalability.\r\n\r\nKey benefits:\r\n\t•\t⚡️ Higher throughput\r\n\t•\t💸 Lower fees for users and dApps\r\n\t•\t🔐 Preserves L1 security guarantees\r\n\t•\t📈 Enables micro-payments and broader adoption\r\n\t•\t🔧 Built by expert Rust, Haskell, and ZK cryptography engineers\r\n\r\nWith L2 scaling being mission-critical, this proposal supports a key infrastructure pillar for Cardano’s future.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
