      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adosiawolf/drep-rationale/refs/heads/main/0014 -->\r\n# Kyle Solomon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,161,000 for zkFold ZK Rollup administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytzshxuma6cwrnlv2ucyclfqw3k4nu4nuudmh2z87j9hncsk9dhy4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have voted YES on the current proposal to fund zkFold ZK rollup technology. Enabling native ZK rollup support enhances Cardano L1 capabilities while further preparing the ecosystem for potential adoption on multiple fronts",
