      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdVFfVYyGDsFyS5CtEJnizBe7p8DcfujtNDSafaqjDXse -->\r\n# Nasia\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,161,000 for zkFold ZK Rollup administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfn4n94zl2ahpcn3yu6q7v0vla7nw7qj4x23nzc5qvsudygcrn3zn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nZero-knowledge tech is vital for future private transactions and scalable L2s.\r\nPlease ensure clear audit timeline, developer SDK deliverables, and public testnet targets are published during Q1 disbursements.",
