    {
      "voter": "Victor.Villagomez",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmXZkBAL43uM2htS3A9XzUwQjyJUkBhaf7v58wmfSKbXZF -->\r\n# Victor.Villagomez\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,161,000 for zkFold ZK Rollup administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2utmer3m25qvcfrmglld88yueq9se3d8hqjnj20wk4q0cgz92za6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nzkFold ZK Rollup, while very promising, should demonstrate mainnet readiness or secure smaller funding (e.g., via Catalyst) before requesting significant treasury funds. I encourage refining the proposal with a detailed budget and clearer milestones to address its prematurity.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
