    {
      "voter": "Yoroi W₳llet",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmZYxbp4hEswpxTuyHb7DnwQ6LPge3z8U6TpgiYfxNsbfZ -->\r\n# Yoroi W₳llet\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,161,000 for zkFold ZK Rollup administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygr9tuapcanc3kpeyy4dc3vmrz9cfe5q7v9wj3x9j0ap3tswtre9j`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\nYoroi DRep supports the governance action to fund zkFold ZK Rollup based on the rationale below\r\n\r\nRationale\r\n\r\nStrategic infrastructure: zkFold would complement Hydra and Mithril to form a more complete L2 stack, boosting scalability and competitiveness.\r\n\r\nHigh-potential technology: ZK rollups are among the most promising Layer 2 technologies in the blockchain space, offering scalability without compromising decentralization.\r\n\r\nBuilder commitment: The team is already self-funding and developing a testnet, showing strong initiative and delivery potential.",
