    {
      "voter": "ADAR_Chris",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmdo572wUGti4SCxpBZrNeeB24euLBdkdsJCLYwJBEhBZS -->\r\n# ADAR_Chris\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Blockchain Ecosystem Budget Amaru Node Development 2025\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y26nj0u86z00s2c6yteecduedrzxxrxrn39th5mau0h0r5gszp025`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n1. Diversity in node implementation is good in terms of resilience and adoption\r\n2. Excellent team that can deliver\r\n3. Cost effective / good ROI",
