    {
      "voter": "LloydDuhon",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmcEfuZcpVK1MjEEHypLNZApektYfHLDTbK3ZsVYy3DuiK -->\r\n# LloydDuhon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Blockchain Ecosystem Budget Amaru Node Development 2025\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfvw769lf7g5p4hx0cl2f8jxdcufdcqqj36u0n9escjcwdswcj4h6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI believe that Amaru is making some good moves toward client diversity. These steps are good and we should fund them.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
