      "voter": "Michael Jones",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreieiyef6mqtdq5oowsiakvhhokrjrfh6gudwgju5dn4yz35jbb7tk4 -->\r\n# Michael Jones\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Constitutional Committee Compensation Epochs 581-653\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y29z3c5cf4wmqqgwku7lwv4985xw0g9rt0g4vcys5c67f5sn4tcm0`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA consensus vote for me. Perhaps we are not ready for paid Constitutional Committee.",
