    {
      "voter": "punkr",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreif4g6tu2ypdeqo2bd3nlmorr5fmbchv23nf36twxc22l4cn7xv25u -->\r\n# punkr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Constitutional Committee Compensation Epochs 581-653\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfyl9j6amk940g76r7ujnn5gywnjenv3kmun3a5tr5a83psl4vv64`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote yes because paying the Constitutional Committee fairly from the treasury keeps governance running smoothly and open to everyone, and the setup with checks and refunds makes it safe and transparent. Without it, key members might quit, hurting Cardano's decision-making process.",
