    {
      "voter": "RABIT",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPfhUdYxLXSDEkfwfu7f9YCeM36rau2G9NCcSQ4P9VTYX -->\r\n# RABIT\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Constitutional Committee Compensation Epochs 581-653\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytcypl8fyuvm2epkjz2m4wzf24y26vj998wj4cvu7nnpgygh2sltr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n'nuff said:\r\n\r\nhttps://x.com/rabbitholepools/status/1980860255153033299",
