      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Kronoshus/KevinMohr/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context_Tempovote.jsonld -->\r\n# Kevin G Mohr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Tempo for Cardono Governance - Maintenance & Development Budget for 2025\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytwn2u7qpy4ur7k3xqd7eehft3g2yjpxf46rugwzmndkyesd0m5nt`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have personally met with members of tempo.vote and I have full confidence in their ability to create a second voting platform (alternate to gov.tools) that will provide redundancy in our government. This redundancy will strengthen our ecosystem by providing alternate options for voting and therefore layers of security. Security steming from not relying on one single point of possible failure.",
