      "voter": "Porto Cripto DRep 🇧🇷 🇵🇹 (Atico & Bosco, from Cardanistas",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/portocripto/drep-entry/refs/heads/main/votes/GA021-info-ncl-rationale.jsonld -->\r\n# Porto Cripto DRep 🇧🇷 🇵🇹 (Atico & Bosco, from Cardanistas Stake Pool - CARDs)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Tempo for Cardono Governance - Maintenance & Development Budget for 2025\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ywuk39acvmkzda9e8kfmy7fwf946jd5uaa4l696atlas66s68f0fl`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n[Portuguese]\r\nOptamos por votar \"Sim\" nesta ação de governança (gov_action1f9da8n2yaf4updxzmwc7fnw8ug2gwnpvqays5n3yw6nz0mu3z2qqq6ggge9), pois a plataforma Tempo.vote desempenha um papel relevante de fornecer uma ferramenta alternativa de governança, com funcionalidades únicas e diferenciais, contribuindo para o amadurecimento da participação da comunidade, e na proposta conseguiram expressar como o financiamento será utilizado. Financiar este tipo de iniciativa de construtores Cardano merece todo apoio e estímulo.\r\n[English]\r\nWe chose to vote \"Yes\" on this governance action (gov_action1f9da8n2yaf4updxzmwc7fnw8ug2gwnpvqays5n3yw6nz0mu3z2qqq6ggge9), because the Tempo.vote platform plays an important role in providing an alternative governance tool, with unique and distinctive features, contributing to the maturation of community participation, and in the proposal they were able to clearly express how the funding will be used. Funding this type of initiative from Cardano builders deserves full support and encouragement.",
