      "voter": "punkr",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cpunkr/drep/refs/heads/main/250720_Tempo.jsonld -->\r\n# punkr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Tempo for Cardono Governance - Maintenance & Development Budget for 2025\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfyl9j6amk940g76r7ujnn5gywnjenv3kmun3a5tr5a83psl4vv64`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI changed my vote from no to yes. While voting on other proposals using the Cardano GovTool, I encountered issues with that tool, but I was able to vote successfully using Tempo, making it critical to keep Tempo updated to ensure seamless voting.",
