      "voter": "Daehan_kor",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://Qmdi55x5pYseKuS8sFtVD9YnYCiRhLoGV1vEb3sRk5i86q -->\r\n# Daehan_kor\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳99,600 for BloxBean Java Tools Maintenance and Enhancement\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y28uwdrz2acyp4jka5fqp2fa3hp0klpme8wug3f5p2y45zsc0e8qw`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nJava dev tool compatible with Cardano mini protocol is valuable for strengthening and diversifying the whole Cardano ecosystem.",
