    {
      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://Qmf5DCPZe1AMDQAwTCF6XLE7S96t6TCSKg3nS5pFsPktiZ -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳99,600 for BloxBean Java Tools Maintenance and Enhancement\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmWKeawyNEX4kta4uA5UyThbwLQgaxnCSQPFRgMW6TXB6E\r\n\r\nI vote **Yes** for this proposal. The requested **₳99,600** for BloxBean's Java tools is a fair amount for what is truly **essential developer tooling** for the Cardano ecosystem. Their team's consistent maintenance and frequent releases demonstrate a high level of **reliability** and commitment. This direct support for foundational development tools is crucial for fostering Cardano's continued **growth**, ensuring its long-term **sustainability**, and strengthening **decentralization** by empowering a wide array of builders.",
