      "voter": "DeepStatecraft",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmTDkCC8rP4TAun7Mk8uNyGXxcVwNNPE4N4UNdLsVHNzaj -->\r\n# DeepStatecraft\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳99,600 for BloxBean Java Tools Maintenance and Enhancement\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfr0cur4guksjd6whxe5mltcaksqqhzd85dnq6lfk8ex7qs5mlcye`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n✅ BloxBean Java Tools Maintenance & Enhancement (₳99.6K)\r\n\t•\tSupports CCL, Yaci, Yaci Store, and DevKit — foundational Java tools for interacting with Cardano.\r\n\t•\tAdds a full-time developer to maintain compatibility with network upgrades, fix bugs, and deliver new features.\r\n\t•\tEnhances developer documentation, tooling, and community support, making Cardano more accessible to JVM developers.\r\n\t•\tMaintains a robust Java stack as open-source infrastructure, accelerating ecosystem growth beyond Plutus/Haskell.\r\n\r\n🧩 My take: BloxBean plays a vital role in broadening Cardano’s developer reach. Their tools are mature, battle-tested, and needed. YES to sustained support.",
