      "voter": "Medusa DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmNqVJ4dYKmcSXcH928RZ4n7UeVXuvyvEMTRopSfj9p5yA -->\r\n# Medusa DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳99,600 for BloxBean Java Tools Maintenance and Enhancement\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg5pzxhp0lu0m7757ww2hke8qhcuqgqt3c2ezphngwytz4gjr6yge`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI believe that supporting such tools benefits the ecosystem by expanding the potential reach of developers and integration opportunities. Moreover, the requested budget appears very reasonable given the stated commitments and motivations.",
