      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tulibra1510/hanhdongquantri1ikigai/refs/heads/main/GA1ikigai.jsonld -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardanoの生きがい - Ikigai -\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe fully agree with this governance action even though it does not require any changes. We have followed Cardano's journey since its early days. Charles Hoskinson, Input Output, Cardano Foundation and Emurgo have made many positive contributions to the Cardano ecosystem. It is only right to express our deep gratitude and appreciation to them.",
