      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tastenkunst/eternl-drep/refs/heads/main/gov_action_00002_vote_context.jsonld -->\r\n# Eternl DRep Committee\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardanoの生きがい - Ikigai -\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y29h2q6cst2pvkl2sqqvf5ljcy36uv7pmy482xnczddzgqshus24w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe also believe that the road behind us was worth the walk, and the Eternl team looks forward to what’s to come. Thanks to all involved so far, and let’s build Cardano’s future together.",
