    {
      "voter": "hix_coffeepool",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://coffeepool.jp/voting/rationale_ikigai.jsonld -->\r\n# hix_coffeepool\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardanoの生きがい - Ikigai -\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygnh2uf4wkc8ldgfxwz7rzuga3m8jtqew9xh5g3n587mg6g3ge0sj`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAlthough this governance action does not intend to change/add anything, all stakeholders should be treated equally under the constitution. Therefore, it is unacceptable to include statements that glorify specific stakeholders. Also, additions to the Info section should be kept to a minimum. Otherwise, this could lead to an overwhelming number of info GAs being submitted, potentially hindering governance processes.",
