    {
      "voter": "InputEndorsers",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/InputEndorsers/DRep-InputEndorsers/main/Vote_Context_2.jsonld -->\r\n# InputEndorsers\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardanoの生きがい - Ikigai -\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2hlgh9600zjlt39dh54z7z8d65kahneck8yhh7ugmzc9as0xrzqd`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe proposal is a respectful and well-meaning message that contributes to creating a positive atmosphere to the wider debate on governance and to governance itself. Cardano started almost a decade ago, it has a long history and this governance action serves to acknowledge it. I vote YES.",
      "vote": "YES"
