    {
      "voter": "intertreeJK",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmeSVyLy23VN4HT8kcSY33rNW9kBYUgEreZ2CTazjigLve -->\r\n# intertreeJK\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardanoの生きがい - Ikigai -\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfkg5ryqwaleunwqg0dtcj8g8yw8sgd9kskg2zlzdr8355gpghcvv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nUnder the definition of 'Ikigai', as put forward by Héctor Garcia, co-author of the book 'Ikigai: The Japanese Secret to a Long and Happy Life', it is stated that having an Ikigai is made of having a combination of:\r\n\r\n1. What you are good at\r\n2. What you love\r\n3. What the world needs\r\n&\r\n4. What you can be paid for\r\n\r\nAs I am currently not completely sure that the Role of DRep should be a paid position in the future, I am choosing to Vote Abstain on this Proposal to reflect that unsureness.",
