      "voter": "KryptoLabs",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kenerik/KryptoLabs/refs/heads/main/ikigai.jsonld -->\r\n# KryptoLabs\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardanoの生きがい - Ikigai -\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfeqm8wfd2h9pf2c9y934qskuw3z04selrpr7esf4gdsl2c5zvpgf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe informed the viewers of Kryptolabs on YouTube about the government's information action and decided to abstain. This is because the information simply expresses their appreciation for Cardano as a blockchain.",
