      "voter": "Viet_Cardano_Community",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IlumNguyen/VCC/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# Viet_Cardano_Community\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardanoの生きがい - Ikigai -\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygpzpm4q38rfueu2use5te4ylykn4smvs7cxj2ggvktcjkqpxhvf4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe support this proposal because it has been reviewed by the community, and the majority agree with the proposed Net Change Limit. Establishing this limit ensures transparency, accountability, and the sustainability of Cardano’s treasury.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, this proposal aligns with Article IV of the Cardano Constitution and the Treasury Withdrawal Guardrails, ensuring responsible spending while facilitating the strategic growth of the ecosystem.",
