      "content": "<!-- url: https://brock.iagon.net/votes/gov_action15ce4qnwug759939wqv782pvh6qg68khspg8kh02gmex99mcsytwqqqr7jkr.jsonld -->\r\n# $brock\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** DeltaDeFi Hydra Trading Infrastructure Budget (₳1,500,000)\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytjyvm958ywjkp57f8wm3havj72lc653tp7ajttxxt6ftgcmcmdk2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIt is not the treasury's responsibility to fund yet another DEX. Cardano DEXs are profitable enough products, so if the technology advancement of this DEX is sufficient enough to capture DeFi market share within the ecosystem, it will be profitable enough to pay for its own development.",
