    {
      "voter": "Big Lazy Cat",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreifk6iafsqpnouqbvdxybtgljfct3nz37baoh3wudjhwi562kluyya -->\r\n# Big Lazy Cat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** DeltaDeFi Hydra Trading Infrastructure Budget (₳1,500,000)\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yffcjs0njfea09xhs6up429rhya5pxd7qz7hvmwq6vqy2nczwpj3g`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe project direction has merit, and the DeltaDeFi team has demonstrated strong execution through long-standing contributions to developer tooling and infrastructure in the Cardano ecosystem. This deserves recognition.\r\nHowever, at this stage, order-book trading is not among Cardano’s most urgent priorities, and Hydra has yet to show broad, mature application-level adoption. Advancing complex Hydra-based applications too early risks limited liquidity and usage.\r\nI would prefer to reconsider such initiatives once Hydra itself is more mature and supports a wider range of real-world applications. For this reason, I abstain on this Info Action.",
