    {
      "voter": "MREDGARCROSS",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreifoqo66gndjf4qjbt7gz46y5nrqbup32r3iplqj4hvbx72roae24y -->\r\n# MREDGARCROSS\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** DeltaDeFi Hydra Trading Infrastructure Budget (₳1,500,000)\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y269ehxj30k4vfzfc2z84v0xykd3amuy2xn0kv9zf8rhcec2fg2jr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n📛 **OFFICIAL DRep POSITION: I VOTE NO**\r\n\r\n🧱 As a DRep on Cardano, I vote **AGAINST** the DeltaDeFi Info Action requesting ₳1,500,000.\r\n\r\n❌ **Why:**\r\n— We already have enough DEX platforms.\r\n— There is **no urgent trading infrastructure problem**.\r\n— This is not a breakthrough — just another order-book with fancy KPIs.\r\n— Now is **not the time** to spend Treasury funds on this.\r\n\r\n📉 Liquidity doesn’t come from more exchanges.\r\n🔍 Cardano needs real user demand — not another frontend.\r\n\r\n🛑 I vote NO. I do **not support** spending Treasury funds on duplicate infrastructure.\r\n\r\n🖤 My DRep ID: ➡️ **drep1y269ehxj30k4vfzfc2z84v0xykd3amuy2xn0kv9zf8rhcec2fg2jr**\r\n🔗 Details: [https://t.me/PROCENT666/338](https://t.me/PROCENT666/338)\r\n\r\n#Cardano #Governance #DRep #Treasury #DeltaDeFi #мысляотэдгара",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Musa Ridwan Itopa",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdSdK5789GNQjUCULhe9NZrGg9ZMZKYvmQVN7wDYP7u3f -->\r\n# Musa Ridwan Itopa\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** DeltaDeFi Hydra Trading Infrastructure Budget (₳1,500,000)\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yggumgdxdpa2dgr85etak35s4v00k07vdhvn5y3xxw33yac77c9hp`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting NO on DeltaDeFi: Hydra Trading Infrastructure Budget (₳1,500,000) Info Action. AsUnified Cardano Student Club President in Nigeria, and advocate for Africa/student inclusion + transparent treasury use, I appreciate the vision for a fast Hydra-based order-book DEX to boost liquidity and pro trading. But 1.5M ADA feels premature when core entities (Intersect, IOG, EMURGO, Cardano Foundation, Midnight) are already coordinating major DeFi integrations (stablecoins, bridges, oracles) for ecosystem-wide impact. DeltaDeFi is live in beta with prior Catalyst support let's watch real adoption/volume first before committing more treasury funds. Prioritize coordinated, sustainable growth that empowers emerging markets without overlap.",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
    {
      "voter": "MyCNFT DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreifcpetigr5jdbia4jvli6dp4wv3iqscuoik5nqafwoxf6wcorrtpi -->\r\n# MyCNFT DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** DeltaDeFi Hydra Trading Infrastructure Budget (₳1,500,000)\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2wwa9cqns95zzztmz9vw3jm7n8lpd3x8wfvg6wnvvt29ngdm0mlh`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhile the proposal is strategically aligned with Vision 2030 and addresses a real infrastructure gap, there remain material execution risks around liquidity attraction, Hydra production readiness, and the sustainability of measured KPIs. I therefore abstain at this stage, with conditional support for a future proposal that demonstrates proven market demand, external validation of metrics, and reduced delivery risk.",
