    {
      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmaZrKkoFRscdA88zjt2TUxM819N9pCcJvHDksgmWE334R -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe vote yes. The hardware updates this proposal brings are necessary. The development team has extensive experience integrating Cardano HW wallets.",
      "vote": "YES"
