      "voter": "Kyle Solomon",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adosiawolf/drep-rationale/refs/heads/main/0035 -->\r\n# Kyle Solomon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytzshxuma6cwrnlv2ucyclfqw3k4nu4nuudmh2z87j9hncsk9dhy4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have voted Yes on the current proposal to fund Vacuum to maintain hardware wallet compatibilities. This is critical to sustaining favorable UX of self-custody applications and overall confidence in self-custody itself.",
