      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmNR9GF6EL6KpCFjHPSdijrKGFXYv4eiYRR2L8mGyU3Vzb -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nImportant tooling for hardware wallets.",
