    {
      "voter": "STORM Partners",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmf1W6yoxzB26Z5sZAT3CVp1naywjewxnShBYZXkJMNd9s -->\r\n# STORM Partners\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf0s5guxklwlqn7ttdpfwmmkaucwaqkkm6hzncy8nful5fgemurcj`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis proposal directly aligns with STORM Partners’ objective of retaining and securing Cardano users by ensuring uninterrupted access to the network through HW. Cold wallets are foundational for institutional and retail confidence, and Vacuumlabs has consistently delivered secure integrations for years. While we would prefer a more detailed funding breakdown, the strategic value of this proposal justifies the maintenance allocation.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SudoScientist",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arpradio/drep/refs/heads/main/Ecosystem%20Budget/hw_maintenance.jsonld -->\r\n# SudoScientist\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2wtls7xh3a8gyepk540dgtzjzalk086gp4www6y0k0xjmqyk6gma`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThank you Vacuumlabs for all the work into Hardware Wallets!  The budget may seem steep, but Vacuumlabs has a proven track record of providing such a vital aspect to a secure user experience.  It would be difficult to match the quality of output from any other known entity in the space! \r\n\r\nLedger already has strict requirements to accept code to which VL has already delivered.  An emerging blockchain with room to grow will certainly warrant future updates!",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SureWealthNG",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Henro1975/SureWealthNG/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context%20(8).jsonld -->\r\n# SureWealthNG\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2t8w2rtcyfh3f863gqcwmru7lafuszmvy0xhg7xjwdpwgcf2kz87`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI voted YES to fund ₳424,800 for Cardano hardware wallet maintenance because secure, updated access through Ledger, Trezor, and Keystone is foundational for user trust and participation. This proposal ensures compatibility with Cardano upgrades, prevents wallet obsolescence, and follows a transparent delivery process with legal contracts, milestone oversight, and independent auditing.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "The Dutch Drep",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmaWqaqTDFEhVJSjndm7ADtVKcBHy2wsAwvbgfW8X6aUcX -->\r\n# The Dutch Drep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yvve4554njxyun2s5p9q70v88d5jl7r0h34pjhw5f5tmw3sjtrutp`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe, The Dutch Drep, vote Yes on this withdrawal governance action for Beyond Minimum Viable Governance: Iteratively Improving on Cardano Voltaire, administered by Intersect. DISCLAIMER: Dutch DRep members may be contracted to perform work for this proposal and as such benefit from its passing. Our affirmative vote is based on the current state of governance requiring ongoing improvement, with a focus on increasing decentralization, further streamlining processes and constitutional definitions.",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Tobias Ilskov",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmT8bE2pvK6Tp1jZNksKMjWQvnbco5Nv5MV9MATs9y93M5 -->\r\n# Tobias Ilskov\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yt9xg7l0dlgxj3lyewmndzrq5wzj3f4nusdkpfa9n7zf4ssayqnk0`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmNzgHmvhztJSVhrd8sLffYJjaxzL6XYThJ3kV6FozYsD5\r\n\r\nA couple of months ago, I supported the resolution to bundle all of the Intersect Budget Proposals into 1 or 2 formal on-chain governance votes.\r\n\r\nEach of these proposals has already undergone extensive scrutiny and received 50% or greater support from the active DReps in the ecosystem, and I will honor that prior decision and the work these prospective developers have put in by voting yes on all the proposals from the Intersect Budget team.",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Tony Boersma",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmeLTfW7dSBefnE2BJr1ZjdyNAAYBZ48kYMm1tDPnd3Xs7 -->\r\n# Tony Boersma\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf7rhr6k8gfecdn8z5r38uqyaafcfr785lsgzsvc7ye3m9g3z20kj`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting Yes on the proposal to withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance, administered by Intersect. Hardware wallets are a critical component of Cardano’s security and user sovereignty, providing a safe and trusted way to interact with the blockchain. This proposal ensures the continued maintenance, compatibility, and improvement of hardware wallet support across key platforms.",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "TriangleForces",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmeJBcjXryrUYDwS1mHpgMDhTitL2Phpvh6tBgBXoBRjq3 -->\r\n# TriangleForces\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2y3euudfnw48xeulsfupsttlx8c4xphhaw90d66dvcrazgjdm5uc`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe continuous maintenance and timely updates for Ledger, Trezor, and Keystone wallets are indispensable for safeguarding user access and integrating new Cardano features as the protocol evolves. Vacuumlabs’ long-standing involvement since 2018 and proven expertise provide confidence in their capacity to deliver.\r\n\r\nWhile I maintain a call for improved transparency and milestone clarity going forward, the proposal’s alignment with the approved Intersect budget framework and robust governance oversight mechanisms mitigate some risks. Supporting this initiative ensures that Cardano’s hardware wallet ecosystem remains secure, functional, and future-proof—an essential pillar for network decentralization and user trust.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
