      "voter": "Victor.Villagomez",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmZ6HcethWu3ESewEb43LgE55Td4C6BYp8SjpfWUqLdUYN -->\r\n# Victor.Villagomez\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2utmer3m25qvcfrmglld88yueq9se3d8hqjnj20wk4q0cgz92za6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis maintenance work is justifiable and the amount seems reasonable for the scope of the work. Looking forward to seeing quality work come out of this workstream.",
