    {
      "voter": "Voice of the People",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DRepVoiceOfThePeople/VOP_Repo/refs/heads/main/VC20250718HardwarewalletsMaint.jsonld -->\r\n# Voice of the People\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳424,800 for Hardware Wallets Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2ecrj7jd9alaxumvm49hgng9rp239nda5ucegd05ndvxfqftwr9f`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nHW maintenance ensures user security. I there is no compatibility with them community would have a huge problem.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
