    {
      "voter": "AdaStat",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://adastat.net/_meta/drep/vote91.jsonld -->\r\n# AdaStat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Approve Cardano Foundation as New Managing Entity of Project Catalyst\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfe9en4hsgc3r6nhtmwjeljh06hgnvt9yzzkwqcftvdj34cdxdg7u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting YES.\r\n\r\nPreviously, Project Catalyst was managed by IOG, a development-focused organization. While it has handled this responsibility well over time, I believe that transitioning management to the Cardano Foundation is a natural next step in Catalyst's evolution.",
      "vote": "YES"
