    {
      "voter": "EMURGO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EMGDRep/rationale/refs/heads/main/Vote_Catalyst.jsonld -->\r\n# EMURGO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Approve Cardano Foundation as New Managing Entity of Project Catalyst\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytvlwvyjmzfyn56n0zz4f6lj94wxhmsl5zky6knnzrf4jygpyahug`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n\r\nEMURGO, as a DRep, votes YES on the Info Action to approve the transition of Project Catalyst’s managing entity from IOG to the Cardano Foundation, based on rationale outlined below.\r\n\r\nRationale\r\n\r\nThis proposal enables a required administrative transition to ensure Catalyst continues operating without interruption. It does not introduce new funding or strategic changes, but focuses on maintaining continuity for Funds 10–14.\r\n\r\nEMURGO acknowledges IOG’s role in establishing and operating Project Catalyst to date, including its contribution in supporting ecosystem experimentation and funding early-stage innovation.\r\nWithout timely approval, Catalyst operations could face delays, particularly impacting milestone reviews and payments to ongoing projects. EMURGO considers this an avoidable operational risk.\r\n\r\nThe Cardano Foundation represents a credible and immediate successor capable of assuming this role within the required timeframe. While broader discussions on Catalyst’s future structure remain important, they are separate from this decision. EMURGO therefore supports this transition as a practical step to ensure continuity and stability.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Eternl DRep Committee",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tastenkunst/eternl-drep/refs/heads/main/gov_action_00076_vote_context.jsonld -->\r\n# Eternl DRep Committee\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Approve Cardano Foundation as New Managing Entity of Project Catalyst\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y29h2q6cst2pvkl2sqqvf5ljcy36uv7pmy482xnczddzgqshus24w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nTL;DR: EDC votes YES on gov_action1k5vwlfrxtyusd2ec37tckd54gjvqn2kd72xj4t6wkkapdv7zfg0qq468n2r;\r\n\r\nNot much to approve here. If the two parties involved agreed on this we don't see the point in spending time and ADA on voting on this action.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Florian Volery",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmTHkXN8sCTPG97RaHtew2WKrq1TjKS96VSjc4gJvpobei -->\r\n# Florian Volery\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Approve Cardano Foundation as New Managing Entity of Project Catalyst\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yguh6dsgx0g58v8pqmxgfrkq0x8vfv6tcp92uzzjrykwy8cjmelsy`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nHousing Catalyst under the Cardano Foundation enables the program to utilize existing operational frameworks and resources.\r\n\r\nThis is the most cost-efficient and pragmatic solution.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "GAIA",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmNtFMmTwGNAtU1DuZtrkJAUAHfTZRiowQGa39MWVjHEtd -->\r\n# GAIA\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Approve Cardano Foundation as New Managing Entity of Project Catalyst\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytxr0lhg5j72wysva9ac2gsn4lck4gyen8ywxkqfchsqg3qs8uy44`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs per my previous voting rationale, I view the Cardano Foundation as a bad actor in the Cardano Ecosystem, who uses their genesis ADA to influence governance in their favor. See their previous use of genesis ADA in Catalyst Fund 13 to act as kingmaker in determining votes of most proposals.\r\n\r\nI see the CF now managing Catalyst as a serious conflict of interest, and would rather Project Catalyst be managed as an independent entity funded by the treasury or managed by Intersect. An entity who does not have a financial incentive via genesis ADA to affect voting and the entire Catalyst process would be ideal.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "GOMA-DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreifmnigy6qcwkvnfwmfqaj4xwgkt5heoycw7jlvwmjg7oi3d7ydixe -->\r\n# GOMA-DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Approve Cardano Foundation as New Managing Entity of Project Catalyst\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2cm9w2egseygejydtgdddnsw9zdpc6ayyf8xh5ascfq4tqkpj06v`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAbstaining on Catalyst management transition. Continuity matters, but this shift deserves stronger guarantees around transparency, decentralization, and long-term reform.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Goofycrisp",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreigtp6cjgr57mklg2gipyb3c6yc57mdcy23sqhrw2oyqod6hg55s3e -->\r\n# Goofycrisp\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Approve Cardano Foundation as New Managing Entity of Project Catalyst\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygxasnzmrevqra9vscpsy4xf4rqthzkp6rr6zzft2lc7nscahj9r9`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a builder, I believe continued funding for new initiatives on Cardano is essential, and CF should restart the program.",
