      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihv6dzs4y4giddcuqlybmnectrr77okxe6w5gkvljl4sd7qfne4ia -->\r\n# Hermes Stakepool Germany (HRMS)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Approve Cardano Foundation as New Managing Entity of Project Catalyst\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygs5hngva3hymv7j4v0aewxpsjqskj9dnmy7j3jz5ven5zqvulq2t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nyes...",
