      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmXv8hpKcHHvEP1H469879kJ1VCjCuKNk1zS6NMV9jW2Ln -->\r\n# Marketing DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Approve Cardano Foundation as New Managing Entity of Project Catalyst\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23kumvpqgal3t6v4tamwrprjya453p3djam0eqg63usm9su77hjl`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIn the interest of time and to save on the expense of setting up a brand new entity to manage this vital incubator program, I think it makes since to have the Cardano Foundation  become the new stewards of Project Catalyst. I appreciate that the CF brought this to the community as a governance action to be voted on. It shows good faith and commitment to the system.",
