      "voter": "MREDGARCROSS",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreibuvjgjrqzdsc3dmuegqxwqtevkgbm2pjo6mcapzx7iegqgnpqlci -->\r\n# MREDGARCROSS\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Approve Cardano Foundation as New Managing Entity of Project Catalyst\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y269ehxj30k4vfzfc2z84v0xykd3amuy2xn0kv9zf8rhcec2fg2jr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n📌 **I’M VOTING YES TO APPROVE CARDANO FOUNDATION AS THE NEW MANAGING ENTITY OF PROJECT CATALYST**\r\n\r\nCardano is now going through an important governance vote.\r\n\r\nThe Cardano Foundation is asking the community to approve it as the new managing entity of **Project Catalyst**, replacing **IOG**. This is not about new grants and not about new funding. This is about who will officially keep Catalyst running from here.\r\n\r\n👉 **What is happening**\r\n\r\nProject Catalyst is the grant funding mechanism of the Cardano ecosystem.\r\n\r\nNow the Cardano Foundation wants to officially take over Catalyst management so that:\r\n— milestone reviews continue\r\n— payouts for already approved projects do not get delayed\r\n— operations for Funds **10–14** do not freeze\r\n\r\nIf this decision does not pass, Catalyst could face uncertainty and operational delays by the end of **May 2026**.\r\n\r\n🗣️ **The core point**\r\n\r\nThis vote is not about Fund 15 and Fund 16.\r\nThis is not about Intersect as the budget administrator.\r\nThis is not about new treasury allocations.\r\n\r\nThis vote is specifically about allowing the **Cardano Foundation to become the new managing entity** for Catalyst so the system does not stall.\r\n\r\n🔥 **Why I am voting YES**\r\n\r\nI am voting **YES** because in a moment like this, the ecosystem needs continuity, not confusion.\r\n\r\nWhen a system changes its managing side, the priority is simple:\r\n— keep operations running\r\n— protect payouts\r\n— honor existing obligations\r\n— prevent disruption across legacy funds\r\n\r\nIf management is not transferred in time, the result could be a pause, and a pause in a system like this damages trust across the entire ecosystem.\r\n\r\n📍 **My view**\r\n\r\nThis may look like a technical vote, but it is a very important one.\r\n\r\nThis is not about hype.\r\nThis is not about slogans.\r\nThis is about making sure **Catalyst does not get stuck** and that existing commitments are completed in an orderly way.\r\n\r\nI vote **YES**.\r\n\r\n🚀 COURSE “LEDGER COLD CRYPTO WALLET” | METAMASK\r\n[https://edgarbagdasarian.justclick.ru/order/LEDGERMETAMASK](https://edgarbagdasarian.justclick.ru/order/LEDGERMETAMASK)\r\n\r\n🔥 PRIVATE VIP CHAT PAID SUBSCRIPTION\r\n[https://t.me/MREDGARCROSS_BOT](https://t.me/MREDGARCROSS_BOT)\r\n\r\n🌐 ALL COURSES AND LINKS\r\n[https://mredgarcross.com/](https://mredgarcross.com/)\r\n\r\nI registered as a DRep and I am ready to help shape the future of the ecosystem. - I am optimistic about building the largest digital community in the world. 🖤 My DRep ID: ➡️ **drep1y269ehxj30k4vfzfc2z84v0xykd3amuy2xn0kv9zf8rhcec2fg2jr** More here [https://t.me/PROCENT666/338](https://t.me/PROCENT666/338)\r\n\r\n📌 **Note:** This post is for informational and analytical purposes only. It does not contain calls for action, protests, or violations of the law. Everything stated reflects the author’s personal reasoning.",
