      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreif4bfkbi5y7rymek222lpwrosyx2cw6xez46iq66ok27wwevgqcfi -->\r\n# Rudianos\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Approve Cardano Foundation as New Managing Entity of Project Catalyst\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfv77z2fsz7nucy59lx2pkafamathf8q783lalkr3quju0gv93lq2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am in favor of this proposal. There are several advantages to having the CF be the administrator for catalyst. This type of project is much more in scope for them than IOG. All major parties agree that this is the best course of action and we should move to get funds returned to the treasury.",
