      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmdY8tuiVFQiTw6jjwYKYs5FTxcfnabuNeuB2ofdozWkG5 -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳583,000 for Eternl Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmZe43yRxH7ScX7LXTgJeZgCveC3eRWkGg9jy9FgN1FCw8\r\n\r\nEternl is a widely used and reliable wallet, and its continued maintenance is essential for the ecosystem's **growth and sustainability**.\r\n\r\nMy support comes with a strong expectation. For a wallet, transparency is paramount. Therefore, I strongly urge the Eternl team to pivot to an open-source model. This would increase security and align with our community's **decentralization** ethos. While I support this funding to ensure stability now, my vote for future funding will be contingent on this transition.",
