      "voter": "DeepStatecraft",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmevaKBbMTLpg4DAwa5xK1oGSuaUThsSMUV3tXazzx3tod -->\r\n# DeepStatecraft\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳583,000 for Eternl Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfr0cur4guksjd6whxe5mltcaksqqhzd85dnq6lfk8ex7qs5mlcye`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n✅ Voted YES on: Eternl Wallet – Core Maintenance & Operations\r\n\r\nWhy I support it:\r\n\t•\t🔐 Essential Infrastructure – Eternl is one of Cardano’s most widely used wallets, trusted since 2021.\r\n\t•\t📱 Cross-Platform Access – Supports web, extension, iOS, and Android users.\r\n\t•\t🧑‍💻 Dev-Friendly – Reliable for both everyday users and developers building on Cardano.\r\n\t•\t💸 Sustainable Ops – Funding ensures 24/7 uptime, updates, and security for a critical gateway into Cardano.\r\n\r\nReliable wallets are the front door to any blockchain ecosystem. Eternl has earned the community’s trust through consistent delivery — and this proposal ensures that continues.\r\n\r\n🗳️ DRep: DeepStatecraft\r\n🔗 View Proposal",
