    {
      "voter": "Peter Bui",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pbwebdev/drep/refs/heads/main/r/25/250812_eternl_9qx4t762.jsonld -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳583,000 for Eternl Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis proposal supports continued maintenance of Eternl, a long-standing, widely used Cardano wallet across multiple platforms. The service is essential infrastructure for both users and developers. Funding sustains its reliability and security, aligning with the approved Cardano 2025 budget.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
