      "voter": "Medusa DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmQjMtLeyDPMQUULcEh6WrQXG7PpRjY73GGcVLj7kgRtoa -->\r\n# Medusa DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳5,885,000 for OSC Budget Proposal - Paid Open Source Model\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg5pzxhp0lu0m7757ww2hke8qhcuqgqt3c2ezphngwytz4gjr6yge`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI strongly support initiatives like this, but unfortunately, I’m also a developer and maintainer of open-source projects in the Cardano ecosystem. That makes me a potential beneficiary — which presents a clear conflict of interest. Therefore, I abstain.",
