      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmVGsCBWXXXopvwkBqpH1EL34qXaRqXNwfw2ggp3dxMgey -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳5,885,000 for OSC Budget Proposal - Paid Open Source Model\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI believe this is a fantastic & important withdrawal to keep Cardano Open Source tooling growing.",
