      "voter": "punkr",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmVdzP6ovkzSNws9W9dUWd1eL9wuGdJ6u17nWnxA6vntJV -->\r\n# punkr\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳5,885,000 for OSC Budget Proposal - Paid Open Source Model\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfyl9j6amk940g76r7ujnn5gywnjenv3kmun3a5tr5a83psl4vv64`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support this proposal because I believe in the power of open-source software to drive innovation and sustainability in the Cardano ecosystem. By funding the Paid Open Source Model, we can ensure reliable infrastructure, attract talented developers, and strengthen security for long-term growth.",
