    {
      "voter": "MREDGARCROSS",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreib2ayjry7omlpmwydzjlpktcqswkxdeby2ojtsaa3orvnl4p34lfm -->\r\n# MREDGARCROSS\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** IO & Ensurable Systems Cardano Maintenance Initiative\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y269ehxj30k4vfzfc2z84v0xykd3amuy2xn0kv9zf8rhcec2fg2jr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nno",
