      "voter": "Daehan_kor",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmbriH3n4hWyj3ASV4isKjHv9pJ6b2cqQvAxwfQvrKVJD6 -->\r\n# Daehan_kor\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳199,911 for OpShin - Python Smart Contracts for Cardano\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y28uwdrz2acyp4jka5fqp2fa3hp0klpme8wug3f5p2y45zsc0e8qw`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nPython with dataclass and type-hint really makes it readable and maintainable. On-chain script with Python will drive the future DApp development in Cardano.",
