      "voter": "DeepStatecraft",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmZUUhBonWvHp58CEz4zSzPzAFdksFDr2yBQSzhZJHtDLC -->\r\n# DeepStatecraft\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳199,911 for OpShin - Python Smart Contracts for Cardano\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfr0cur4guksjd6whxe5mltcaksqqhzd85dnq6lfk8ex7qs5mlcye`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n✅ Voted YES on: OpShin – Python Smart Contracts for Cardano\r\n\r\nWhy I support it:\r\n\t•\t🐍 Python is the 2nd most used language on GitHub — familiar, accessible, and fast-growing\r\n\t•\t🔐 OpShin offers functional-style security with Python syntax — no need to learn Haskell\r\n\t•\t⚡ Low-cost, efficient contracts with strict type safety and high performance\r\n\t•\t🛠️ Language is already production-ready and actively used by devs\r\n\t•\t🚀 Removes a major barrier to Cardano adoption: smart contract complexity\r\n\r\nMaking smart contracts approachable is critical for ecosystem growth. OpShin delivers.\r\n\r\n🗳️ DRep: DeepStatecraft\r\n🔗 View Proposal",
