      "voter": "Kyle Solomon",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adosiawolf/drep-rationale/refs/heads/main/0029 -->\r\n# Kyle Solomon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳199,911 for OpShin - Python Smart Contracts for Cardano\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytzshxuma6cwrnlv2ucyclfqw3k4nu4nuudmh2z87j9hncsk9dhy4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have voted Yes on the current proposal to fund OpShin. Enabling Python devlopers a path to build on Cardano is strategic.",
