      "voter": "Terminada",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminadaDrep/vote-contexts/refs/heads/main/20250726/011.jsonld -->\r\n# Terminada\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳199,911 for OpShin - Python Smart Contracts for Cardano\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytf9f78k7rkwk4cu6l2nvna22keu9yus4kqzc0hqspd36uszu0xc2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nMore appropriate to seek funding for such a proposal through Project Catalyst.",
