      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pbwebdev/drep/refs/heads/main/r/25/250812_cardano-vision_1d6faf578358.jsonld -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳750,000 for Cardano Product Committee Community-driven 2030 Carda\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is a budget-approved proposal under the 2025 Cardano budget process. It supports a structured, community-led process to define Cardano’s 2030 vision and 2026 roadmap, backed by product research and stakeholder engagement. Funding aligns with the goal of strengthening ecosystem planning and coordination.",
