      "voter": "DeepStatecraft",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWmjpaYscrBYmN5hoSoZ8qZ7VUo5rDU1kKxtAM6sibEwL -->\r\n# DeepStatecraft\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳600,000 for Complete Web3 developer stack to make Cardano the smart\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfr0cur4guksjd6whxe5mltcaksqqhzd85dnq6lfk8ex7qs5mlcye`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n✅ Voted YES on: Maestro – Complete Web3 Developer Stack to Make Cardano the Smart Contract Layer for Bitcoin\r\n\r\nSummary:\r\nThis proposal enables seamless Bitcoin-to-Cardano integration using Maestro’s developer infrastructure. The goal: unlock Bitcoin’s liquidity through Cardano’s EUTXO smart contract capabilities, positioning Cardano as the execution layer for Bitcoin DeFi.\r\n\r\nWhy I voted YES:\r\n\t•\tStrategic Integration: Bridges Bitcoin’s $1T+ capital base with Cardano’s smart contract layer\r\n\t•\tReal Developer Impact: Provides indexer, mempool monitoring, wallet management, and event notifications\r\n\t•\tEcosystem Synergy: Supports Cardano L2s (e.g., zkFold, Midgard, BitcoinOS), wallets (Lace, Tokeo), and protocols (FluidTokens)\r\n\t•\tUnlocks New Use Cases: BTC-backed DeFi, cross-chain apps, and enhanced developer experiences\r\n\t•\tCredible Execution: Maestro has a strong track record delivering infrastructure for Cardano-native apps\r\n\r\nThis is a pivotal step toward cross-chain adoption and expanding Cardano’s economic reach.\r\n\r\n🧠 Learn more: Maestro Proposal on Ekklesia\r\n\r\n🗳️ DRep: DeepStatecraft",
