      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adosiawolf/drep-rationale/refs/heads/main/0030 -->\r\n# Kyle Solomon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳600,000 for Complete Web3 developer stack to make Cardano the smart\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytzshxuma6cwrnlv2ucyclfqw3k4nu4nuudmh2z87j9hncsk9dhy4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have voted Yes on the current proposal to fund Maestro. Maestro indeed has a proven track record of delivering high-performance infrastructure and developer tooling, and enabling footing to the bitcoin defi narrative is good chips to play",
