    {
      "voter": "Porto Cripto DRep 🇧🇷 🇵🇹 (Atico & Bosco, from Cardanistas",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/portocripto/drep-entry/refs/heads/main/votes/GA039-info-ncl-rationale.jsonld -->\r\n# Porto Cripto DRep 🇧🇷 🇵🇹 (Atico & Bosco, from Cardanistas Stake Pool - CARDs)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳600,000 for Complete Web3 developer stack to make Cardano the smart\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ywuk39acvmkzda9e8kfmy7fwf946jd5uaa4l696atlas66s68f0fl`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n[Portuguese]\r\nOptamos por votar \"Sim\" nesta ação de governança (gov_action13tfag48nf94rtjcdq7c06vhkslmxxw9h6c88sl7q5g5nnewcsvlpvhtd5td), pois a carteira Eternl é a mais completa e utilizada do ecossistema Cardano; financiar esse grupo de desenvolvedores é essencial para a melhoria contínua desta ferramenta, promovendo sustentabilidade, usabilidade para os usuários e garantia de inovações no produto. Além disso, a justificativa de gastos apresentada, bem como as métricas de avaliação e controle, foram bem apresentadas.\r\n[English]\r\nWe chose to vote \"Yes\" on this governance action (gov_action13tfag48nf94rtjcdq7c06vhkslmxxw9h6c88sl7q5g5nnewcsvlpvhtd5td), because the Eternl wallet is the most complete and widely used in the Cardano ecosystem; funding this group of developers is essential for the continuous improvement of this tool, promoting sustainability, user-friendliness, and ensuring product innovation. Furthermore, the expense justification presented, as well as the evaluation and control metrics, were well presented.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Rudianos",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmb9PFz8JoRogdyaCMaQghhtJAHvH8DMhhhaffhg65djve -->\r\n# Rudianos\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳600,000 for Complete Web3 developer stack to make Cardano the smart\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfv77z2fsz7nucy59lx2pkafamathf8q783lalkr3quju0gv93lq2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting in favor of approving the treasury withdrawal for all 39 withdrawal actions that are part of the approved ecosystem budget administered by Intersect. I am voting this way for several reasons, as I will outline here. This rationale will be included in all 39 withdrawal votes.\r\nFirst and foremost, I believe that we would be making a mistake in underfunding our community with our available treasury funds. The budget system as it currently stands has some flaws, as should be expected from a first version of any system. Of the current proposals, I voted to include several in the budget when it was being formed; however, I also did not vote in favor of several others. This is, of course, the case for most DReps. If I were to vote only for the proposals I initially favoured, and all other DReps did the same, we would likely approve only 2 or 3 proposals out of 39 due to the vote split. In my view, this is not an acceptable outcome for the community, and this is why I was also opposed to the idea of having 39 separate treasury withdrawal actions. I have reviewed all 39 requests, and they all have merit. Are they exactly in line with the priorities I wanted as part of the initial budget? No. Is that reason enough to vote no on several of these and end up approving only 2 or 3 proposals in the end? I certainly don't believe so.\r\nIn addition to this, the total amount of the intersect budget is roughly 10% higher than what I voted for, and I find that to be within an acceptable margin to approve all the withdrawals.\r\nThe individual proposals also all received at least 50% community approval to be included and will be subject to reviews and milestones to receive funds.\r\nFor these reasons, I am casting my vote to approve and am wishing the best of luck to all the teams waiting for funding through this process.",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SASA_nagamaru_ながまる",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQ21acVbctEE8g97wa4dBCw8VvS11uPJCfVDDa1jQXkhY -->\r\n# SASA_nagamaru_ながまる\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳600,000 for Complete Web3 developer stack to make Cardano the smart\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytuddrgqca0xd4aams6pl9zndpcmxg0rs7z3mggjelm6kscp4arg5`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote Yes on this proposal.\r\n\r\nMaestro’s infrastructure initiative strategically positions Cardano as Bitcoin’s smart contract execution layer, channeling Bitcoin’s massive liquidity into the Cardano ecosystem.\r\n\r\nWith a proven track record supporting projects like FluidTokens, Tokeo, Sundial, and zkFold, and by offering powerful developer tooling such as mempool monitoring and webhook notifications, this proposal enhances both the developer experience and capital inflow.\r\n\r\nBacked by a capable team and a practical implementation plan, I believe this initiative will provide high-impact infrastructure that strengthens Cardano’s long-term growth.\r\n\r\n私はこの提案に Yes を投じます。\r\n\r\nMaestroによるインフラ構築は、CardanoをBitcoinのスマートコントラクト実行レイヤーとして位置づけ、Bitcoinの巨大な流動性をCardanoエコシステムに引き込む戦略的試みです。\r\n\r\n既にFluidTokens、Tokeo、Sundial、zkFoldなど多数の実プロジェクトを支援している実績や、Mempool監視やWebhook通知など開発者向け機能の提供により、開発体験の向上と資本流入の両立を実現しています。\r\n\r\nこの提案は、現実的な設計と実績あるチームによって、即戦力となるインフラを提供する内容であり、Cardanoの中長期的成長に寄与すると判断します。",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SIPO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://sipo.tokyo/drep/ga/GA_TreasuryWithdrawal2025_01/12_Complete_Web3_developer_stack_20250721/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# SIPO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳600,000 for Complete Web3 developer stack to make Cardano the smart\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yffld2866p00cyg3ejjdewtvazgah7jjgk0s9m7m5ytmmdq33v3zh`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSIPO supports this proposal because it strategically positions Cardano as the smart contract layer for Bitcoin, unlocking Bitcoin’s liquidity while significantly expanding Cardano’s developer and user base.\r\n\r\nMaestro’s proposal solves a long-standing limitation in the blockchain industry: Bitcoin’s lack of native smart contract capabilities. By leveraging Cardano’s robust EUTXO model and Maestro’s developer infrastructure, this initiative enables Bitcoin to access DeFi, while Cardano gains massive liquidity inflow and cross-chain utility.\r\n\r\nThe key reasons for our support are:\r\n\t1.\tCross-Chain DeFi Enablement\r\nThis proposal allows Cardano to act as Bitcoin’s smart contract execution layer, enabling advanced applications such as lending, staking, and governance for Bitcoin users. It transforms Cardano into a Bitcoin-integrated DeFi hub.\r\n\t2.\tRobust Developer Tooling\r\nMaestro’s infrastructure stack (indexers, wallet manager, mempool monitoring, etc.) lowers development barriers and accelerates time-to-market for dApps, wallets, and L2 solutions, including zkFold and BitcoinOS.\r\n\t3.\tProven Team with Cardano Track Record\r\nMaestro has delivered infrastructure for existing Cardano products and wallets. Their continued involvement ensures stability, scalability, and reliable integration.\r\n\t4.\tBitcoin Liquidity = Cardano Growth\r\nAccess to Bitcoin’s capital and user base will dramatically improve Cardano’s TVL, ecosystem visibility, and global competitiveness.\r\n\t5.\tGovernance and Delivery Accountability\r\nThe contract is legally structured, milestones are clearly defined, and oversight is ensured through Intersect’s governance and a third-party assurer.\r\n\r\nIn summary, this proposal directly supports Cardano’s evolution as a Bitcoin-compatible DeFi platform and enhances its infrastructure to support large-scale growth. It’s a critical step toward making Cardano a foundational layer in the next era of Web3 finance.\r\n\r\n⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻\r\n\r\nSIPOは本提案を支持します。なぜなら、これはカルダノをビットコインのスマートコントラクト実行基盤として位置づけ、ビットコインの流動性を引き込みつつ、カルダノの開発者層と利用者層を飛躍的に拡大させる戦略的な取り組みだからです。\r\n\r\nMaestroの提案は、長年の課題であった「ビットコインにDeFiやスマートコントラクト機能がない」という問題に対する革新的な解決策を提示しています。CardanoのEUTXOモデルとMaestroの強力な開発者向けツール群を活用することで、ビットコインはDeFiの恩恵を受け、Cardanoはその流動性と経済圏を取り込むことが可能になります。\r\n\r\nSIPOが賛成する主な理由は以下のとおりです：\r\n\t1.\tクロスチェーンDeFiの実現\r\nカルダノがビットコインのスマートコントラクトレイヤーとなることで、ビットコインを担保としたレンディング、ステーキング、ガバナンスなどの高度な金融機能が可能になります。これは、カルダノをビットコイン連携型のDeFiハブへと進化させる提案です。\r\n\t2.\t開発者体験の劇的改善\r\nMaestroが提供するインデクサー、ウォレットマネージャー、メモリプール監視などのインフラにより、開発の複雑性が低減され、dApps、ウォレット、L2ソリューション（zkFoldやBitcoinOSなど）の迅速な展開が促進されます。\r\n\t3.\t実績あるチームによる実装\r\nMaestroはすでにCardano上で多数のプロジェクトを支えており、トランザクション処理やセキュリティ面でも信頼性があります。\r\n\t4.\tビットコインの流動性 = カルダノの成長\r\nビットコインの資本とユーザー層を獲得することで、カルダノのTVL（Total Value Locked）、エコシステムの存在感、競争力が大きく向上します。\r\n\t5.\t契約・納品・監査の明確化\r\nインターセクトが法的契約を締結し、マイルストーンの達成確認や進捗監査が第三者によって行われるなど、ガバナンス体制も十分に整備されています。\r\n\r\n要するに、この提案はカルダノがビットコイン互換のDeFi基盤へと進化するための重要な一歩です。Web3金融の中核的存在を目指す上で、極めて意義のある提案であるとSIPOは判断しました。",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
