      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://Qmapt7K1vA5g5oVd84wVvgPKC1GCMR8JWHYuLU1Cokjy4r -->\r\n# The Dutch Drep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳600,000 for Complete Web3 developer stack to make Cardano the smart\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yvve4554njxyun2s5p9q70v88d5jl7r0h34pjhw5f5tmw3sjtrutp`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe, The Dutch Drep, vote Yes on this withdrawal governance action for Expanding Stablecoin / Cardano Native Asset Support, administered via Intersect. Supporting stablecoins and native asset support are controvercial and yet critical subjects. The project leads and Intersect are ecouraged to make clear and transparently verifiable milestones that demonstrate value-ad to the Cardano ecosystem.",
