      "voter": "Tony Boersma",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYXj9nLzELkp6D75rAPW92RJqGGm6icGBvMwaEGi2cHgU -->\r\n# Tony Boersma\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳600,000 for Complete Web3 developer stack to make Cardano the smart\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf7rhr6k8gfecdn8z5r38uqyaafcfr785lsgzsvc7ye3m9g3z20kj`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting yes. The scope and ambition of this project—if successful—could significantly expand the value of Cardano. Given the potential upside, I believe this is a calculated risk worth taking with Treasury funds.",
