      "voter": "AltcoinOracle",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPKb6HjSsBZ1RSuQLjHds14X843NADA11UY5Bm4T4Jhgc -->\r\n# AltcoinOracle\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳3,000,000 for High-yield RWA Asset for Cardano Tokenized Real Estate\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygvgk3899qm38zth07z5clhfjvzfhe2mf2kvkqrfxp93r5srjre5s`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote YES as RWAs are a top priority of the DRep:\r\n\r\nhttps://altcoinoracle.com/delegate-with-us/",
