      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmY1auaZoSFeeaaczRP1sgxSULitRNaU6hwVbsS9hkQoPy -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳3,000,000 for High-yield RWA Asset for Cardano Tokenized Real Estate\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe vote yes because tokenization of real world assets is an inevitable trend of the future. Cardano needs applications to meet this very real need.",
