    {
      "voter": "Cardanians",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUeCi6PQKig7gLefg2zN5BAUTDKYpZw3sbP7uBa1i8LSP -->\r\n# Cardanians\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳3,000,000 for High-yield RWA Asset for Cardano Tokenized Real Estate\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yt4lyf0fwlrz8k6j5evd3rxw0sqp67qkh36su98a97q3qsc0h03y4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Long-Term Sustainability**\r\nWhile real-world asset (RWA) tokenization is a promising narrative, this proposal lacks sufficient detail to prove it will deliver sustainable value to the Cardano ecosystem. The use of treasury funds to subsidize an unproven business model carries high strategic and reputational risk.\r\n\r\n**Builder and Ecosystem Growth**\r\nThe proposal does not offer infrastructure, tooling, or reusable components that benefit Cardano developers or projects. It primarily supports a single vertical use case with unclear technical, legal, or economic frameworks.\r\n\r\n**Decentralization and Community Engagement**\r\nThere is no transparency on how assets will be selected, who controls the platform, or how the community participates. The proposal is structurally centralized and offers no assurances of open access or governance input.\r\n\r\n**Responsible Treasury Spending**\r\n₳3,000,000 is a massive ask for a speculative, profit-driven venture with limited ecosystem integration and unclear delivery terms. The risk-to-return ratio is far too high, and public funds should not serve as seed capital for opaque real estate projects. We strongly recommend voting NO.",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Cardano Africa DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreibeq7pdywnuo5tod3d7jcy52ksypeubfgnjvb2aqc76rw4cms7wqi -->\r\n# Cardano Africa DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳3,000,000 for High-yield RWA Asset for Cardano Tokenized Real Estate\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytj9kz0n5yamacgcj8jr6apn36hx5suzqpefxvhy4cvfqmsqangtx`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe vote YES on the ₳3,000,000 treasury withdrawal for Haus’ Tokenized Real Estate protocol based on the rationale below.\r\n\r\nThis proposal directly addresses one of the hardest problems in crypto, real-world adoption of tokenized assets. Most DeFi projects are just shuffling liquidity around in a closed loop. Haus is attempting to break that cycle by bringing in an asset class worth $16 trillion.",
