    {
      "voter": "Daehan_kor",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmS54Hdk6P9ro297ovxcCmcWnpZw7UvRUmL85CdPpYu2zV -->\r\n# Daehan_kor\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳3,000,000 for High-yield RWA Asset for Cardano Tokenized Real Estate\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y28uwdrz2acyp4jka5fqp2fa3hp0klpme8wug3f5p2y45zsc0e8qw`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nDoes not prove how 3M ADA treasury withdrawal will return in the equivalent or more value back to the ecosystem.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
