    {
      "voter": "Tony Boersma",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmR4T9FmUwvQGyMYSqc1UVrUg3GJ3vzuCAkBWaicMGHhnQ -->\r\n# Tony Boersma\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳3,000,000 for High-yield RWA Asset for Cardano Tokenized Real Estate\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf7rhr6k8gfecdn8z5r38uqyaafcfr785lsgzsvc7ye3m9g3z20kj`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting No. Does this really need Treasury funding? Could it not be funded privately?  There’s no clarity on the regulatory framework, nor jurisdictional compliance. The risks—legal, financial, and reputational—are high, and liability is unclear.",
      "vote": "NO"
