    {
      "voter": "Varavas",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmRd7VBVkeRJVcuqk1zr4EHRGEKet7b9QYCVBGg55JCu2e -->\r\n# Varavas\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳3,000,000 for High-yield RWA Asset for Cardano Tokenized Real Estate\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yte3chru8m7d3gzgpwvmgan0gjfxru9r9cyvrkkcerc0wcg6qfvtc`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have chosen to support core Cardano technology developed by established teams and community members who have consistently demonstrated their dedication and expertise, particularly through the bear market. However, while the Haus team's project shows significant promise, their requested funding amount is excessive. I believe their proposal would be better suited for consideration among the upcoming Catalyst proposals in Fund 14.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
