      "voter": "Voice of the People",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DRepVoiceOfThePeople/VOP_Repo/refs/heads/main/VC20250718HighYieldRWA.jsonld -->\r\n# Voice of the People\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳3,000,000 for High-yield RWA Asset for Cardano Tokenized Real Estate\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2ecrj7jd9alaxumvm49hgng9rp239nda5ucegd05ndvxfqftwr9f`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe cost is too high keeping in mind the Regulatory complexity that it will have (different states different regulations that might change over time), and reliance on unproven waitlist conversion\r\nToo risky",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
