      "voter": "Cash",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWBfdouJ9VdMusUH23pXrevnXeSnWquUnRpL4ioZmzpkP -->\r\n# Cash\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Critical Integrations Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygeyfh8nm03dnl5a2hxdtv09pu7uhep9l0cpg0zpr60jqys05cku2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe time for action is now. Let's get this done.",
