    {
      "voter": "Lourde",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreie3jncqm7tkrzqaurwkv6uhpn46tv5ldow2fyeclv2ntwrccqqucu -->\r\n# Lourde\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Critical Integrations Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygtvnwgsucstvesms2hv9vc8hw3tye5zhzldmszrxqd2rxsje5c6m`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI find value in a concerted effort of the founding entities and the included Intersect group accompanied by Midnight foundation. The need for critical integrations have remained an open wound for too long and now a remedy is well thought out and planned. Many of the named points of initiative are currently available on chain built from the ground up on CARDANO like Oracles Charli3 and OrcFax (In Testing), the homegrown Taptools analytics platform as well as others. It is my request that the expertise from these projects / TEAMS will be called upon for the sake of advisement or even consideration to help build the required infrastructure. I vote Yes willingly with an additional request that the mentioned Co-proposers or other entities chosen by the Steering Committee as contractual counterparties are vetted and announced to the community prior to engagement in funding for the sake of transparency and community knowledge, I thank the entities and all parties involved with this proposal for showing unity and standing together to further evolve the ecosystem, United we stand United we grow. ~LOURDE~ Ouroborus Imperator Aeternalis",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Marketing DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmeUxPXKzoNAU8bMEt6JTH6NcZtTNUmTpZXjFYJuc9Srgy -->\r\n# Marketing DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Critical Integrations Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23kumvpqgal3t6v4tamwrprjya453p3djam0eqg63usm9su77hjl`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA very enthusiastic \"Yes\" for this governance action. This will address critical infrastructure blockades that have slowed/prevented the on-boarding of major stablecoins into Cardano. Cardano is a top-tier blockchain, lets make it easier for the rest of the world to discover that. LFG!",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
