      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihd3f5opju7ctswstmvb2qeuwygqqzip4rwgrr7btirbsddpktmdq -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Critical Integrations Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI would love to see some additional funds committed to this by the founding entities (mainly Emurgo & CF; not IO) but in general this is a good & important proposal that absolutely has to go through.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
