      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiaa52v7fheaksomcjakjwdugl6sqqjhbogwou7y4qdghxzsyrpxyi -->\r\n# Zacros\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Critical Integrations Budget\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2tp9q9vckglgkgkgcdc33jtahrstfzfj3c8ez926ysszjqp5r4ts`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nPanda votes YES.\r\nAlthough Panda believes that reasonable spending lies at the base of the blue foundation, when the time comes to push through the forest and reach a new dawn Panda is ready.",
