      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQ3S2JVnGpKYgdHVttRbqEWbeJEQP7qY7EU2U39Z3vL1v -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳243,478 for MLabs Core Tool Maintenance & Enhancement Plutarch\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe voted yes because Plutarch is a core tool that is widely adopted in the ecosystem and requires regular maintenance. It makes sense to provide a budget for maintenance and new feature rollouts based on community demand.",
