      "voter": "Dan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmNf95go1tD62ry4FQRVconMLeYT1PfuAKtppyNnk8Jspk -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳243,478 for MLabs Core Tool Maintenance & Enhancement Plutarch\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting Yes to fund the ongoing maintenance of the Plutarch smart contract development tool. Regular updates will keep it compatible, reliable, and useful for developers. MLabs has the expertise and track record to maintain this core piece of Cardano infrastructure.",
