    {
      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmYhXEFrboWS9bjBDmTxTDr3Lp25RQ7ErhzTMihVSxJeWo -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳243,478 for MLabs Core Tool Maintenance & Enhancement Plutarch\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/Qmehh93CZs3jKNYjBhTvMeCPquUuF6XL82SDwkYmz589ES\r\n\r\nMaintaining core infrastructure like Plutarch is vital for Cardano's **growth and sustainability**, directly empowering our developer community.\r\n\r\nIn the future, I believe this is better directed via the Open Source Committee (OSC) or Catalyst.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
