      "voter": "Peter Bui",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pbwebdev/drep/refs/heads/main/r/25/250812_plutarch_4c9fbd18ae69.jsonld -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳243,478 for MLabs Core Tool Maintenance & Enhancement Plutarch\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nPlutarch is a key production-grade tool for building Cardano smart contracts. Its upkeep and feature enhancements are necessary to maintain ecosystem stability and developer productivity. The team has a strong track record and the proposal aligns with the approved Cardano Budget 2025 allocations for core infrastructure maintenance.",
