      "voter": "Tony Boersma",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWMFi6jTmqZGhYvTbMP9x6uGsrgMwaGtSjMMjDgxKcgUc -->\r\n# Tony Boersma\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳243,478 for MLabs Core Tool Maintenance & Enhancement Plutarch\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf7rhr6k8gfecdn8z5r38uqyaafcfr785lsgzsvc7ye3m9g3z20kj`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting Yes. Plutarch plays a valuable role in advancing Cardano’s smart contract ecosystem. Continued maintenance and enhancement of this tool will benefit developers working on high-assurance applications and support innovation in smart contract design.",
      "vote": "YES"
