      "voter": "Long Hồ",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/keishyo/vote/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context_3.jsonld -->\r\n# Long Hồ\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Should K increased\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yttfrpngasw7yrdryydsg66gzv8znkj0stjngm5a8hs353stdeml6`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe proposal is merely suggestive of whether or not to proceed, lacking real clarity. The evidence provided is unconvincing and appears promotional. If possible, please provide more compelling evidence and reasoning for future proposals.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
