    {
      "voter": "MREDGARCROSS",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mredgarcrosss/VOTE-1/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# MREDGARCROSS\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Should K increased\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y269ehxj30k4vfzfc2z84v0xykd3amuy2xn0kv9zf8rhcec2fg2jr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nКраткосрочно: Увеличение \r\n𝐾\r\nK до 1000 может немного снизить доход от стейкинга, так как доходы распределятся на большее количество пулов. Инвесторам придется искать менее насыщенные пулы, чтобы получить максимум вознаграждений.\r\n\r\nДолгосрочно: Более высокая децентрализация может положительно повлиять на цену ADA. Большое количество пулов улучшает безопасность и устойчивость сети, что делает её более привлекательной для инвесторов и может способствовать росту цены монеты в будущем.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "RABIT",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adrem1/RABIT_drep_info/refs/heads/main/K_action_Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# RABIT\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Should K increased\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytcypl8fyuvm2epkjz2m4wzf24y26vj998wj4cvu7nnpgygh2sltr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nK represents the ideal number of stake pools and over 1000 stake pools have minted at least one block in their lifetime: K should be increased to 1000. \r\n\r\nIncreasing K would encourage delegators of saturated pools to redelegate to smaller pools, increasing decentralisation.\r\n\r\nMore info:\r\n\r\nhttps://iohk.io/en/blog/posts/2020/11/13/the-general-perspective-on-staking-in-cardano/\r\n\r\nhttps://blogs.ed.ac.uk/blockchain/2022/04/19/pool-splitting-behaviour-and-equilibrium-properties-in-cardano-rewards-scheme/",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SIDAN Lab",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sidan-lab/DRep/refs/heads/main/voting-history/ga03/ga03-rationale.jsonld -->\r\n# SIDAN Lab\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Should K increased\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfjez5zup0gystdvc933w2mn8k64hcy3krvc2namluwjxdcfhm8wd`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe proposed increase in parameter k is expected to have the following effects:\r\n- Stake pools will reach saturation more quickly, increasing the likelihood of ADA migration to smaller stake pools.\r\n- The creation of new stake pools will improve the network's decentralization.\r\n- Rewards received by stake pools will decrease, potentially impacting the incentives and sustainability of stake pool operators.\r\nAdditionally, this governance action records information on-chain without producing any dire",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
