      "voter": "Tobias Ilskov",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TobiasIlskov/Comment-on-Info-Action-Should-K-be-increased-/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# Tobias Ilskov\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Should K increased\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yt9xg7l0dlgxj3lyewmndzrq5wzj3f4nusdkpfa9n7zf4ssayqnk0`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nPositive:\r\nDelegators to many currently saturated pools may be awakened when they hear they are earning fewer rewards than they otherwise would. As they come on-chain to re-stake, it provides a window of opportunity to also encourage them to delegate to a DRep, which strengthens Cardano's governance resilience\r\n\r\nNegative:\r\nThe main negative is that some single SPOs (who are committed to only operating 1 pool) may no longer be able to run their pools profitably. \r\n\r\nI see the benefit as more impactful",
