      "voter": "AKYO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYS6xzKE14WqafRHMqdhoHczT4sSmidYCCNmf6HYSePCu -->\r\n# AKYO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Treasury DeFi Liquidity Budget\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yts3qdjsqcnhld4r3uek2uu0n2tnh824tgnf75a83q3yhequuy54u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nこのガバナンスアクションは、Invalid metadataです。\\n\\nThis governance action has invalid metadata.",
