      "voter": "CardanoYoda (MANDA Pool)",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Satuchac/DRep/refs/heads/main/010_My%20Rationale.jsonld -->\r\n# CardanoYoda (MANDA Pool)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Treasury DeFi Liquidity Budget\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2m0g4r66pyaw3p7u454wc0p4f0ygm8ueaev0mgd3tvwm7sskqwqp`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting NO because the governance action is invalid and will reportedly be resubmitted.",
