      "voter": "LALKUL",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Juana-Attieh/lalkul/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context%20(4).jsonld -->\r\n# LALKUL\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Treasury DeFi Liquidity Budget\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytnjaqmwq9qk9yv2a5ff79qj2r2mgmcmpm0683993ssy86s77kavf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nLalkul is voting NO on this proposal due to its failure to follow the required submission format. Adhering to correct formatting is essential to ensure transparency, clarity, and on-chain verifiability.\r\nAllowing exceptions undermines trust in the governance process and opens the door to potential loopholes. To uphold the integrity of the system, we will categorically vote no on proposals that do not meet the established standards.",
