      "voter": "AdaStat",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://adastat.net/_meta/drep/vote68.jsonld -->\r\n# AdaStat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfe9en4hsgc3r6nhtmwjeljh06hgnvt9yzzkwqcftvdj34cdxdg7u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs I mentioned earlier, I'll change my vote to Yes once I get answers to my questions. So I'm voting Yes, since the proposal's author provided clarification and shared the following link https://docs.gov.tools/important-updates/govtool-maintenance-ending-soon/updated-budget-proposal/updated-govtool-budget-proposal-long-version",
      "vote": "YES"
