    {
      "voter": "Crypto Eats Legacy",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmX2NP5DFUp3DzLXLNwWpRR12ARSShMJ88mDYBov3m238x -->\r\n# Crypto Eats Legacy\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytd2mf58tfqv78z7e99fy0gnmfep0kscclnwpvx7qvwpc5srxwg5g`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nMore platforms for people to engage with governance is better for Cardano",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Crypto_Oaj",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdbtoqjpmVSTWFWwmN3uxgr7Px8X5scuY3k1ZNSN8CmYW -->\r\n# Crypto_Oaj\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytwlmrm6ksc8sa5fdhm63prqve6hjzvghdc3053zwz6hyeg0ayhg2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAfter reviewing the GovTool source code and analyzing the proposal details, I have decided to vote NO on this proposal. The requested budget appears significantly disproportionate to the scope and technical complexity of the project. Based on my experience, a comparable application could be developed from scratch—more efficiently and with better architectural decisions—for a fraction of the requested funds, potentially around one-fifth of the cost.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, existing explorers that already receive treasury support provide governance-related data in a more optimized and scalable manner. With minimal additional investment, they could easily extend their functionality to include voting and governance interaction features, achieving similar or even better results at a far lower cost.\r\n\r\nWhile I appreciate the team’s work on GovTool and its contribution to the ecosystem so far, this particular proposal does not demonstrate a cost-effective or technically necessary path forward given the available infrastructure and funding priorities. Therefore, my vote is NO.",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Dan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmezZbPWoAeuSpEd2PeMmHShhNcHFAtrntRryEfUzXgBUK -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting No. While I support GovTool’s mission, the amount requested is significant, particularly given the product is still affected by UX problems. I believe a smaller budget would be sufficient to address GovTools current issues and demonstrate commitment to quality, before requesting funding which includes a large portion for the development of new features.",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmdP4SKMWk82ddLgNipnPfAZrZm1njbTwuiscn84GxJDNZ -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmaZYQrEZpKrQj3h6HGKrNDQZ19kpa56k8pp4mxTaGi6yR\r\n\r\nWhile I appreciate the recent improvements to GovTool and recognize the expertise of vendors such as LidoNation and Dquadrant, I cannot vote yes on this proposal. The requested amount is not justified by the current quality, performance, or user experience, both from my own experience and from feedback within the community. The reported metrics, including “50,000+ unique mainnet users across 170+ countries,” are not sufficiently supported by transparent data or verifiable evidence. For a request of this scale, I would expect stronger validation, clearer performance metrics, and a higher standard of UX, performance and functionality. I would however welcome a reduced budget that better reflects the current stage of the product and its demonstrated impact.",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Donny_Jerri",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiavskrp5jmrsjkkr7l4sczvryrvneudl7a4f2ancdsxo3xujv2tdq -->\r\n# Donny_Jerri\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf3m9swrzce3yq2hx64xfd2xz6paj6z3qdfh9s92t5u4j8cpsxpkn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nessential service for long term trust and growth of the Cardano ecosystem",
