    {
      "voter": "hix_coffeepool",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmY5KazcsTNuG4fJCkWKNg5MpC9ZDrugu7jnEnAZ1ZRzX5 -->\r\n# hix_coffeepool\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygnh2uf4wkc8ldgfxwz7rzuga3m8jtqew9xh5g3n587mg6g3ge0sj`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmarxvgCAoJ8TZG5bugj7TuBnvoad4DgFhFNvrrF4dZekJ\r\n\r\nI am voting \"Yes\" on this Governance Action following to my Yes vote on its info action.",
