      "voter": "LallyMcClay",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiavhx5jgf6mxfna65y2jmpp7sh4p3ejywgbqfw3o7fh7zcogn6644 -->\r\n# LallyMcClay\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2dptycrks2ggae95leeh66m0l0svet98c44hl4rmaec7as6hgpp3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting yes for this as per support for Budget info action",
