      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihyzbanlphpaykkngltb3fyoxeyjoz7deeshn62fyuqez7y5o7ui4 -->\r\n# Mike Rogero (羅邁凱）\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2lhe7wn2sr6vme8gnca4jrkhv47uh3tklsykmrqvwzdq4g5s8wju`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI can not in good conscience vote yes on this withdrawal.  As I have spent much of my career delivering software services to enterprises, I do not believe this system is worth this price based on what has been delivered so far, nor based on its roadmap of deliverables for the next 12 months.\r\n\r\nHowever, I can not vote no because this has already received community approval by vote, and thus I do not believe that this is the place to undermine a previous democratic decision.  \r\n\r\nI do not believe that the team should have had to submit this request at all as proposal approval should imply rights to withdraw.\r\n\r\nI won't vote Yes, as I can not in good conscience approve this, but I also won't use my vote to try to derail the process.",
