      "voter": "MREDGARCROSS",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreia72tnw5azmbknauklxgqevppckoh5aimcsjospky2gkvfkjn7uui -->\r\n# MREDGARCROSS\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y269ehxj30k4vfzfc2z84v0xykd3amuy2xn0kv9zf8rhcec2fg2jr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n📢 **Voting “YES” to fund GovTool — Cardano’s core governance tool**\r\n\\#Cardano #Governance #DRep #мысляотэдгара\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n🗳 A Treasury Withdrawal proposal is live to allocate **₳1,150,000** for 12 months of active maintenance and development of **GovTool**.\r\n\r\nGovTool is the **essential platform for Cardano governance**, enabling us to:\r\n🔹 Register and become DReps\r\n🔹 Delegate votes\r\n🔹 Vote on proposals\r\n🔹 View transparent results\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 🧠 Why I voted “YES”:\r\n\r\n* I personally **use GovTool daily** — it’s my main tool as a DRep.\r\n* Continued funding ensures stability and feature development.\r\n* Funds cover infrastructure, hosting, testing, and new features (like DRep voting history and group DReps).\r\n* This protects Cardano governance from fragmentation and reliance on closed, private platforms.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n⚖️ As a DRep, this tool is vital for my work, and I see it as my duty to support its growth.\r\n\r\n🟢 That’s why my vote is **YES**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n🗳 My DRep ID:\r\n➡️ **drep1y269ehxj30k4vfzfc2z84v0xykd3amuy2xn0kv9zf8rhcec2fg2jr**\r\n📌 More details: [https://t.me/PROCENT666/338](https://t.me/PROCENT666/338)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n🚀 COURSE: “LEDGER COLD CRYPTO WALLET” | METAMASK\r\n[https://edgarbagdasarian.justclick.ru/order/LEDGERMETAMASK](https://edgarbagdasarian.justclick.ru/order/LEDGERMETAMASK)\r\n\r\n🔥 CLOSED VIP CHAT PAID SUBSCRIPTION\r\n[https://t.me/MREDGARCROSS\\_BOT](https://t.me/MREDGARCROSS_BOT)\r\n\r\n🌐 ALL COURSES & LINKS\r\n[https://mredgarcross.com/](https://mredgarcross.com/)",
