      "voter": "MyCNFT DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreifyzcsu235yvsyblg6poiq43ggelv7iamvvbeyg5vjoond5ay2fcy -->\r\n# MyCNFT DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2wwa9cqns95zzztmz9vw3jm7n8lpd3x8wfvg6wnvvt29ngdm0mlh`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nGovTool is a critical open-source infrastructure for Cardano governance. Halting its development would risk fragmentation and reliance on closed tools during the crucial Voltaire era. While the requested budget is significant, it is transparently structured, subject to smart contract oversight, and with unspent funds returning to the Treasury. Potential concerns (cost levels, role overlap) should be addressed through audits and future optimizations, but they are not strong enough to block funding at this stage.",
