      "voter": "SureWealthNG",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihgfe223ykemxgdrynd7uo5k4j6pl5rxjifrtqx3lzk4ugx52o7gi -->\r\n# SureWealthNG\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2t8w2rtcyfh3f863gqcwmru7lafuszmvy0xhg7xjwdpwgcf2kz87`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAm voting Yes because this proposal is a prudent investment in Cardano's governance backbone, promoting open-source accessibility and community-driven evolution. It aligns with decentralization ethos, offers strong accountability, and has evident community backing. If concerns arise (e.g., on transparency), condition support on enhanced reporting, as some DReps have, progress can be monitored via GovTool docs and the treasury dashboard to ensure delivery.",
