      "content": "<!-- url: https://terminada.io/gov-acts/20251022-govtool-maintenance/vote-context.jsonld -->\r\n# Terminada\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytf9f78k7rkwk4cu6l2nvna22keu9yus4kqzc0hqspd36uszu0xc2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nToo expensive.  Better functionality is already built into wallets.",
