      "voter": "YUTA",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmfQP9GZL3krT2DRvkxk5HRkE4jgjPhiGPycxk3as1ReCQ -->\r\n# YUTA\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2200we9c904un36tzaearntzzl63snffuul9qsk0te4utqfkke0w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI will vote YES for \"Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development\" for the same reasons as when voting for the Budget info action.\r\n\r\nCardano's governance is in a very difficult situation, and Govtool and wallet providers need to work together to give people a better chance to truly choose a DRep that aligns with their values.\r\n\r\n私は「Withdraw ₳1,150,000 for GovTool 12 months active maintenance and development」に、Budget info アクション投票時と同様に理由でYESを投票します。\r\n\r\nCardanoのガバナンスは非常に厳しい状況にあり、Govtoolとウォレットプロバイダーの協力により、自分の価値観に合うDRepを本当の意味でよりよく選択可能な状態にする必要があります。",
      "vote": "YES"
