      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdgyHufeWLdE1b7bAmQr8BMc6oKxodvnHU8ox2BtCnzj9 -->\r\n# AKYO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yts3qdjsqcnhld4r3uek2uu0n2tnh824tgnf75a83q3yhequuy54u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n本提案は、憲法委員会が必要最小議席数を下回ったことにより、ガバナンス機能が停止していた状況を解消するためのものです。選挙結果は監査済みで問題なく、ガバナンス継続のため賛成します。\\n\\nThis proposal resolves the situation in which the Constitutional Committee fell below its required minimum number of seats, resulting in a halt to governance functions. The election results have been audited and verified, and I vote Yes to ensure governance continuity.",
