    {
      "voter": "Big Lazy Cat",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreig4wvwrmqmmhd324kb6akspolc2heswabp42p3rngxhtonfxv7fou -->\r\n# Big Lazy Cat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yffcjs0njfea09xhs6up429rhya5pxd7qz7hvmwq6vqy2nczwpj3g`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSupport. I do not personally know the elected member, but I respect the community’s snap-election outcome. Restoring the Constitutional Committee to its minimum size is essential for Cardano’s governance to function normally.",
