    {
      "voter": "BTBF_XSP",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUbuKp39xhGb6niaus4iCfZqZLrpMkZpzY2X71fUS8brT -->\r\n# BTBF_XSP\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2vyrqh0fa4qh4tmy7322va6ryk78uh6szppezaft0watyqp5hdwx`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support the addition of the CC members elected through the Ekklesia vote.",
