      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreib2nlzhxufnc7vdermhrjhb6xusd74y56m3kkxck4b4pjhl65j4ma -->\r\n# Nimuë Lady of the Lake Pool\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygj02llvuusnhphvhlxf7d2cxhs53twjnwwl5at3zwht4xc6xdgl4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nGiven that the outcome of the Ekklesia vote is somewhat split between two candidates and a large portion of DReps/stake didn’t vote, I would rather have seen either a gov action that adds them both (we would also be better off with a CC consisting of more members than the minimum), or multiple simultaneous gov actions where we would have the choice between adding them both or only one of them, essentially holding a “2nd round” on-chain.\r\nThat said, I think it’s more important that other proposals aren’t blocked due to a governance shutdown. Hence, I’m voting ✅ YES on this proposal, although with minor aversion (to be clear, I want both candidates to be added to the CC).",
