    {
      "voter": "Patrick_Tobler",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreie4fmhpaomgmw7zhi7rcsk5xzj45ivzfaf2ttfxouk3s2cywpplty -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nUrgent addition & followed a good process by INTERSECT. Definitely a yes from me.",
