      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQ4PKrJYHvRt6tK5RRBjnfLPtJUHhFsLJ3K1S9czuNtCd -->\r\n# Peter Horsfall\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytfas4axhm8yzrqqh4ru2uuqesu87zeq6fwg5pq8azqf7ecu4nu8s`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nYes. Onwards for governance.",
