    {
      "voter": "Porto Cripto DRep 🇧🇷 🇵🇹 (Atico & Bosco, from Cardanistas",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/portocripto/drep-entry/refs/heads/main/votes/GA078-info-ncl-rationale.jsonld -->\r\n# Porto Cripto DRep 🇧🇷 🇵🇹 (Atico & Bosco, from Cardanistas Stake Pool - CARDs)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ywuk39acvmkzda9e8kfmy7fwf946jd5uaa4l696atlas66s68f0fl`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n[Portuguese]\r\nOptamos por votar \"SIM\" nesta ação de governança (gov_action1fk4nx9zhkcdcyjaudwjtnkd7gagwyhqtth2zypawkc78gvdxkuzqqtvqdkv), pois ela representa a ratificação de uma votação prévia dos DReps, conduzida pelo Intersect na plataforma Ekklesia. Acreditamos que o novo membro eleito do Comitê Constitucional, o coletivo Cardano Curia, está plenamente capacitado para enfrentar os desafios futuros da Cardano, contribuindo com competência, representatividade e compromisso com os princípios da governança descentralizada.\r\n[English]\r\nWe chose to vote \"YES\" on this governance action (gov_action1fk4nx9zhkcdcyjaudwjtnkd7gagwyhqtth2zypawkc78gvdxkuzqqtvqdkv), as it represents the ratification of a prior DRep vote, conducted by Intersect on the Ekklesia platform. We believe that the newly elected member of the Constitutional Committee, the Cardano Curia consortium, is well-qualified to face Cardano’s future challenges, contributing with competence, representation, and a strong commitment to the principles of decentralized governance.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "RCADA",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWdEs1DXsavcmBTP4hvHgE3Y5XLSu61NL65nHhxhgCHYb -->\r\n# RCADA\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf7kjx5rlyuyzxkr4dzyccdfs8tesh29amrtcpyplu3asnqjgmdz3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nRCADA participated in the off-chain snap election facilitated by Intersect using the Ekklesia platform. Although we supported a different candidate during the voting period, we recognize that the audited, stake-weighted process produced a clear result. Upholding the legitimacy of Cardano’s governance framework means respecting the outcome of a constitutionally compliant election, even when the elected candidate was not the one we personally voted for. The role of a DRep is to safeguard process integrity and ensure continuity of governance, not to pursue preferred electoral outcomes.\r\n\r\nThe retirement of the Cardano Atlantic Council reduced the Constitutional Committee below the committeeMinSize parameter defined in Cardano’s governance system. This placed the Committee in a state where it could not ratify governance actions requiring its approval, limiting Cardano’s on-chain governance to only a subset of actions. Restoring the Committee to its minimum operational size is therefore a constitutional and functional requirement. This Update Committee action correctly executes the next step of the election process by placing the highest-supported candidate—Cardano Curia—into the vacated seat with the appropriate, staggered term.\r\n\r\nWe reviewed the metadata, audit files, and Merkle-verifiable results provided. These demonstrate that the off-chain election followed the principles outlined in Article VII of the Cardano Constitution: accessibility, transparency, verifiability, and community stewardship. The presence of independently audited results strengthens the legitimacy of the process and ensures that this governance action faithfully reflects the will of participating DReps.\r\n\r\nWhile this action resolves the immediate issue, RCADA acknowledges the broader risk highlighted by several community members: a Constitutional Committee operating without buffer seats is structurally fragile. A single resignation should not temporarily disable the governance system’s ability to ratify actions. We encourage future consideration—through the appropriate governance channels—of either increasing the Committee size modestly or revisiting the committeeMinSize parameter in a constitutionally compliant manner. Such resilience measures would help ensure that Cardano governance remains robust in the face of unexpected changes.\r\n\r\nGiven the urgent need to restore full governance functionality, the clear community-validated election outcome, and the constitutional correctness of the process, RCADA votes YES on this governance action.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Rudianos",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreib6fu367zf4phv2j37ppyrpv7yqgtgdsnjbcmkdjkwh567gpwjk5u -->\r\n# Rudianos\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfv77z2fsz7nucy59lx2pkafamathf8q783lalkr3quju0gv93lq2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis action does not require a very in depth rationale. This is a straightforward yes since we need to add the extra member of the CC on order to proceed with governance.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SASA_nagamaru_ながまる",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmT77p9sYeDc7oGK2nf1BV1rWDdm4k8BETNYBWp1AHkP9n -->\r\n# SASA_nagamaru_ながまる\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytuddrgqca0xd4aams6pl9zndpcmxg0rs7z3mggjelm6kscp4arg5`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI will vote YES on this governance action.\r\n\r\nDue to a recent resignation, the Constitutional Committee currently falls below the required committeeMinSize of seven members. As a result, governance actions that require CC ratification cannot be processed. Filling the vacant seat is essential to restore full on-chain governance functionality.\r\n\r\nThe snap election was conducted in line with the Cardano Constitution and guardrails, with transparent and verifiable procedures and publicly available audit results. Adding Cardano Curia as the newly elected member restores the Committee to its required size and ensures continuity in Cardano governance.\r\n\r\nFor these reasons, I support this proposal.\r\n\r\n本ガバナンス提案に YES で投票します。\r\n\r\n現在の憲法委員会はメンバー退任により committeeMinSize=7 を下回っており、憲法委員会による 承認（ratification） が必要なガバナンスアクションが実行できない状況です。この空席を速やかに補充し、通常のオンチェーンガバナンス機能を回復させることは、Cardano全体の健全な運営のために不可欠です。\r\n\r\n今回のスナップ選挙は、Cardano憲法およびガードレールに沿って透明性のある手続きで実施され、監査結果も公開されています。選出された Cardano Curia を憲法委員会に追加することで、委員会は再び規定サイズに達し、ガバナンスの継続性が保証されます。\r\n\r\n以上の理由から、本提案を支持します。",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SIPO",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreia6ggtf72d5nhewuaguwoxwvfgwankwt62i35q6s6g25sm2uv5xxe -->\r\n# SIPO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yffld2866p00cyg3ejjdewtvazgah7jjgk0s9m7m5ytmmdq33v3zh`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSIPO votes YES on this governance action to add a new Constitutional Committee (CC) member.\r\n\r\nWe decided to support this proposal because restoring the CC to its required minimum size is essential for Cardano’s on-chain governance to function normally. At the moment, the CC has been operating with only six members due to a recent resignation. This puts the committee below the committeeMinSize parameter and prevents it from ratifying governance actions that require CC approval. As a result, important items such as treasury budgets, key protocol parameter updates, and constitutional matters cannot move forward.\r\n\r\nFor us in SIPO, ensuring the continuity and stability of Cardano’s governance is one of the most important responsibilities as a DRep. A governance system that can recover quickly from unexpected events—such as the resignation of a committee member—is vital for maintaining trust in the ecosystem and supporting long-term growth.\r\n\r\nThis proposal is the final on-chain step to confirm the results of the snap election facilitated by Intersect. The election process was transparent, verifiable, and fully aligned with the Cardano Constitution. A total of 88 DReps participated, representing over 3.16 billion ADA. Cardano Curia—who received support from 33 DReps and 1.679 billion ADA—was selected through a legitimate and democratic process. We believe it is important to respect and uphold this community-driven decision.\r\n\r\nBy approving this proposal, the Constitutional Committee will return to a full seven-member structure, enabling Cardano to resume all governance actions without limitation. This is especially important as our ecosystem continues to evolve, requiring predictable and reliable decision-making mechanisms.\r\n\r\nWe also welcome Cardano Curia’s addition to the CC. Their expertise in governance, constitutional interpretation, and ecosystem education will contribute positively to the quality and resilience of Cardano’s decision-making processes. As Cardano moves toward greater institutional, civic, and global use cases, the presence of diverse and capable CC members becomes increasingly important.\r\n\r\nIn short, SIPO supports this proposal because:\r\n\t1.\tIt restores full governance functionality to the Cardano chain.\r\n\t2.\tIt respects the democratic outcome of a transparent snap election.\r\n\t3.\tIt strengthens Cardano’s institutional stability and long-term reliability.\r\n\t4.\tIt upholds the principles and guardrails defined in CIP-1694 and the Cardano Constitution.\r\n\r\nFor these reasons, SIPO casts a clear YES vote.\r\n\r\n⸻\r\n\r\nSIPOは、この「憲法委員会メンバー追加」提案に YES を投じます。\r\n\r\n今回賛成する理由は、憲法委員会（CC）を最低必要人数の7名に戻し、オンチェーンガバナンスを正常に動かすことが、今のカルダノにとって最優先の課題だと考えているからです。現在、委員の辞任によってCCは6名体制となり、committeeMinSizeを下回ってしまいました。そのため、CCによるラチェットが必要な重要な提案──予算、ネットチェンジリミット、パラメータ変更、憲法関連など──が処理できない状態になっています。\r\n\r\nSIPOとして、カルダノのガバナンスが安定して継続的に機能することは、DRepとして最も大切にしている責任のひとつです。委員辞任のような予期せぬ出来事から速やかに立ち直れるガバナンス体制は、エコシステム全体の信頼性や持続性にとって不可欠です。\r\n\r\n今回の提案は、Intersectが実施したスナップ選挙の結果をオンチェーンで正式に承認するための最終ステップです。この選挙は透明かつ検証可能で、カルダノ憲法およびガードレールに完全に準拠していました。\r\n88名のDRepが参加し、総ステークは31.6億ADAに達しました。その中で、Cardano Curiaは33名のDRepと16.79億ADAの支持を受けて選出されました。コミュニティの民主的な意思を尊重することは、SIPOとしてとても大切だと考えています。\r\n\r\nこの提案が成立すれば、憲法委員会は再び7名体制に戻り、すべてのガバナンスアクションが制限なく進められるようになります。今後のカルダノの発展を考えると、安定した意思決定プロセスが確実に機能することは非常に重要です。\r\n\r\nまた、Cardano Curiaが新たにCCへ加わることは、ガバナンスや憲法設計に関する専門性を委員会にもたらし、意思決定の質や透明性を高める助けになると期待しています。カルダノが今後さらに公共性や国際的な利用を見据えていく中で、多様で優秀なCCメンバーが揃うことは大きな強みです。\r\n\r\nまとめると、SIPOがYESを投じる理由は次のとおりです：\r\n\t1.\tカルダノのガバナンス機能を完全に復旧できること。\r\n\t2.\t透明で民主的なスナップ選挙の結果を尊重すること。\r\n\t3.\tネットワークの制度的安定性と長期的な信頼性が高まること。\r\n\t4.\tCIP-1694およびカルダノ憲法の原則に沿った提案であること。\r\n\r\n以上の理由から、SIPOはこの提案に賛成（YES）を投じます。",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Socious",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmV7UtTHZNeBKnmKsV8F4YdYR25hx1Vet7NmRWePeFNZJS -->\r\n# Socious\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytcv4ax77s0enqef56qjflf4d8zjgxulukme9uf5p8cfaagysjppn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe vote \"YES\" for this GA because it's absolutely necessary to enact new GAs.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "TriangleForces",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmbFF1ZsMxwtdkKPjBkFZHGTUXv9Vq6dYFzwbQW8PHFYrY -->\r\n# TriangleForces\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2y3euudfnw48xeulsfupsttlx8c4xphhaw90d66dvcrazgjdm5uc`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**The chain must survive. **We cannot allow a single resignation to hold the protocol hostage. Ratify the member, restore the quorum, and then let’s **immediately discuss raising the committee size to create a redundancy buffer so this never happens again. Fix the hole in the boat.**",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Varavas",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmeeJu9b4RMdwHHPScpzcEWcVhTzi38xyfS1z4c9vnF4sk -->\r\n# Varavas\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yte3chru8m7d3gzgpwvmgan0gjfxru9r9cyvrkkcerc0wcg6qfvtc`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe Cardano community decided for the new CC member through a fair process.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Yoroi W₳llet",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/YoroiDRep/rationale/refs/heads/main/Vote_New%20Committee.jsonld -->\r\n# Yoroi W₳llet\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygr9tuapcanc3kpeyy4dc3vmrz9cfe5q7v9wj3x9j0ap3tswtre9j`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n\r\nYoroi DRep votes YES to the “Add Constitutional Committee Member” governance action, bringing the Constitutional Committee (CC) back to full strength, allowing Cardano on-chain governance to move forward.\r\n\r\nRationale\r\n\r\nCC back to working capacity\r\nAfter a recent resignation, the committee fell under the minimum size set in protocol. With only six members, the CC cannot approve most governance actions. This vote fixes that gap by restoring the required member count.\r\n\r\nRespecting the snap election outcome\r\n\r\nIntersect ran a snap election to fill the empty seat, and Cardano Curia emerged as the top choice. Yoroi supports recognizing that result on-chain and is confident that the new member can uphold the constitutional role with integrity. \r\n\r\nConclusion\r\n\r\nYoroi DRep votes YES because restoring the CC is urgent for governance continuity, and the chosen member reflects a valid community decision.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Yosh",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQmUodNdPFdiejpM5JUwJZ8pgWM4tdSBiP5v6xGosc7XL -->\r\n# Yosh\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytd7s3he5rgxhkx0t2vnun25wy3t263877czxw8nelcld8ce66v4c`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoted Yes. This governance action is necessary to formally record the results of the audited Ekklesia elections on-chain and seat the remaining Constitutional Committee member.\r\n\r\nUntil all CC seats are filled, the governance system cannot function, and no governance actions can be approved. Passing this GA promptly is essential to restore full operational governance.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "youthpromo",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreifebm3olq7r7wj4kociyjt2zk6apasvdj5ljv3kkaod7hf2aoskfa -->\r\n# youthpromo\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytuvsulm46gydp6cqzdupg6evx49g28qwf3aaw0gr7sy0lqwmvhhy`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nMore brains, more results.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "YUTA",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmU8ieiUyWCbqNoRAaMyYfXAegq2i11g4VLxT2HTa9oYN6 -->\r\n# YUTA\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Add Constitutional Committee Member\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2200we9c904un36tzaearntzzl63snffuul9qsk0te4utqfkke0w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI will vote YES for \"Add Constitutional Committee Member.\"\r\n\r\n1) Not adding a CC would not only make treasury withdrawal impossible, but would also make parameter updates and hard forks more difficult, potentially putting the Cardano chain at risk.\r\n\r\n2) The Cardano Constitution requires that an election be held to add a CC, and one member was elected. No other entity has the resources to hold a similar election. In other words, even if we were to reject the results of this election, it would likely be a waste of time, as I am not currently aware of any entity that would want to hold an alternative election.\r\n\r\n3) The elected Cardano Curia members are experienced members. I had expressed the view that an individual CC would be better than a consortium CC, mainly from the perspective of CC compensation, but I have heard from Cardano Curia members that they will work without compensation. Considering this, my concerns do not apply to Cardano Curia.\r\n\r\n私は、「Add Constitutional Committee Member」にYESを投票します。\r\n\r\n1) CCが追加されないことは単にトレジャリーウィズドローができないだけではなく、パラメータアップデートやハードフォーク開始なども困難となることであり、Cardanoチェーンが危険に晒される可能性があります。\r\n\r\n2) CCの追加には選挙が必要とCardano憲法上要求されており、選挙が実施され、1名が選出されました。同様の選挙を行うリソースをもつエンティティなどはいません。この選挙結果を仮に否定したとしても代替の選挙を行いたいエンティティはいませんので恐らく時間の無駄になるでしょう。\r\n\r\n3) 選出されたCardano Curiaは経験豊富なメンバーです。私は主にCC報酬の観点から、コンソーシアム型CCよりもindivisual型CCが良いのではと表明していましたが、Cardano Curiaはそのメンバーから無報酬で業務を行うと聞きました。この点を考えると、私の懸念もCardano Curiaには当てはまりません。",
      "vote": "YES"
    }
  ],
