      "voter": "Kevin G Mohr",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihk6ye23we3zrledbxvcvskrlttwccyj6ru4hy5lp4t6rbg4six6q -->\n# Kevin G Mohr\n\n**Proposal:** Cardano at TOKEN2049 Singapore 2026 Baseline ‘Platinum' Sponsorship Proposal\n**Vote:** No\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytwn2u7qpy4ur7k3xqd7eehft3g2yjpxf46rugwzmndkyesd0m5nt`\n\n---\n\nNo, fix the ecosystem before you go party.",
