      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreihgihrn4jtciyhhrnpnpbe3hnbh2shcze6y5i35vo76txhwrr65m4 -->\n# Leo of the Brothership\n\n**Proposal:** Cardano at TOKEN2049 Singapore 2026 Baseline ‘Platinum' Sponsorship Proposal\n**Vote:** No\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytw5tvdxpe39l9gm3g49gl0whwd2dgu4mcf5ml5z3zfuk3s8npegv`\n\n---\n\nRetire the YOROI dRep",
