      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmcpB18osNZmCHnptZmrk1whdAW95SvK5Bc6RPcPKeU3pT -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Loan ₳5,000,000 to Expand Cardano's Global Listings\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe vote YES. This is the first time we have seen a proposal to withdraw budget money in the form of a loan. We hope that the parties will do what they have committed to in order to open up a new and quality direction for using the budget.",
