    {
      "voter": "drep1y2s6uvp5lq9dlp6vxydhmcpq4yr68v9sxkyu8agyzmw0kps2t8ugh",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYq6pxdurTuBEV7gjYT4a7td5h2zzwEfKNHKtk51S4AEr -->\r\n# drep1y2s6uvp5lq9dlp6vxydhmcpq4yr68v9sxkyu8agyzmw0kps2t8ugh\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Loan ₳5,000,000 to Expand Cardano's Global Listings\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2s6uvp5lq9dlp6vxydhmcpq4yr68v9sxkyu8agyzmw0kps2t8ugh`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSnek team has proven time again\r\nTo deliver. The first barrier for any Cardano project to get listed on an exchange is to convince exchanges to support Cardano native tokens, once the first token is listed it removes that barrier.",
