      "voter": "Homer J",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdxZzLPN2fzSoXeDkvren5N8nj1pCZipHQ4bBL2DSHyXg -->\r\n# Homer J\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Loan ₳5,000,000 to Expand Cardano's Global Listings\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2rvnp40ea4zsl4hqm0ev4qju205jx7mz57u2vwjzzrf50c24jca9`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nhttps://tenor.com/view/van-damme-snake-punch-gif-12095963",
