      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreif363guoc4fsiyiwldnocipoi5oqzzmyj2vhoejnvse373xkq25hu -->\r\n# Lourde\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Loan ₳5,000,000 to Expand Cardano's Global Listings\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygtvnwgsucstvesms2hv9vc8hw3tye5zhzldmszrxqd2rxsje5c6m`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote yes for this proposal of a Loan based offering to the requesting project. I find value in the interest accrued during the life of the loan and the opportunity it presents for future types of treasury borrowing. ~Lourde~ Ouroborus Imperator Aeternalis",
