    {
      "voter": "Marius Georgescu",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreieikrc6cuvcwjyx2m4mv5qv5qerayn62m7b5ln3am4elmndm5awky -->\n# Marius Georgescu\n\n**Proposal:** Loan ₳5,000,000 to Expand Cardano's Global Listings\n**Vote:** Yes\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfcxs7sxzjd2ls7gjjftqmn58gg2q5fjwdcaznu0jh3uvpgceznnu`\n\n---\n\nI support this loan !",
