      "voter": "Zacros",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiabfxfmoetdpwcuqavudovjjpl7rdwysdgstzrvxqn2brz72wav4m -->\r\n# Zacros\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Loan ₳5,000,000 to Expand Cardano's Global Listings\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2tp9q9vckglgkgkgcdc33jtahrstfzfj3c8ez926ysszjqp5r4ts`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs the info action.\r\nNoted",
