    {
      "voter": "ada_ddy",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreianoqftnjfbjrfs3b57e6yqjpnswmuu6fkgdwj6epipfsykq2uxda -->\n# ada_ddy\n\n**Proposal:** Revised Cardano Summit 2026 Singapore\n**Vote:** Yes\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yghx9vl2f4kwrdgz7s4vpn2zcyxvsrws23hfhyatj35v7ls69he2u`\n\n---\n\nWith cut costs, this is good. Would have liked it lower. But this is presence and there's already a great deal of work that went into this. Hopeful to see the outcome and for next year to have a more sustainable ask.",
