    {
      "voter": "ADAR_Chris",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYyU2V9czSsnx7vvtZwrJaQV8ZiYNbbPQSJmPBXQmdsRJ -->\r\n# ADAR_Chris\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Revised Cardano Summit 2026 Singapore\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y26nj0u86z00s2c6yteecduedrzxxrxrn39th5mau0h0r5gszp025`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI don't understand why a genesis FE with given mandate requires a Treasury withdrawal to deliver said mandate. The earnings on that genesis $ADA don't fund anything? How is the CF not able to deliver the most basic of functions in a more sustainable fashion?",
