      "voter": "CardaFlow",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmRJ3vuat1smnqFiPBy4ynq2nzr58FwieGTcQy6aBAktXK -->\r\n# CardaFlow\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Amaru Treasury Withdrawal 2026\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y279cte2lujj9lde4lmz07wsku5fvra69htrleyx9ahr60cn42uaa`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nTrusted partner, skilled team, valuable proposal, well documented and detailed\r\nNo brainer",
