    {
      "voter": "Cardano Feed",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreidgny3ccuyz3fxtmqxzyrt7ltgdtfmecuw746ou4wdd6leklfn74u -->\r\n# Cardano Feed\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Amaru Treasury Withdrawal 2026\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftjewhpvtdd8t7swtmtp44px94ns3laytmjc3u7f93qvhswmwv5f`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVote: YES.\r\nThis proposal supports innovation and client diversity, both important for the long-term resilience of the Cardano protocol and our blockchain ecosystem.",
      "vote": "YES"
