      "voter": "Cerkoryn",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Cerkoryn/governance-reference/refs/heads/main/voting-history/info/TreasuryWithdrawal_6.jsonld -->\r\n# Cerkoryn\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Amaru Treasury Withdrawal 2026\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yglrf4el8gghum239fggvfrau25k2576y4dvcz65r2ukj8sqpsc2k`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCracked team. Modest ask. Enormous value. Zero drama. Easy YES.",
