      "voter": "Latam Cardano",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmf5HhJ2bRMcfb1hynsnh7gyJYW8jaezMx1HXUVZ8cWe9Q -->\r\n# Latam Cardano\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Amaru Treasury Withdrawal 2026\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytgsdkfznvjnwdxrzvf8x6tn4ctfukqqphsammzkfwatgsqgnpf2w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe continue to support Amaru's initiative due to the professionalism, clarity and execution proven.",
