      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYQAzEdu78oruxjPjKLjLNHmTVzyCUgZ3h56EywYSJpdq -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳314,800 for PyCardano administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting Yes. PyCardano is a leading Python library for interacting with Cardano. This proposal funds maintenance, protocol updates, and bug fixes to ensure it remains stable and functional.",
