      "voter": "EMURGO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EMGDRep/rationale/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context_PyCardano.jsonld -->\r\n# EMURGO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳314,800 for PyCardano administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytvlwvyjmzfyn56n0zz4f6lj94wxhmsl5zky6knnzrf4jygpyahug`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\nEMURGO as DRep votes YES on the governance action to fund PyCardano.\r\n\r\nRationale\r\nPyCardano plays a foundational role in supporting Python developers building on Cardano, an essential step in broadening the ecosystem's reach beyond Haskell and JavaScript. With over 170 open source projects and 9,000+ monthly downloads, its community adoption is clear.\r\n\r\nThis proposal ensures PyCardano remains compatible with key upgrades such as Leios and Midnight. While the cost reflects a solo senior engineer, EMURGO sees value in sustaining a critical tool already integrated into Cardano DeFi, education, and infrastructure projects and decides to vote YES.",
      "vote": "YES"
