      "voter": "No stress",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYvVkZone1ba3JGSUYMwjHYQPvtzHH4Au27p7CN7YxRsa -->\r\n# No stress\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳578,571 for Gerolamo - Cardano node in typescript\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2t3t35yx7j8nnh3wkqn2zzhgwqksksn85zv62pjrwzjawczwgyv7`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis will help us move toward light weight client and further supports node diversity. Typescript has grown to be incredibly popular from a dev perspective so this helps us target more developers and make low-lift tooling for devs who dont want to roll with haskell and dbsync.",
