      "voter": "Terminada",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminadaDrep/vote-contexts/refs/heads/main/20250727/001.jsonld -->\r\n# Terminada\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳578,571 for Gerolamo - Cardano node in typescript\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytf9f78k7rkwk4cu6l2nvna22keu9yus4kqzc0hqspd36uszu0xc2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nConcern about feasibility and ability to deliver.  Project specifications are sparse.  Project Catalyst would be a better funding mechanism.",
