      "voter": "Daehan_kor",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmUAFeFDGATwB2hu1VV3Wti8rBhSmsV1F8qiyt5CAZYhLC -->\r\n# Daehan_kor\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳657,692 for Scalus - DApps Development Platform\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y28uwdrz2acyp4jka5fqp2fa3hp0klpme8wug3f5p2y45zsc0e8qw`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBeing able to utilize scala.js on the front end has value. Approving it.",
