    {
      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmU9MSZBCfWTDk7gccJAwuZbK2bK5akTFFcUDUhz3V7biB -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳657,692 for Scalus - DApps Development Platform\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmQHgFo5vPNdZVHrvPu5UX3BKf4Qz3NB2v7BvQyxfKVGj8\r\n\r\nOnboarding developers is critical, and Scalus provides a vital bridge to the massive pool of Scala/Java talent, directly supporting ecosystem **growth and sustainability**.\r\n\r\nCreating a diverse set of high-quality development tools is also a direct win for **decentralization**, preventing over-reliance on a single framework.",
