    {
      "voter": "DeepStatecraft",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdT65eabUuLzCi5f5UNs23N8YdzR8EZ39Ut63V8QCAY81 -->\r\n# DeepStatecraft\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳657,692 for Scalus - DApps Development Platform\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfr0cur4guksjd6whxe5mltcaksqqhzd85dnq6lfk8ex7qs5mlcye`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n✅ Voted YES on Scalus – Cardano DApp Development in Scala 3\r\n\r\n🛠️ Why I support it:\r\n• Lowers the barrier for developers by using Scala — a modern, safe, and powerful language\r\n• Enables end-to-end DApp development (contracts, transactions, apps) all in one toolchain\r\n• Unlocks access to a deep talent pool of Scala/Java/Kotlin developers\r\n• Fast-tracks Cardano’s readiness for Web2 firms and fintech adoption\r\n• Built by Oleksandr Nemish, former IOG engineer and Marlowe contributor\r\n\r\nScalus brings professional-grade tools, dev ergonomics, and a rich ecosystem to Cardano — paving the way for faster, safer, and more scalable DApp development.\r\n\r\nTrack all my votes 👉 https://tempo.vote/drep-profile\r\nDRep: DeepStatecraft",
