      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdPNDAep3g1bV9K8Ua31Gssik8fMz7rehfvUE3N37g8CN -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳6,000,000 for Unveiling the First Unified Global Events Marketing S\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe vote yes because Cardano still needs a campaign large enough to make an impact on a global scale. The Cardano Foundation is the right organization to run this marketing campaign.",
