    {
      "voter": "CardaFlow",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQho67qn3wRQZUw6DgUxzimHZqEsZEBTeJCEFJtthZc3d -->\r\n# CardaFlow\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳6,000,000 for Unveiling the First Unified Global Events Marketing S\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y279cte2lujj9lde4lmz07wsku5fvra69htrleyx9ahr60cn42uaa`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nInline with previous Ekklesia's temp check",
