      "voter": "EMURGO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EMGDRep/rationale/refs/heads/main/Vote_Context%20Unified%20Global%20Events%20.jsonld -->\r\n# EMURGO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳6,000,000 for Unveiling the First Unified Global Events Marketing S\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytvlwvyjmzfyn56n0zz4f6lj94wxhmsl5zky6knnzrf4jygpyahug`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\nEMURGO as DRep votes YES on the governance action to fund the Unveiling the First Unified Global Events Marketing Strategy for Cardano proposal based on the rationale below.\r\n\r\nRationale\r\nA cohesive global events and marketing strategy is essential to elevate Cardano’s visibility on the international stage. Competing ecosystems have made significant gains through consistent branding and developer outreach via flagship events.\r\n\r\nThis proposal as a standalone or as complementary of the other similar proposals offers a focused approach to positioning Cardano as a serious Layer 1 contender by aligning messaging, strengthening branding, and creating touchpoints across developer, enterprise, and policymaker communities. Given the scale of the opportunity and the need to reduce brand fragmentation, we proudly support this initiative and vote yes.",
      "vote": "YES"
