    {
      "voter": "Florian Volery",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmNZG6aPDKk3nUyYfu7Nhf7QD6vwTev9ZskGvqQT2f569h -->\r\n# Florian Volery\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳6,000,000 for Unveiling the First Unified Global Events Marketing S\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yguh6dsgx0g58v8pqmxgfrkq0x8vfv6tcp92uzzjrykwy8cjmelsy`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThere is an urgent need for clear, well-crafted materials that highlight Cardano’s capabilities—such as a comprehensive marketing booklet and regular webinars. Beyond that, we need a dedicated \"salesforce\" able to engage directly with enterprises and communicate Cardano’s value effectively. The current spray-and-pray approach is not delivering meaningful results.\r\n\r\nI'm open to collaborating on shaping a more strategic and targeted plan. However, allocating 6M ADA for broad event spending, without a focused execution strategy, does not align with Cardano’s current priorities.\r\n\r\nCardano’s strength lies in its Champions. Marketing efforts should center around them, and the ecosystem should actively support and develop more of these visible leaders.\r\n\r\nFor these reasons, I am voting NO on this proposal.",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
    {
      "voter": "GAIA",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmTFmL4YnV4zHiiMjAZmBDNhbiqppNx6KRTTjSyQnvPzqo -->\r\n# GAIA\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳6,000,000 for Unveiling the First Unified Global Events Marketing S\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytxr0lhg5j72wysva9ac2gsn4lck4gyen8ywxkqfchsqg3qs8uy44`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis proposal falls into the realm of a service the Cardano Foundation should be paying for themselves instead of requesting community ADA funding.\r\n\r\nThe CF should be willing to use their genesis ADA for contributing to the growth of Cardano, like funding global marketing for Cardano. \r\n\r\nThis is a responsibility the CF has been sorely lacking in, and I am disappointed but not surprised to see the CF asking for a handout to do this work they should already be doing.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Ha-Nguyen",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmfX3rw2k6Tb3m3SKZ7e129DwryZggzrCyWJt97WtGLStx -->\r\n# Ha-Nguyen\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳6,000,000 for Unveiling the First Unified Global Events Marketing S\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2z8gktqj27kwmmxesd0y484f7p4z9tjf5xu8m4sucstm3gvtywlp`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support the ₳6,000,000 withdrawal for the global events strategy because:\r\n\r\n* It’s crucial to boost Cardano's brand visibility at international events, keeping pace with ecosystems like Solana.\r\n* It unifies fragmented efforts under a coordinated Cardano-branded strategy.\r\n* The project is led by trusted entities: Cardano Foundation, Emurgo, and Rare Network.\r\n* Milestones, legal contracts, and independent oversight ensure transparency and accountability.\r\n* It aligns with Cardano’s long-term vision to grow its global builder and partner community.\r\n\r\nThis initiative is a strategic investment in Cardano’s real-world adoption.\r\n\r\n---------------------------------\r\nVietnames\r\n---------------------------------\r\nTôi ủng hộ rút ₳6,000,000 cho chiến lược sự kiện toàn cầu vì:\r\n\r\n* Cần thiết nâng cao nhận diện Cardano tại các hội nghị quốc tế, cạnh tranh với các hệ khác như Solana.\r\n* Tạo thương hiệu sự kiện thống nhất, thay vì rời rạc như hiện nay.\r\n* Thực hiện bởi các bên uy tín: Cardano Foundation, Emurgo và Rare Network.\r\n* Có hợp đồng, milestone rõ ràng, minh bạch on-chain và giám sát độc lập.\r\n* Phù hợp với chiến lược dài hạn để mở rộng cộng đồng và thu hút builder.\r\n\r\nTôi tin rằng sáng kiến này sẽ thúc đẩy tăng trưởng thực chất cho hệ sinh thái Cardano.\r\n---------------------------------\r\nJapanese\r\n---------------------------------\r\nこの ₳6,000,000 の資金提案に賛成する理由は以下のとおりです：\r\n\r\n* Solanaのようなエコシステムと競うため、Cardanoブランドの認知度向上が国際イベントで重要です。\r\n* 分散的な取り組みを統一し、Cardano公式ブランドの戦略として実行されます。\r\n* 信頼できる団体（Cardano Foundation、Emurgo、Rare Network）が主導しています。\r\n* 法的契約とマイルストーン、第三者による監査があり、透明性が確保されます。\r\n* 開発者・パートナー拡大のための長期戦略に合致しています。\r\n\r\nこの提案はCardanoエコシステムの成長に向けた戦略的投資です。",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
