      "voter": "William Doyle",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiavv4apocoxujdb47nsgjqi5nk4ds4crzaupvcw5rz4bam5wfh3pq -->\r\n# William Doyle\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳6,000,000 for Unveiling the First Unified Global Events Marketing S\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfpgzfymq6tt9c684e7vzata8r5pl4w84fmrjqeztdqw0sgpzw3nt`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI don't think this is what Cardano needs right now.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
