      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmNSJJA6vrmssMUYGbdSka7vr8FZxc17uSu6xmxL64MpX9 -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳592,780 for Beyond Minimum Viable Governance Iteratively Improvin\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe voted yes because Cardano is in the early stages of on-chain decentralized governance and it is essential to have governance initiatives in place. These initiatives will kick-start ongoing governance optimization, empower the community to proactively monitor and address critical risks, and ensure Cardano remains a leader in decentralized decision-making.",
