      "voter": "DeepStatecraft",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUQJAd7hrDA54bGJbccnoejMrfqzcAceHj7ArzajyF6Pq -->\r\n# DeepStatecraft\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳592,780 for Beyond Minimum Viable Governance Iteratively Improvin\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfr0cur4guksjd6whxe5mltcaksqqhzd85dnq6lfk8ex7qs5mlcye`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n✅ Voted YES on Beyond Minimum Viable Governance: Iteratively Improving on Cardano Voltaire.\r\n\r\n🔍 Why I support it:\r\n• Provides a structured, data-driven way to evaluate Cardano’s governance health\r\n• Publishes a “State of Governance” report and actionable KPIs\r\n• Engages the community through workshops, surveys, and interviews\r\n• Translates insights into CPSs and CIPs for long-term evolution\r\n• Led by IOG’s Voltaire team + a coalition of experienced contributors\r\n\r\nThis is a foundational step toward maturing Cardano’s governance beyond MVG. It’s not just about tools—it’s about understanding what’s working, what’s not, and what’s next.\r\n\r\nTrack all my votes: https://tempo.vote/drep-profile\r\nDRep: DeepStatecraft",
