    {
      "voter": "Patrick_Tobler",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmbmMZK6QXNX9RkohegS6oEtRWTiSkF4wpX6KsJi6DeQMb -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳592,780 for Beyond Minimum Viable Governance Iteratively Improvin\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhile I have a lot of respect for the vendors of this proposal, I'd like to prevent spending more money and energy on governance-focused initiatives like this for now and focus on adoption & applications instead.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
