    {
      "voter": "Peter Bui",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pbwebdev/drep/refs/heads/main/r/25/250812_beyondgov_0fea1e7935a6.jsonld -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳592,780 for Beyond Minimum Viable Governance Iteratively Improvin\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhile the proposal focuses on important governance evolution work, the ₳592,780 request is significant for research, reporting, and workshops without clear evidence of direct measurable gains to the broader ecosystem in the near term. The team is highly capable, and the work aligns with governance reform goals, but the scope and cost could be reduced or phased to validate value before committing this amount. No constitutional tenet is breached, yet given the high spend for exploratory outputs, I will abstain to avoid overcommitting treasury funds without demonstrated return.",
