      "voter": "William Doyle",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreigllene6g5wtg3tgbujrrqvyaysefv4gba5p5bwon7yajjoezyxty -->\r\n# William Doyle\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳592,780 for Beyond Minimum Viable Governance Iteratively Improvin\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfpgzfymq6tt9c684e7vzata8r5pl4w84fmrjqeztdqw0sgpzw3nt`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNo strong opinion. Defaulting to YES",
