    {
      "voter": "CaFi",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWmM3HbyGaYpAX4vC9Yz2iZ9F7bmtTZVDnEDeLJRqu4fH -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳4,000,000 for Expanding Stablecoin Cardano Native Asset Support\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe vote yes because Anzens has made positive progress in developing the USDA stablecoin. Cardano needs a thriving stablecoin to fuel the ecosystem. Bringing USDA to CEXs, NEO banks, OTC exchanges, and other key distributors to expand its reach is extremely important.",
      "vote": "YES"
