      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmbZUGqJghL2s3cNT59399AfvTYGpkDYfoEpcxfVeqz6HB -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳4,000,000 for Expanding Stablecoin Cardano Native Asset Support\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmcBHAFL1RvcCfrbrEXGrrN7iWmBMowPCUNn4SAdA2yJ9w\r\n\r\nI am voting **ABSTAIN**. The proposal's goals for **growth and inclusion** are critical, but the funding model is problematic.\r\n\r\nIt asks the treasury to fund a private company, I would have seriously considered voting YES if a clear pathway for value return was included. As it stands, the model is too one-sided to set as a precedent, forcing me to abstain for the amount in question.",
