      "voter": "Florian Volery",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUhET9VF9ABnoYbEFkKEgF1q2iJwTJTWrZoDrCAoeNvc8 -->\r\n# Florian Volery\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳4,000,000 for Expanding Stablecoin Cardano Native Asset Support\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yguh6dsgx0g58v8pqmxgfrkq0x8vfv6tcp92uzzjrykwy8cjmelsy`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support Anzens and the growth of stablecoins for Cardano. Currently, DeFi markets are in urgent need of more supply and infrastructures is key for expansion. I vote YES.",
