      "voter": "Terminada",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmR2HUsFReyfg9kfe8WBrKPso6FfXSikktkQghh8DgAHSG -->\r\n# Terminada\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳4,000,000 for Expanding Stablecoin Cardano Native Asset Support\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytf9f78k7rkwk4cu6l2nvna22keu9yus4kqzc0hqspd36uszu0xc2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSee discussion on Cardano Forum: https://forum.cardano.org/t/withdraw-4-000-000-for-expanding-stablecoin-cardano-native-asset-support-fiat-ramps-yay-or-nay/147887",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
