      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWaRhnmsdJBvNPVmUrPw4kAmEudsQCoXcwRUcE122Ebm8 -->\r\n# Yoroi W₳llet\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳4,000,000 for Expanding Stablecoin Cardano Native Asset Support\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygr9tuapcanc3kpeyy4dc3vmrz9cfe5q7v9wj3x9j0ap3tswtre9j`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\nYoroi as DRep votes YES on the governance action to fund Expanding Stablecoin / Cardano Native Asset Support / Fiat Ramps.\r\n\r\nRationale\r\n\r\nImproved access to Cardano-native stablecoins: By expanding USDA’s presence on exchanges, OTC desks, and fiat ramps, this proposal directly tackles long-standing gaps in liquidity and accessibility, especially in frontier and emerging markets.\r\n\r\nUnlocking real-world utility: We support the effort to integrate USDA into broader payment networks, including B2B settlements, payroll, and remittances, which align with Cardano’s mission to bridge traditional and decentralized finance.\r\n\r\nConfidence in delivery and milestones: Yoroi is aware of Anzens’ capabilities and experience in global payments infrastructure. With a milestone-based structure and clear deliverables, we are optimistic that the team can execute effectively and with accountability.",
