      "voter": "Daehan_kor",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmNRBkDNtPMDUf4uEUYgDJqURM9KqBpP7wgBvd4Mrq6iCq -->\r\n# Daehan_kor\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳130,903 for Lucid Evolution Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y28uwdrz2acyp4jka5fqp2fa3hp0klpme8wug3f5p2y45zsc0e8qw`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nJS dev tool ecosystem is critical to DApp advancement.",
