    {
      "voter": "Dan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmeqG9ZyTNKs363LZtV9h3kAPTrE5YWfN84fQxbcQCZtEe -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳130,903 for Lucid Evolution Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting Yes to support the ongoing maintenance of Lucid, a critical library for building off-chain Cardano dApps. Keeping it updated ensures developers can build efficiently and remain compatible with network upgrades. Anastasia Labs is actively maintaining Lucid Evolution and is well positioned to continue improving this essential tool for the ecosystem.",
