      "voter": "Kyle Solomon",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adosiawolf/drep-rationale/refs/heads/main/0047 -->\r\n# Kyle Solomon\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳130,903 for Lucid Evolution Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytzshxuma6cwrnlv2ucyclfqw3k4nu4nuudmh2z87j9hncsk9dhy4`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have voted YES on the current proposal to fund Anastasia for Lucid Evolution. Lucid Evolution is an open-source library designed to simplify and enhance the development of off-chain smart contract interactions on Cardano.",
