      "voter": "Medusa DRep",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmYWhviKpvpmMZDkYjAsLt24rXA4MpAcrCo4Qp1dAEuBmu -->\r\n# Medusa DRep\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳130,903 for Lucid Evolution Maintenance administered by Intersect\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg5pzxhp0lu0m7757ww2hke8qhcuqgqt3c2ezphngwytz4gjr6yge`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI'm not sure I’ll end up using this, but competition is always a good thing for the end user in the long run, as it drives progress.",
