      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmQC19tYsQAAzWLf6wvd4cv1ZESSnvqcLtot5WWzSMuTk3 -->\r\n# Dan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano DeFi Liquidity Budget - Withdrawal 1\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfsgx4dqfcxxs0ms533twzs7w0cvw8vq8qwzmjyrp280jfsl8gusv`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting Yes. This is in line with my previous vote on the stablecoin liquidity info action. Even though we now have the critical integrations budget to bring additional stablecoins to Cardano, it is still important to support the growth of our homegrown options.",
