    {
      "voter": "drep1ytyemm3feqw3y7tsct90xt835tre4aewhe97dlcwx5l9lccmjmd4h",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreifgqddgrotvezmsrm6cg4myegxlex3bvuphqafubunsqjwffpz5bi -->\r\n# drep1ytyemm3feqw3y7tsct90xt835tre4aewhe97dlcwx5l9lccmjmd4h\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano DeFi Liquidity Budget - Withdrawal 1\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytyemm3feqw3y7tsct90xt835tre4aewhe97dlcwx5l9lccmjmd4h`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI beleive we have enough foundations in Cardano already.  I beleive we can do without the additional overhead.",
