      "voter": "Kylix",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qma6perM67zGFKXrVupvafBFtyTiBUc4Foi1PKvT9EaGET -->\r\n# Kylix\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano DeFi Liquidity Budget - Withdrawal 1\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytzdvw4eqvkt050ul07jrycxfrgyqcqvzsclgwx9v6wmm7qx2gf50`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs much as I have my concerns, which I previously expressed during the info action vote, I support the Cardano DeFi liquidity budget under the terms described in the info action. I have no say on constitutionality of the proposal as I do not serve on the CC and therefor as much as I both acknowledge and agree with the concerns brought up by both CC members who've voted on this proposal (Tingvard and Cardano Japan Council), they do not influence my opinion on whether this proposal should pass or not (from the perspective of an independent DRep not serving on the CC).",
