      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWYx9PDWNWSbkWPaKorX39gns5MGmsKo1gMieD43rrWPw -->\r\n# Peter Bui\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano DeFi Liquidity Budget - Withdrawal 1\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yftc8zs7gjcj4a9nxzplz4wg6cwweya0kxp8adnw59vsyrqvrysud`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nVoting yes on this one, although the price of ADA at the moment is well below where we thought it would be. Taking it and deploying now could be detrimental to the provisiong but the team knows this. There is more to the process than just deploying to protocols. Please use the funds wisely at this point in time.",
