      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmNh5WPDzKPsZ9WLVE14gYcdwMrb4WjpjSHEg9ovCu49VX -->\r\n# Phil UPLC\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Defi Liquidity Budget - Withdrawal 1\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg343cyuckglj48a6gpcey7fkfcy5x5f9g65wme3ne9q2mgaedmkm`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmbLeWukpj8CpfxD5R7bWDT7Geq7dKchK5NkoyZMeX2rPV\r\n\r\nI believe PoL is less capital efficient than subsidizing yield if the goal is to increase stablecoin liquidity on Cardano, however, PoL serves a secondary purpose of diversifying the treasury which I believe is the primary value proposition here.",
