      "voter": "Rudianos",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiemmk7utigbwetxsvbo2ixkcwgs7o5ttyevhwmkifychagio6gsbe -->\n# Rudianos\n\n**Proposal:** Cardano Defi Liquidity Budget - Withdrawal 1\n**Vote:** Yes\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfv77z2fsz7nucy59lx2pkafamathf8q783lalkr3quju0gv93lq2`\n\n---\n\nI am in favor of this treasury withdrawal request. I have already voted in favor of the budget info action and gave my rationale for that on the info action vote metadata. This action is about ensuring that the team is handling the funds in a responsible way, and I believe that they are. I am satisfied with the proposed process that this well known and respected team is putting forward to handle the funds. There is some risk involved but I am also satisfied that the plan proposed mitigates the risk as much as is reasonable to expect.",
