      "voter": "Cerkoryn",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYuTHerEMyjWm5Njhd2iNt71isvjZeyGXkQ7c6SCMVM8A -->\r\n# Cerkoryn\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳605,000 for A free Native Asset CDN for Cardano Developers\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yglrf4el8gghum239fggvfrau25k2576y4dvcz65r2ukj8sqpsc2k`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nInteresting idea, but may be better suited for requesting funds through Catalyst or Cardano Builder's DAO.",
