      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmNPPGTdj9TEmZFPiJUXBMLy6txr1yJfeSe7UJ82YFQdtn -->\r\n# Ha-Nguyen\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳605,000 for A free Native Asset CDN for Cardano Developers\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2z8gktqj27kwmmxesd0y484f7p4z9tjf5xu8m4sucstm3gvtywlp`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI initially voted NO on this proposal due to concerns around clarity of impact and value to the broader ecosystem. However, after further review of its cost-benefit model, strong ROI (17x), and its role in lowering infrastructure barriers for builders, I’ve decided to change my vote to YES.",
