      "voter": "Patrick_Tobler",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWtXTzsF2H4Er2NwPyskz6zcZ9n9W1u1vAKMPy8XHyP8T -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳605,000 for A free Native Asset CDN for Cardano Developers\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhile this is a good proposal, I know very few projects are currently using the CDN so I don't think this is worth getting funded at this point in time. I hope this will change in the future.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
