    {
      "voter": "RCADA",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmbf55Eb3C91cjVac9svc1pAgLspegCzZHpDSLp1yfEX36 -->\r\n# RCADA\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳605,000 for A free Native Asset CDN for Cardano Developers\r\n**Vote:** Abstain\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yf7kjx5rlyuyzxkr4dzyccdfs8tesh29amrtcpyplu3asnqjgmdz3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nRCADA has chosen to **abstain at this time while reserving the option to review and update this vote prior to the voting deadline**. This approach allows RCADA to allocate focus where immediate evaluation is most impactful, particularly on proposals that are close to threshold or raise significant procedural or constitutional concerns. If this proposal reaches the approv-al threshold prior to our review, the abstention will stand as a neutral signal of deferral, not op-position. Should further analysis be warranted, RCADA will update this vote accordingly.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "Rudianos",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmb9PFz8JoRogdyaCMaQghhtJAHvH8DMhhhaffhg65djve -->\r\n# Rudianos\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳605,000 for A free Native Asset CDN for Cardano Developers\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfv77z2fsz7nucy59lx2pkafamathf8q783lalkr3quju0gv93lq2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting in favor of approving the treasury withdrawal for all 39 withdrawal actions that are part of the approved ecosystem budget administered by Intersect. I am voting this way for several reasons, as I will outline here. This rationale will be included in all 39 withdrawal votes.\r\nFirst and foremost, I believe that we would be making a mistake in underfunding our community with our available treasury funds. The budget system as it currently stands has some flaws, as should be expected from a first version of any system. Of the current proposals, I voted to include several in the budget when it was being formed; however, I also did not vote in favor of several others. This is, of course, the case for most DReps. If I were to vote only for the proposals I initially favoured, and all other DReps did the same, we would likely approve only 2 or 3 proposals out of 39 due to the vote split. In my view, this is not an acceptable outcome for the community, and this is why I was also opposed to the idea of having 39 separate treasury withdrawal actions. I have reviewed all 39 requests, and they all have merit. Are they exactly in line with the priorities I wanted as part of the initial budget? No. Is that reason enough to vote no on several of these and end up approving only 2 or 3 proposals in the end? I certainly don't believe so.\r\nIn addition to this, the total amount of the intersect budget is roughly 10% higher than what I voted for, and I find that to be within an acceptable margin to approve all the withdrawals.\r\nThe individual proposals also all received at least 50% community approval to be included and will be subject to reviews and milestones to receive funds.\r\nFor these reasons, I am casting my vote to approve and am wishing the best of luck to all the teams waiting for funding through this process.",
      "vote": "NO"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SASA_nagamaru_ながまる",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmah3nsbg4Fv7u1WGm9fZFkYhwoQtNwNVRYJkRBb94EUKb -->\r\n# SASA_nagamaru_ながまる\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳605,000 for A free Native Asset CDN for Cardano Developers\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytuddrgqca0xd4aams6pl9zndpcmxg0rs7z3mggjelm6kscp4arg5`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote Yes on this proposal.\r\nA lightweight and high-performance content delivery system like NFTCDN is critical for expanding the use of native assets on Cardano.\r\nOffering an already operational service for free over 18 months will lower the barrier for developers and meaningfully support ecosystem growth.\r\n\r\n私はこの提案に Yes を投じます。\r\nCardanoネイティブアセットの利用拡大において、NFTCDNのような軽量かつ高速な配信基盤は重要です。\r\n既に安定稼働しているサービスを18ヶ月無償提供することで、開発者のUXを高め、エコシステム全体の活性化に貢献すると判断しました。",
      "vote": "YES"
    },
    {
      "voter": "SIPO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://sipo.tokyo/drep/ga/GA_TreasuryWithdrawal2025_01/21_NativeAssetCDN_20250721/Vote_Context.jsonld -->\r\n# SIPO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳605,000 for A free Native Asset CDN for Cardano Developers\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yffld2866p00cyg3ejjdewtvazgah7jjgk0s9m7m5ytmmdq33v3zh`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSIPO supports the proposal “A free Native Asset CDN for Cardano Developers” and votes YES.\r\n\r\nSIPO believes that this proposal directly addresses one of the most critical technical and economic challenges in the Cardano ecosystem: the display and delivery of native asset media (NFTs & FTs) in decentralized applications.\r\n\r\n1. Strategic Value for Developer Experience\r\n\r\nCardano’s roadmap emphasizes improving developer usability and reducing time-to-market. NFTCDN, by making its infrastructure freely available to all Cardano developers for 18 months, significantly lowers both the financial (OPEX/CAPEX) and technical barriers associated with native asset integration. This enables startups, open-source teams, and smaller builders to experiment and innovate without worrying about costly infrastructure burdens.\r\n\r\n2. Cost Savings and High ROI for the Ecosystem\r\n\r\nThe proposal outlines a clear, data-backed ROI of over 17x, with $5.5M in estimated ecosystem-wide cost savings and 39,000 developer hours conserved. These savings translate into:\r\n\t•\tAvoiding ~$100K per project in infra cost\r\n\t•\tSpeeding up product launches by 9+ months\r\n\t•\tAvoiding $3M+ in ongoing operational costs for 25 projects\r\n\r\nThe ₳605,000 (~$320K) ask is thus highly justified against these tangible benefits.\r\n\r\n3. Proven Track Record and Reliability\r\n\r\nNFTCDN has been operating since 2022, serving over 800 million API requests with 100% uptime. It already supports flagship Cardano dApps such as Eternl, NMKR, Pool.pm, and NEWM. Making this infrastructure available for free will accelerate adoption across dozens more projects.\r\n\r\n4. Technical Maturity and Unique Value Proposition\r\n\r\nUnlike generic CDN providers like Cloudflare, NFTCDN is purpose-built for Cardano and supports:\r\n\t•\tDirect access via asset fingerprint\r\n\t•\tAutomatic handling of metadata formats (CIP-25, CIP-68)\r\n\t•\tReal-time chain indexing\r\n\t•\tIntegration with IPFS, Arweave, and on-chain content\r\n\t•\tCross-app caching and rendering safety\r\n\r\nThese features make it not just a CDN, but a high-level backend abstraction for any native asset-based Cardano app.\r\n\r\n5. Alignment with Cardano 2025 Goals\r\n\r\nThis proposal directly supports Cardano’s 2025 ecosystem goals such as:\r\n\t•\t“Get More Usage”: By removing barriers to DApp development\r\n\t•\t“Developer/User Experience”: By abstracting complexity and increasing accessibility\r\n\t•\tFostering innovation across RWA, SSI, media, and educational use cases\r\n\r\n6. Robust Governance and Oversight\r\n\r\nThe proposal is administered via Intersect under the approved ₳275M budget process, and backed by a legal contract, milestone tracking, and third-party assurance. These measures ensure delivery, accountability, and transparency.\r\n\r\n⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻\r\n\r\nSIPOは、「Cardano開発者のための無償ネイティブアセットCDN」提案に賛成し、「Yes」票を投じます。\r\n\r\nこの提案は、Cardanoにおけるネイティブアセット（NFT・FT）活用の最大の障壁である「表示・配信インフラ」の技術的・経済的負担を解消する極めて実用的かつ効果的なソリューションです。\r\n\r\n1. 開発者体験の飛躍的向上\r\n\r\nCardanoが掲げる「開発容易性向上」や「製品化までの迅速化」といった2025年の戦略目標において、NFTCDNの無償開放は極めて大きな貢献を果たします。インフラ構築に伴う初期投資や複雑なバックエンド処理が不要となり、個人開発者やスタートアップも気軽にネイティブアセットを活用したアプリ開発に取り組めるようになります。\r\n\r\n2. ROI17倍超、エコシステム全体に約5.5億円相当のコスト削減効果\r\n\t•\t1プロダクトあたり約1000万円の開発コスト回避\r\n\t•\t約9ヶ月の開発短縮\r\n\t•\t運用・保守費（最大3億円相当）も削減\r\n\t•\t総開発工数の削減は39,000時間に相当\r\n\r\n提案金額（₳605,000＝約3200万円相当）は、これらの経済的インパクトを踏まえると極めて妥当であり、費用対効果が明確です。\r\n\r\n3. 実績と信頼性の高さ\r\n\r\nNFTCDNはすでにVerspr、Eternl、NMKR、Pool.pmなど複数の主要dAppに導入済みであり、2022年から100%稼働を継続し、累計8億回以上のAPIリクエストに対応しています。この安定した実績は、提案の信頼性を裏付けています。\r\n\r\n4. Cardano特化型の高機能CDNであること\r\n\r\n一般的なCDNと異なり、NFTCDNは以下の機能を標準装備しています：\r\n\t•\t指紋IDによる直接アクセス\r\n\t•\tCIP-25、CIP-68対応のメタデータ処理\r\n\t•\tIPFS/Arweave/オンチェーンの自動フェッチ\r\n\t•\tネイティブアセットのリアルタイム監視\r\n\t•\tマルチdApp間キャッシュ共有\r\n\t•\tコンテンツの安全性管理（CSP制御）\r\n\r\nこれにより、各dAppが個別に複雑なミドルウェアやバックエンドを構築する必要がなくなり、開発が大幅に効率化されます。\r\n\r\n5. Cardano 2025ロードマップとの整合性\r\n\r\n本提案は、「より多くのユースケース創出」や「開発者・ユーザー体験の改善」といったCardanoの戦略的重点項目に合致しており、ネイティブアセットの利用をさらに加速させる土台となります。\r\n\r\n6. ガバナンスの透明性と契約管理体制の整備\r\n\r\nIntersectによる予算執行、サードパーティ保証人による進捗確認、Sundae Labsが開発したスマートコントラクトによる支出管理など、信頼性ある運用体制が整っており、資金の適正利用と成果達成が担保されています。\r\n\r\n\r\nConclusion｜結論\r\n\r\nSIPOは、本提案が「Cardano上でネイティブアセットを活用した開発の大衆化と飛躍的なスケーラビリティ向上」に貢献するものであると確信しており、その投資対効果、社会的インパクト、開発者支援の観点からも明確な価値を認め、「Yes」を投じます。",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
