      "voter": "Terminada",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminadaDrep/vote-contexts/refs/heads/main/20250725/008.jsonld -->\r\n# Terminada\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳605,000 for A free Native Asset CDN for Cardano Developers\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytf9f78k7rkwk4cu6l2nvna22keu9yus4kqzc0hqspd36uszu0xc2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nnftcdn.io is not a decentralised solution for content delivery.",
