      "voter": "This Corrosion",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmP3dUV5BL71sTDFYAgS6K6eUq3dDEBTShoCoyrmXMMN53 -->\r\n# This Corrosion\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳605,000 for A free Native Asset CDN for Cardano Developers\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytkzpmmukjy6qn6xd5skqm0ypcj5juw9rxddr5mmlzgjvtcghwqjr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI have become convinced this product is mor in demand for tooling than I initially thought. I will therefore support it.",
