    {
      "voter": "phillerino",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmcdGYjN3CcyPcK3NSM7X8JDC7aXeeiBd9MTPo99Gqj4gd -->\n# phillerino\n\n**Proposal:** IO Consensus Initiative\n**Vote:** Yes\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytu64qt7send5dw7wcd0z5geh4ka6qstgvtgval097hed7qqnqh2n`\n\n---\n\nLeios yes.",
