      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmVr4MVbdCCGTyw8Mt9R8bBnmG14qegdfG7duJytmXeQXH -->\r\n# Shawn McMurdo - SQUID\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** IO Consensus Initiative\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yt99uyp9c8qura9spfgqe8uf7g2avmqc683x28zcugh0sycjd6wp0`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmSK9Pkih8Pygsrq41uGeA36EjFgrLJrugbULD1VtgZV36\r\n\r\nyes",
