    {
      "voter": "Agora Cardano (by Rodrigo Pacini)",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmaVwjLEVXJBZRqNXKsLvfJqzPfdRURBY9FR7qB1AuwNUo -->\r\n# Agora Cardano (by Rodrigo Pacini)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** 2025 Net Change Limit Extension\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yt9dq806jcm56wzhnv2yrf6gcyq7h4gap8gxewfykk0dtfs7vf843`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n[EN]  approve the 2025 NCL extension as it keeps the 350M ADA spending cap unchanged. It's just a minor 8-epoch time shift to fit open governance actions and prevent disruptions—given the CC seat reelection and recess period. Not extending could lead to greater downsides.\r\n\r\n[PT]Aprovo a extensão do NCL 2025, pois mantém o teto de 350M ADA intacto. É apenas um ajuste temporal de 8 epochs para alinhar ações de governança abertas, evitando disrupções – especialmente com a reeleição de um assento no CC e o recesso atual. Não estender traria mais riscos.",
