      "voter": "Blockjock (James Meidinger)",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYAJrpU9p2cUUFZLnggPYpW7gyeR9FWjG2BGfFmUiydgA -->\r\n# Blockjock (James Meidinger)\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** 2025 Net Change Limit Extension\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygnypzfv2v8fmfelthahvn0rqyh54sf6z2aa5m7f3fkjgqqt8l2qq`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nw/o this extension the Critical infrastructure proposal will not get ratified in time, it does not ask for a increase in cap but only a extension of time. The one issue that needs to be resolved is the CC vote, if a new CC member is not in place by a specific time the critical infra along with this extension will be moot till next year",
