      "voter": "BTBF_XSP",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmbtfzy3bTETDh9GNQDGPbM6kTWtdugiV6vsZEDJHqxfKy -->\r\n# BTBF_XSP\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** 2025 Net Change Limit Extension\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2vyrqh0fa4qh4tmy7322va6ryk78uh6szppezaft0watyqp5hdwx`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support this NCL extension for the advancement of Cardano.",
