      "voter": "Rbaker2024",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreieyw2xmsa3plywavf4v62gdhmra6myct33nljohxbsrclm4mxjqjm -->\r\n# Rbaker2024\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** 2025 Net Change Limit Extension\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg7k2kqw0ghh5r3auvazthsrh20x74mcecfyt997za679pqxchhlr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe need to ensure solid and accurate reporting and vote in the governance process.",
