    {
      "voter": "YUTA",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUvJwJWaLRmDwvMZVfD5FTWD5oBA95tgqc8yzbW4dxftJ -->\r\n# YUTA\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** 2025 Net Change Limit Extension\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2200we9c904un36tzaearntzzl63snffuul9qsk0te4utqfkke0w`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am voting YES for the \"2025 Net Change Limit Extension\" for two reasons:\r\n\r\n1) Given the overwhelming approval rate for the current \"Cardano Critical Integrations Budget,\" extending the NCL a little will help the ecosystem. It may also have the effect of easing some of the time pressure on DRep and CC decisions.\r\n\r\n2) This does not change the already approved NCL amount, but merely extends its period, so I do not believe it will lead to a relaxation of financial discipline.\r\n\r\n次の二点の理由により、「2025 Net Change Limit Extension」にYESを投票します。\r\n\r\n1) 現在の「Cardano Critical Integrations Budget」への圧倒的賛成率を考慮すると、NCLを少し延長することはエコシステムを助けることになるでしょう。DRepやCCの判断へのタイムプレッシャーを多少緩和する効果もあるかもしれません。\r\n2) これは、すでに承認済みのNCL金額の変更はなく、その期間の延長ですので、財務規律が緩むと思いません。",
      "vote": "YES"
    }
  ],
  "Withdraw ₳96,817,080 for 2025 Input Output Engineering Core Development Proposal": [
