      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUWh16KhSVejVUjTt9pfYLKUidrqLpadQC5QENS1kQf8X -->\r\n# Cardano Cypherpunks\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳96,817,080 for 2025 Input Output Engineering Core Development Proposal\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23wk4w6f2aumc92vl9m3x74xzm6jh4ha9wdq09yfq2sl6q8zlv4l`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support core tooling and protocol development",
