    {
      "voter": "Cerkoryn",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmWhdX2fnVSjzghfxgMjxED4aQ26iLWbJ9iXex1zFVyQ44 -->\r\n# Cerkoryn\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳96,817,080 for 2025 Input Output Engineering Core Development Proposal\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yglrf4el8gghum239fggvfrau25k2576y4dvcz65r2ukj8sqpsc2k`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nMandatory maintenance and roadmap engineering work.",
