    {
      "voter": "Daehan_kor",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmcnMjjyUCgXQw87S9nEH4mqHg4xMwzdtvZ42qNfkpcFqk -->\r\n# Daehan_kor\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳96,817,080 for 2025 Input Output Engineering Core Development Proposal\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y28uwdrz2acyp4jka5fqp2fa3hp0klpme8wug3f5p2y45zsc0e8qw`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe need to accelerate Leios development more than ever.",
