      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DRepVoiceOfThePeople/VOP_Repo/refs/heads/main/VC20250718IOEngineeringCoreDevelopment.jsonld -->\r\n# Voice of the People\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳96,817,080 for 2025 Input Output Engineering Core Development Proposal\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2ecrj7jd9alaxumvm49hgng9rp239nda5ucegd05ndvxfqftwr9f`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis ones drives critical scalability (Leios, Hydra), dApp security (Plutus tools), and node efficiency. It but need budget clarity and prioritization to mitigate execution risks, but it's important to fund reliable and trustful developers.",
