      "voter": "Yoroi W₳llet",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmeykvg6HGdAEZaTDr7pPdHJLZaaQ1eF7S25CiRi9SsazY -->\r\n# Yoroi W₳llet\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳96,817,080 for 2025 Input Output Engineering Core Development Proposal\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygr9tuapcanc3kpeyy4dc3vmrz9cfe5q7v9wj3x9j0ap3tswtre9j`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\nYoroi votes YES on the governance action to fund the 2025 Input Output Engineering Core Development Proposal.\r\n\r\nRationale\r\n• This proposal is a strategic investment that strengthens Cardano's foundation through protocol upgrades like Leios and L2 scaling (Hydra, Mithril)\r\n• Delivers tangible improvements for users, SPOs, and developers: including better performance, lower RAM costs, and tooling for secure smart contracts\r\n• Reinforces Cardano’s decentralization goals via modular node architecture and increased contributor diversity\r\n• Aligns with the Product Roadmap and has been reviewed by the Technical Steering Committee\r\n• Strong implementation team with a proven history and well-defined plan for knowledge sharing and ecosystem support\r\n\r\nYoroi supports this proposal for its broad ecosystem impact and clear path to scalable growth.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
