      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmUaRHPJ1Y3K7bR2P8dJ7M7QAB4CsTjiSwPh9HU6KztRY9 -->\r\n# CaFi\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳104,347 for MLabs Research towards Tooling for Elliptical Curves\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23djskdpwsutv5xz34dz4nmkhvqfdxnmu7r7cfye4e2exc5slwpf`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe voted yes because we believe in the capabilities of the Mlabs team. We also see this tool providing developers with on-chain cryptographic flexibility, expanding the use case for Cardano's ZK, and paving the way for future innovations in privacy and authentication.",
