      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://QmTytk3hqEQucLMMdZdJu57ULo6pmDqvdaSypzJf21gywe -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳104,347 for MLabs Research towards Tooling for Elliptical Curves\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmauW7NBQ4MDaPU3Brc55Xtqo5C6JsWbVW8uCjZpAgWoUA\r\n\r\nThis is a clear and strategic **YES**. This proposal funds foundational, open-source tooling for advanced cryptography, a critical capability for Cardano's future.\r\n\r\nBy creating a flexible framework for ZK proofs, the expert MLabs team will empower our entire developer community to innovate in areas like privacy. This is a direct investment in ecosystem **growth** and is essential for future **scalability** and **interoperability** solutions. Funding this core, reusable infrastructure is an excellent use of the treasury.",
