      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmT3c8oYTnpkToSKsUGz6QURHX7RkbUzhLVu4Vv4zFCqtK -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳104,347 for MLabs Research towards Tooling for Elliptical Curves\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis should be voted for via the next Catalyst round and has no immediate need that would warrant me voting otherwise.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
