    {
      "voter": "Terminada",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminadaDrep/vote-contexts/refs/heads/main/20250726/014.jsonld -->\r\n# Terminada\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳104,347 for MLabs Research towards Tooling for Elliptical Curves\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytf9f78k7rkwk4cu6l2nvna22keu9yus4kqzc0hqspd36uszu0xc2`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis risks duplicating research currently underway at IOG.  It would be better to consider funding such a proposal via Project Catalyst after IOG has open sourced the Midnight code, which will happen shortly.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
