    {
      "voter": "AKYO",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmdBYzkAibAwd2T94gfg1FX6P7dbcUfqMbBQxinM1YnjRB -->\r\n# AKYO\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.3\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yts3qdjsqcnhld4r3uek2uu0n2tnh824tgnf75a83q3yhequuy54u`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n本提案に賛成します。Cardano憲法v2.3は、ガバナンスの基盤を明確にし、今後の意思決定をより透明で一貫した形で進めるための重要な更新だと考えます。\\\\n\\\\nI vote Yes on this proposal. The Cardano Constitution v2.3 strengthens the foundation of governance and provides clearer, more transparent guidance for future decision-making.",
