      "voter": "AtlasHub",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiaborkejd4vizl2jx5r7ff6vots224s7vmw2tf6rqgenughk2wqy4 -->\r\n# AtlasHub\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.3\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2dnsj0taktxwmzwf4a7sp0mg3rvm3jsetag0h0m83khs3c7d3l6x`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nToo many changes, unclear or ambiguous definitions and introduction of indeterminate legal terms (poor legal writing) as well as absolute unclear combined or unwanted side effects. As a very simple example among many other problem areas: The crucial difference that can exist between Ada Owners and Ada Holders is completely ignored (just think of trust relationships as a simple case).",
