      "voter": "Big Lazy Cat",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://doc.biglazycat.com/drep/c882f194684d672316212f01efc6d28177e8965b7cd6956981fe37cc6715961e_0.jsonld -->\r\n# Big Lazy Cat\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.3\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yffcjs0njfea09xhs6up429rhya5pxd7qz7hvmwq6vqy2nczwpj3g`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI support this proposal. A single voting round is sufficient, and removing the Budget Info Action improves efficiency. However, it's critical to enforce strict auditing and disbursement conditions to prevent treasury funds from being released without meeting the required standards, ensuring transparency and accountability.",
