      "voter": "Cardano Cypherpunks",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreiao4wgsmdvrjxk55ji7p6p5a73q63mngbaekju4ouk2zhmnltd3my -->\r\n# Cardano Cypherpunks\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.3\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y23wk4w6f2aumc92vl9m3x74xzm6jh4ha9wdq09yfq2sl6q8zlv4l`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWe really need to make the info-withdrawal action more smooth",
