    {
      "voter": "Dave",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://Qmc8qGKfnbVKTt6DuPSMBcoBbYP1xq9Xy8W37vHAYVm8GS -->\r\n# Dave\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.3\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygsgfhcydhlfglamhzkjn97rz3edef8a4z99fwl2frcwnrcmgurt3`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA [PDF version][pdf-link] of this rationale is also made available.\r\n\r\n[pdf-link]: https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmTWMFWPfEHU2QkSvXrrNYaSXAcewjmWUkyXu6PixGwWeq\r\n\r\nI am voting a strong **YES**. I credit the immense work that went into this responsible and mature evolution of our Constitution, which clearly incorporates extensive community feedback.\r\n\r\nThis is a major win for governance. Removing the redundant Budget Info Action streamlines the process and will significantly **reduce voter fatigue**. Crucially, it makes administrator and audit requirements mandatory for *all* treasury withdrawals. This is a non-negotiable upgrade for **sustainability** and a clear sign of our governance maturing.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
