      "voter": "Minh Le",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmPiCUzRgSNZhEoKbVTUK8MhjXxd6GGD9agZDcnQ3rXrZw -->\r\n# Minh Le\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** CARDANO BLOCKCHAIN ECOSYSTEM CONSTITUTION v2.3\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg6lvx8hrsjgex7f2p5waz5hqmwxzn7u8xljsuastt7s3qckz3maz`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI like this proposal, so I vote yes.",
