      "voter": "AustinAnthony",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmS71gLDKf6fAUCZr2Aj5ggeDwWweHAh2kp7Kv3qoMiKPU -->\r\n# AustinAnthony\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Summit 2026 and TOKEN2049 Singapore\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yg5v33dh3pvf9xelauyd5l9qsa3yd6lezf4u7kccp3xqwjspcz3py`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAbstain  but UPDATED to NO: Changing my vote officially to No. We need to build up Cardano Defi. Cardano is the compliance. If we have something good or unique the enterprises will come.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "voter": "benzio",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmTW8UZahU9TLgBjFhEX9dVgngk8bpLqhskJnRFn7JZK8R -->\r\n# benzio\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Summit 2026 and TOKEN2049 Singapore\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygwge9pgkeyd5eawz4y07mvkt09jkmx9d2levdzdcr6xl7s2nr4hy`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThere is no need for mundane events to prosper if the chain and the community is valid",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
