    {
      "voter": "Eternl DRep Committee",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tastenkunst/eternl-drep/refs/heads/main/gov_action_00081_vote_context.jsonld -->\n# Eternl DRep Committee\n\n**Proposal:** Cardano Summit 2026 and TOKEN2049 Singapore\n**Vote:** No\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y29h2q6cst2pvkl2sqqvf5ljcy36uv7pmy482xnczddzgqshus24w`\n\n---\n\nTL;DR: EDC votes NO on gov_action1hkgl5l4fknsf7aktmcatkz6kfl7xpvn7rzh5vnxwexl0n3cc6zrsqt5459v;\n\nThis combined proposal has been voted down by the community.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
