      "voter": "This Corrosion",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmRnXTRdR5RHtpYjvkXAmSVsGhCkmi6G6kUcEZVbXg97Wf -->\r\n# This Corrosion\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Cardano Summit 2026 and TOKEN2049 Singapore\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytkzpmmukjy6qn6xd5skqm0ypcj5juw9rxddr5mmlzgjvtcghwqjr`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNo, not again. You have had a whole year to figure out how to pay for this.",
