      "voter": "AltcoinOracle",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmY1MeU2Fc7GDwqrfhHsBuAYumnM4h9cH7dSnoUM5S8vVg -->\r\n# AltcoinOracle\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,500,000 for Complement Catalyst Extended Quadratic Funding---Zer\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygvgk3899qm38zth07z5clhfjvzfhe2mf2kvkqrfxp93r5srjre5s`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI vote NO as not my core DRep priorities and quite opaque.\r\n\r\nStrength and honor.",
