    {
      "voter": "BWtake(長崎)Japan",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/Qmf6AfypmxnEm6EQXEwzAafSzAi5iS2tmpjNTwx6hW9LBe -->\r\n# BWtake(長崎)Japan\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,500,000 for Complement Catalyst Extended Quadratic Funding---Zer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytcw6qzpqqclx2yd0zy64ztvlkkhnf6yrzza8whgnq4vz5gh89626`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n本提案は、Catalystを補完する形で二乗投票＋寄付マッチングを活用し、少額多数の意思を反映しやすくする資金配分モデルを提案しています。運用コストゼロで全額が支援対象に回る設計、実証済のSociousフレームワーク、ROIや透明性の課題への明確なアプローチを評価し、賛成します。\r\n********\r\nThis proposal introduces an extended quadratic funding model that complements Catalyst by democratizing fund allocation, enhancing ROI clarity, and operating at zero cost. Backed by the Socious platform and targeting known Catalyst pain points, I support it as a cost-efficient innovation mechanism.",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
