    {
      "voter": "Mike Rogero (羅邁凱）",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmYjB6E63JxL5oeQusCmb4QyKkMEwVQ5fkMJQVDdFWoD58 -->\r\n# Mike Rogero (羅邁凱）\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,500,000 for Complement Catalyst Extended Quadratic Funding---Zer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1y2lhe7wn2sr6vme8gnca4jrkhv47uh3tklsykmrqvwzdq4g5s8wju`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI am strongly in favor of improving the barriers to abuse and grifting the Catalyst project.",
