      "voter": "Patrick_Tobler",
      "content": "<!-- url: https://most-brass-sun.quicknode-ipfs.com/ipfs/QmSQpn1ngxy67tJPXmUf5JjHTpoNkFwSdDeb2DhMmj2j3g -->\r\n# Patrick_Tobler\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** Withdraw ₳1,500,000 for Complement Catalyst Extended Quadratic Funding---Zer\r\n**Vote:** Yes\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ygm9wxzrrdqpt0hek5kj7ys6tmsc8dycp7tkjwqxqrhjr6csq3s3t`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is a worthy endeavour, even though the ask is quite high.",
