    {
      "voter": "drep1yfd635ljn7qc0z2qu7pnch3skktqq74ff35pkreyql2f02cs34940",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreibm2nw3gcmofwukg2twm3ppzj3tzse4wvt7l4a4orq5tksmpavuly -->\r\n# drep1yfd635ljn7qc0z2qu7pnch3skktqq74ff35pkreyql2f02cs34940\r\n\r\n**Proposal:** IO & Midgard Labs L2 Scalability Initiative\r\n**Vote:** No\r\n**Voter ID:** `drep1yfd635ljn7qc0z2qu7pnch3skktqq74ff35pkreyql2f02cs34940`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nEven though I know the team behind this proposal and I’m aware that they are doing hard and phenomenal work, I honestly can’t give them my vote. With $ADA at 0.25, talking about L2 solutions when we barely fill blocks except during specific spikes of activity makes me feel that all efforts should be focused on Ouroboros Leios instead of being so fragmented into L2 initiatives. In the end, from a personal perspective and considering how blockchains are currently being used, I don’t think L2 solutions are necessary at this moment.",
