    {
      "voter": "Leo of the Brothership",
      "content": "<!-- url: ipfs://bafkreidd3grlvj4o4hquwm5fwnd6x7imydequoz6nhfrywp3vaavadee2e -->\n# Leo of the Brothership\n\n**Proposal:** IO & Midgard Labs L2 Scalability Initiative\n**Vote:** No\n**Voter ID:** `drep1ytw5tvdxpe39l9gm3g49gl0whwd2dgu4mcf5ml5z3zfuk3s8npegv`\n\n---\n\nWhile Phil is an excellent developer, he is stretched too thin and being involved in too much controversy lately. \n\nAdditionally I do not believe this work should be under IOG, IOG is our star development firm and should be protected from being stretched too thin, or centralizing too much of the Cardano stack around them.\n\nI would support a renewed proposal from Midgard labs, with Midgard Labs being in the driver seat, at a later date",
      "vote": "UNKNOWN"
